<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MAT" style="id">MAT-KUTU Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc1">Mbuli Inogile ya Yesu Kilisito yandikigwe na Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc2">Matayo</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mat</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mbuli Inogile ya Yesu Kilisito yandikigwe na</para>
  <para style="mt1">Matayo</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Matayo ya mumkumbo wa vitabu vine va lagano da sambi, vitabu avo volagusa vija Yesu viyakalile hano mwiisi. Kila kitabu acho chokemigwa, “Injili,” fambulo jake Mbuli Inogile. Vitabu avo vandikigwa ako kumwande na Matayo na Maluko na Luka na Yohana toka Yesu viyafile na kuzilibuka. Wanhu oifunza mbuli hawadijuwile siku diyandikigwe Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Matayo, lakini yogesigwa ikala behi na mwaka 60 toka kuvumbuka kwa Kilisito. Vivija ako kuyandikiligwe hakujuwike bule, lakini wanhu wayagwe ogesa yandikiligwa mwiisi ya Palesitina hebu sengine kudibuga da Yelusalemu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mwandikaji kakala Matayo yakalile mbokela kodi yang'hali hanakuwa mwanahina wa Yesu. Vivija twaga jake diyagwe dikala Levi. Matayo kakala imoja wa iwatumigwa longo na wabili. Matayo kawandikila Wayahudi, mbuli ino yojuwika kwa vilaguso kubanza 60 vilongigwe mna gamaandiko gang'alile ga lagano da umwaka. Matayo kalonda kulagusa kamba Yesu kakala Kilisito Mkombola, Imulungu kamsagula yawe Mkombola yalaguligwe mbuli zake. Vivija Matayo kandika mbuli nyingi za Undewa wa Imulungu. Wayahudi wagesa Kilisito Mkombola kokuwa Mndewa wa mwiisi ino. Matayo kakulema kutamanila kwao kwa kuwasimulila mbuli za kiloho za Undewa wa Imulungu.</para>
  <para style="ip">Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Matayo acho kitabu kinogile kwa kusongela lagano da sambi, kwavija kina vilaguso vose vilongigwe mna idilagano da umwaka. Kitabu kino cholumbiliza malagano mabili. Wanhu oifunza mbuli, vivija ogesa sengine Matayo kageza kwiga ivitabu vitano vandikigwe na Musa. Vitabu avo, avo vitabu va ichanduso va lagano da umwaka. Yesu viyawapetele wanhu kulugongo (Luka 5-7) yodaha kuigala na Imulungu viyamgwelele Musa malagizo. (Kumbukumbu da Malagizo 19:3-23:33).</para>
  <para style="iot">Mbuli zili mkitabu</para>
  <para style="io">Matayo kosonga kwandika Mbuli Inogile kwa kusimulila kuvumbuka kwa Yesu Kilisito na viyasongile sang'hano yake (Sula ya 1-4).</para>
  <para style="io">Abaho Matayo kosimulila sang'hano ya Yesu na mafundizo gake mengi (Sula ya 5-25).</para>
  <para style="io">Mbuli za kimambukizo za Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Matayo zizo zija za sang'hano ng'hulu ya Yesu nayo ayo ifa yake na kuzilibuka kwake (Sula ya 26-28).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MAT 1"/>
  <para style="s">Lukolo lwa Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 3:23-38">Luka 3:23-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 1:1"/>Kitabu cha lukolo lwa Yesu Kilisito mzukulu wa Daudi, mzukulu wa Abulahamu.<verse eid="MAT 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 1:2"/>Abulahamu kamulela Isaka, Isaka kamulela Yakobo, Yakobo kamulela Yuda na ndugu zake. <verse eid="MAT 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 1:3"/>Yuda kamulela Pelesi na Zela, mamao kakala Tamali, Pelesi kamulela Heziloni, Heziloni kamulela Alamu. <verse eid="MAT 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 1:4"/>Alamu kamulela Aminadabu, Aminadabu kamulela Nashoni, Nashoni kamulela Salimoni, <verse eid="MAT 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 1:5"/>Salimoni kamulela Boazi, mamake Boazi kakala Lahabu, Boazi kamulela Obedi, mamake Obedi kakala Lusi, Obedi kamulela Yese, <verse eid="MAT 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 1:6"/>Yese kamulela Mndewa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 1:6">Daudi kamulela Sulemani, mamake Sulemani kakala mwehe wa Ulia. <verse eid="MAT 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 1:7"/>Sulemani kamulela Lehoboamu, Lehoboamu kamulela Abiya, Abiya kamulela Asa, <verse eid="MAT 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 1:8"/>Asa kamulela Yehoshafati, Yehoshafati kamulela Yolamu, Yolamu kamulela Uzia, <verse eid="MAT 1:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 1:9"/>Uzia kamulela Yotamu, Yotamu kamulela Ahazi, Ahazi kamulela Hezekia, <verse eid="MAT 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 1:10"/>Hezekia kamulela Manase, Manase kamulela Amoni, Amoni kamulela Yosia, <verse eid="MAT 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 1:11"/>Yosia kamulela Yekonia na ndugu zake, kipindi kija Wayahudi viwahamizigwe kugaligwa Babeli.<verse eid="MAT 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 1:12"/>Viubitile uhamizo wa Babeli, Yekonia kamulela Shealitieli, Shealitieli kamulela Zelubabeli, <verse eid="MAT 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 1:13"/>Zelubabeli kamulela Abiudi, Abiudi kamulela Eliakimu, Eliakimu kamulela Azoli, <verse eid="MAT 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 1:14"/>Azoli kamulela Sadoki, Sadoki kamulela Akimu, Akimu kamulela Eliudi, <verse eid="MAT 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 1:15"/>Eliudi kamulela Eliazali, Eliazali kamulela Matani, Matani kamulela Yakobo, <verse eid="MAT 1:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 1:16"/>Yakobo kamulela Yusufu, mbigalo wake Malia, yamulelile Yesu yokemigwa Kilisito.<verse eid="MAT 1:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 1:17"/>Avo kukala na ng'holo longo na nne kulawa Abulahamu mbaka Daudi, na ng'holo longo na nne kulawa Daudi mbaka Wayahudi viwahamizigwe Babeli na ng'holo longo na nne toka viwahamizigwe Babeli mbaka kuleleka kwa Kilisito Mkombola.<verse eid="MAT 1:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvumbuka kwa Yesu Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 2:1-7">Luka 2:1-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 1:18"/>Kuvumbuka kwa Yesu Kilisito kukala vino, Malia yafungiligwe zengele na Yusufu, lakini wang'hali hawanakala hamoja kamba mbigalo na mtwanzi, Malia koneka kana inda kwa udahi wa Loho Yang'alile. <verse eid="MAT 1:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 1:19"/>Kwavija Yusufu kakala munhu yotenda ganogile, halondile kumgela kinyala Malia, avo kalonda kumuleka kinyelegezi. <verse eid="MAT 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 1:20"/>Viyakalile kogelegeza vivo, msenga wa kuulanga wa Mndewa kamulawila mzinzozi na kamulongela, “Yusufu mzukulu wa Daudi, sikuudumbe kumsola Malia yawe mwehe wako, kwavija inda yake kaipata kwa udahi wa Loho Yang'alile. <verse eid="MAT 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 1:21"/>Kolela mwana wa kimbigalo na gweye komgwaa twaga da Yesu, kwavija kowakombola wanhu zake mzinzambi zao.”<verse eid="MAT 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 1:22"/>Gano gose gatendeka kutenda galongigwe na Mndewa kubitila mtula ndagu wake galawilile, <verse eid="MAT 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 1:23"/>“Mhambe kogoga inda, na kolela mwana wa kimbigalo, nao omkema Imanueli,” fambulo jake, “Imulungu kahamoja na siye.”<verse eid="MAT 1:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 1:24"/>Avo Yusufu viyalamuke muutulo, kamsola Malia kamba viyalongeligwe na imsenga wa Mndewa. <verse eid="MAT 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 1:25"/>Lakini hatembele nayo mbaka viyalelile mwana na Yusufu kamgwaa twaga mwana ayo Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 1:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MAT 2"/>
  <para style="s">Wageni walawile mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 2:1"/>Yesu kavumbuka kudibuga da Beselehemu mwiisi ya Yudea, kipindi Helode viyakalile Mndewa. Aho viyavumbuke wanhu wayagwe wajuwile mbuli za nhondo weza kulawa mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wavika Yelusalemu. <verse eid="MAT 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 2:2"/>Wauza, “Kakwahi imwana yavumbuke yawe Mndewa wa Wayahudi? Kwavija tuyona nhondo yake kulawa mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa na siye twiza kumfugamila.”<verse eid="MAT 2:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 2:3"/>Mndewa Helode viyahulike vivo kanyawanyawa ng'hani na vivija kila munhu yakalile Yelusalemu kanyawanyawa. <verse eid="MAT 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 2:4"/>Kawakema hamoja wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa kawauza, “Vino Kilisito Mkombola kovumbukila kwahi?”<verse eid="MAT 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 2:5"/>Wamwidika, “Kovumbukila kudibuga da Beselehemu mwiisi ya Yudea, vivo yandike mtula ndagu wa Imulungu,<verse eid="MAT 2:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 2:6"/>‘Mweye wanhu wa Beselehemu mwiisi ya Yudea,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">buga jenu hadili dodo bule mna gamabuga ga Yuda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">kwavija kumwenu kolawa kilongozi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:6">yonda yawalongoze wanhu zangu wa Izilaeli.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 2:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 2:7"/>Avo Helode kawakema kinyelegezi wanhu waja ojuwa mbuli za nhondo kawauza kipindi gani nhondo viyoneke. <verse eid="MAT 2:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 2:8"/>Abaho kawatuma wachole Beselehemu na kuwalagiza, “Choleni mkazahile goya kuyali imwana, mwahamona nongeleni, nanie vivija nichole nikamfugamile.”<verse eid="MAT 2:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 2:9"/>Viwamalile kumtegeleza, walawanya, mnzila wayona nhondo iija iwayone mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa, iwalongolela na kwima hanhu aho kuyavumbuke imwana. <verse eid="MAT 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 2:10"/>Viwayone inhondo, wadeng'helela ng'hani. <verse eid="MAT 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 2:11"/>Avo wengila mng'anda, wamona imwana na Malia mamake, wamfugamila na kumtambikila. Abaho wamgwaa nhunza za zahabu, mavumba na mavuta ga bei ng'hulu gokemigwa manemane.<verse eid="MAT 2:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 2:12"/>Abaho wabwela ukayao kwa kubitila nzila iyagwe, kwavija Imulungu kawazuma mzinzozi sikuwabwele kwa Helode.<verse eid="MAT 2:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kukimbilila Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 2:13"/>Viwasegele msenga wa Mndewa kamulawilila Yusufu mzinzozi kamulongela, “Helode komzahila imwana yamkome. Avo lamuka umsole imwana na mamake mkimbilile Misili, na mukale kuko mbaka vonda nikulongele usegele.”<verse eid="MAT 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 2:14"/>Yusufu kalamuka, kamsola imwana na mamake kasegela ikilo acho na kuchola Misili, <verse eid="MAT 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 2:15"/>kakala ako mbaka Helode viyafile. Gano gatendigwa kutenda acho kiyalongile Mndewa kubitila mtula ndagu kilawilile, “Nimkema mwanangu kulawa Misili.”<verse eid="MAT 2:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kukomigwa kwa wana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 2:16"/>Helode viyajuwile kamba wanhu wacholile kumulola Yesu kulawa mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa wamvizila, kagevuzika ng'hani. Kalava lagizo da kuwakoma wana wose wa kimbigalo weli Beselehemu na hiwo weli behi, kusongela wana ving'hele mbaka wana weli na miyaka mibili ino itendigwa kamba viyajuwile kulawa kwa wanhu wacholile kumulola Yesu mna ikipindi viwayone inhondo.<verse eid="MAT 2:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 2:17"/>Kwa mbuli ino kilawilila kija kiyalongile Yelemia yakalile mtula ndagu wa Imulungu,<verse eid="MAT 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 2:18"/>“Sauti ihulikigwa mwiisi ya Lama,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">kulila na kuiyalala ng'hani.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">Laheli kowalilila wanage</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">nayo kolema kuhozigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 2:18">kwavija wafa.”<verse eid="MAT 2:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kusegela Misili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 2:19"/>Helode viyafile, msenga wa Mndewa kamulawilila Yusufu mzinzozi mwiisi ya Misili, <verse eid="MAT 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 2:20"/>kamulongela, “Lamuka umsole imwana na mamake, na ubweleganye mna iisi ya Izilaeli, kwavija wose walondile kumkoma imwana wafa.” <verse eid="MAT 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 2:21"/>Avo Yusufu kalamuka, kamsola imwana na mamake na kabweleganya mwiisi ya Izilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 2:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 2:22"/>Lakini Yusufu viyahulike Alikelao mwanage Helode, kahala Undewa wa tatake ako Yudea, kadumba kuchola kuko, kwavija kazumigwa ng'hani mzinzozi. Avo kachola mwiisi ya Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 2:23"/>Kahamila kudibuga da Nazaleti keka ukazi wake kuko. Avo kilawilile kija kiwalongile watula ndagu wa Imulungu, “Kokemigwa Mnazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 2:23"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MAT 3"/>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatizaji kowapetela wanhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Maluko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luka 3:1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yohana 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 3:1"/>Mna izisiku azo Yohana Mbatizaji keza kuluwala lwa Yudea, kasonga kuwapetela wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 3:2"/>Kawalongela, “Lekeni nzambi zenu kwavija Undewa wa kuulanga wammabehi!” <verse eid="MAT 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 3:3"/>Ayo Yohana, ayo munhu yalongigwe na mtula ndagu wa Imulungu Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">“Munhu imoja kokema kuluwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">‘Itandeni nzila ya Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 3:3">goloseni nzila yake yonda yabite!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 3:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 3:4"/>Kiwalo cha Yohana kitendigwa kwa mibahila ya ngamiya, na kavala mkwiji wa ng'hwembe mkigudi chake. Ndiya yake ikala nzige na uki. <verse eid="MAT 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 3:5"/>Wanhu wamcholela kulawa Yelusalemu, na isi yose ya Yudea na kulawa isi zose zili mmambwega bwega na ulwanda lwa Yolidani. <verse eid="MAT 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 3:6"/>Watogola hewo watenda nzambi na Yohana kawabatiza muulwanda lwa Yolidani.<verse eid="MAT 3:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 3:7"/>Yohana viyawone Mafalisayo na Masadukayo wengi omwizila yawabatize, kawalongela, “Mweye mizoka nani yawalongele modaha kuikimbila nhaguso yonda igaligwe na Imulungu? <verse eid="MAT 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 3:8"/>Musang'hane gaja gonda galaguse muzileka nzambi zenu. <verse eid="MAT 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 3:9"/>Sikumugelegeze kwa kulonga kamba Abulahamu heyo muhenga wetu. Nowalongela Imulungu kodaha kugasola mabwe gano na kugatenda lukolo lwa Abulahamu! <verse eid="MAT 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 3:10"/>Shoka ikigwa goya kukanha mibiki mna gamasina. Kila biki dileka kulela matunda ganogile dokanhigwa na kwasigwa muumoto. <verse eid="MAT 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 3:11"/>Niye nowabatiza mweye kwa mazi kulagusa muzileka nzambi zenu. Lakini yonda yeze kuchugu changu kowabatiza kwa Loho Yang'alile na kwa moto, heyo munhu mkulu kubanza nene, niye sifaya hata kupapa vilatu vake. <verse eid="MAT 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 3:12"/>Ayo kana lungo lwa kubetela uhule mmakono gake. Nayo kousola uhemba wake na kuwika kukanho, lakini koisoma imikumvi muumoto haufaga.”<verse eid="MAT 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubatizigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Maluko 1:9-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luka 3:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 3:13"/>Mna izisiku azo Yesu kasegela kulawa Galilaya kachola kuna ulwanda lwa Yolidani yakabatizwe na Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 3:14"/>Lakini Yohana kalonda kumgomesa Yesu, kalonga, “Niye nolondigwa nibatizigwe na gweye, habali kokwiza kumwangu?”<verse eid="MAT 3:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 3:15"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Leka sambi iwe vivo kwavija kwa kutenda vivo togatenda gaja gose golondigwa na Imulungu.” Avo Yohana katogola.<verse eid="MAT 3:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 3:16"/>Bahaja Yesu viyabatizigwe, kalawa mgamazi, ulanga ugubuka, na kamona Loho wa Imulungu kohumuluka kamba huwa na kakala uchanha yake. <verse eid="MAT 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 3:17"/>Abaho sauti ihulikigwa kulawa kuulanga ilonga, “Ino heyo mwanangu nimnogele, ninogezwa na heyo.”<verse eid="MAT 3:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MAT 4"/>
  <para style="s">Kugezigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Maluko 1:12-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luka 4:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 4:1"/>Abaho Loho Yang'alile kamulongoza Yesu yachole kuluwala yakagezigwe na Mwenembago. <verse eid="MAT 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 4:2"/>Kakala kuko siku malongo mane imisi na ikilo bila kuja. Viyamambukize siku azo, Yesu kona nzala. <verse eid="MAT 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 4:3"/>Abaho Mwenembago kamcholela kamulongela, “Kamba gweye kwa Mwana wa Imulungu kweli galagize mabwe gano gagaluke magate.”<verse eid="MAT 4:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 4:4"/>Lakini Yesu kamwidika, “Maandiko Gang'alile golonga, ‘Munhu hawa mgima kwa kuja kwiiyeka, lakini kwa kila mbuli ilawa mmulomo wa Imulungu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 4:5"/>Abaho Mwenembago kamsola Yesu mbaka Yelusalemu buga ding'alile, kamwika mna ikiswili cha Ing'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 4:6"/>Abaho kamulongela Yesu, “Kamba kweli gweye kwa Mwana wa Imulungu, ilagaze mwenyego hasi, kwavija Maandiko Gang'alile golonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">‘Imulungu kowalagiza wasenga zake wa kuulanga mbuli ya gweye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">nao okusola mmakono gao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:6">sikuuilumize magulu gako mgamabwe.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 4:7"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Vivija Maandiko Gang'alile golonga, ‘Sikuumgeze Mndewa Imulungu wako.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 4:8"/>Abaho Mwenembago kamsola Yesu mbaka uchanha ng'hani kulugongo lutali na kamulagusila undewa wa mwiisi yose na unovu wake. <verse eid="MAT 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 4:9"/>Mwenembago kamulongela, “Vino vose nokugwaa, kamba wahanifugamila na kunitambikila.”<verse eid="MAT 4:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 4:10"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Segela kumwangu Mwenembago! Kwavija Maandiko Gang'alile golonga, ‘Mtambikile Mndewa Imulungu wako, na umsang'hanile heyo yaiyeka!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 4:11"/>Baho Mwenembago kamuleka Yesu, na wasenga wa kuulanga weza wamsang'hanila.<verse eid="MAT 4:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kosonga sang'hano yake ako Galilaya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:14-15">Maluko 1:14-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luka 4:14-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 4:12"/>Yesu viyahulike Yohana Mbatizaji kagodekigwa kukifungo, kachola isi ya Galilaya. <verse eid="MAT 4:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 4:13"/>Hakalile Nazaleti lakini kachola kukala Kapelinaumu kudibuga dili behi na lamba da Galilaya, kuzimbaka za isi ya Zabuloni na Nafutali. <verse eid="MAT 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 4:14"/>Mbuli ino ilawilila kamba vija viyalongile mtula ndagu wa Imulungu Isaya,<verse eid="MAT 4:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 4:15"/>“Isi ya Zabuloni na isi ya Nafutali</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">nzila ya kucholela mbahali, umwambu uyagwe wa lwanda lwa Yolidani</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:15">Galilaya, isi ya wanhu haweli Wayahudi!<verse eid="MAT 4:15"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 4:16"/>Wanhu wakalile mdiziza</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">wawona mulenge wa ukombola wa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">Waja wose okala mwiisi ya sisila da ifa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 4:16">mulenge uwamwemwesela.”<verse eid="MAT 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 4:17"/>Kulawa kipindi acho Yesu kasonga kuwapetela usenga wake, “Lekeni nzambi zenu, kwavija Undewa wa kuulanga wammabehi.”<verse eid="MAT 4:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowakema wavula somba wane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Maluko 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luka 5:1-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 4:18"/>Yesu viyakalile kobita kumgwazo wa lamba da Galilaya, kawavika munhu na mkulu wake ovula somba. Wakala Simoni yakemigwe Petulo na mdodo wake Andeleya, wakala ovula somba mna dilamba na mizavu yao. <verse eid="MAT 4:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 4:19"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nikwelelezeni na niye nowatenda muwe wavulaji wa wanhu.” <verse eid="MAT 4:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 4:20"/>Bahaja waileka mizavu yao, wamkweleleza.<verse eid="MAT 4:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 4:21"/>Kagenda kumwande kawavika ndugu wabili wayagwe. Yakobo na Yohana wanage Zebedayo. Wakala mwiingalawa hamoja na tatao Zebedayo oitanda mizavu yao. Yesu kawakema, <verse eid="MAT 4:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 4:22"/>bahaja waileka ingalawa na tatao, na wamkweleleza Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 4:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowapetela wanhu na kuwahonya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luka 6:17-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 4:23"/>Yesu kachola mwiisi yose ya Galilaya, kafundiza mzing'anda za kumpula Imulungu na kawapetela wanhu Mbuli Inogile ya Undewa wa Imulungu na baho kawahonya wanhu wakalile na mitamu na magayo gose. <verse eid="MAT 4:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 4:24"/>Mbuli zake zenela mwiisi yose ya Siliya, avo wanhu wamgalila wanhu wose wakalile watamu, waja odununzika na kila utamu, weli na vinyamkela, na visango na waja waholole na Yesu kawahonya wose. <verse eid="MAT 4:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 4:25"/>Wanhu wengi wamkweleleza Yesu kulawa Galilaya na Dekapoli,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dekapoli </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Fambulo jake mabuga longo</char></note> kulawa Yelusalemu na Yudea na isi ya mwambu uyagwe wa lwanda lwa Yolidani.<verse eid="MAT 4:25"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MAT 5"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowapetela wanhu kulugongo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 5:1"/>Yesu viyaluwone lunhu lwa wanhu, kakwela kulugongo, kakala hasi. Wanahina zake wamcholela, <verse eid="MAT 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 5:2"/>na heyo kasonga kuwafundiza.<verse eid="MAT 5:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Deng'ho da kweli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:20-23">Luka 6:20-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 5:3"/>“Wamweda wanhu waja omtamanila Imulungu yaiyeka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:3">kwavija Undewa wa kuulanga uli wao!<verse eid="MAT 5:3"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 5:4"/>Wamweda wanhu waja onyunyuwala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:4">kwavija Imulungu kowahoza!<verse eid="MAT 5:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 5:5"/>Wamweda wanhu waja weli wahole,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:5">kwavija Imulungu kowagwaa isi yose.<verse eid="MAT 5:5"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 5:6"/>Wamweda wanhu waja weli na nzala na ng'hilu ya kutenda gaja goyolonda Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:6">kwavija Imulungu kowatenda wegute!<verse eid="MAT 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 5:7"/>Wamweda wanhu waja weli na bazi kwa wayagwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:7">kwavija Imulungu nayo kowonela bazi!<verse eid="MAT 5:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 5:8"/>Wamweda wanhu waja wailavile kwa Imulungu kwa mizoyo yao yose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:8">kwavija omona Imulungu!<verse eid="MAT 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 5:9"/>Wamweda wanhu waja otenda wanhu wailumbe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:9">kwavija okemigwa wana wa Imulungu!<verse eid="MAT 5:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 5:10"/>Wamweda wanhu waja odununzika mbuli ya kutenda gaja goyolonda Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 5:10">kwavija Undewa wa kuulanga uli wao!”<verse eid="MAT 5:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 5:11"/>“Mmweda mweye muligigwa na kudununzwa na kulongigwa vihile, kwavija mwa wanahina zangu. <verse eid="MAT 5:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 5:12"/>Sekeleleni na kudeng'helela, kwavija mwikiligwa nhunza ng'hulu kuulanga. Kwavija vino vivo wadununzwe watula ndagu wa Imulungu wakalile umwaka, mweye hamunavumbuka.”<verse eid="MAT 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mkele na mulenge</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:50">Maluko 9:50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34-35">Luka 14:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 5:13"/>“Mweye mulinga kamba mkele kwa wanhu wose wa mwiisi. Ila kamba mkele wahagiza ukali wake, vino ogeligwa choni mbaka ubweze ukali wake kabili? Haufaya bule, ila okwasigwa kunze na wanhu oubojoga.”<verse eid="MAT 5:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 5:14"/>“Mweye mulinga kamba mulenge kwa wanhu wa mwiisi. Buga dizengigwe kulugongo hadidaha kuifisa. <verse eid="MAT 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 5:15"/>Haduhu munhu yobwinha taa na kuigubika na kikalango, lakini koika kukingolobweda. Baho yomwemwesela kila munhu yeli mng'anda. <verse eid="MAT 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 5:16"/>Vivo ili kumwenu mweye, mulenge wenu uwamwemwesele wanhu wagone gaja ganogile gomtenda ili wamtogole Tataenu yeli kuulanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizo ga Musa na mafundizo ga watula ndagu wa Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 5:17"/>“Sikumugelegeze kamba nene niza kugasegesa Malagizo ga Musa hebu mafundizo ga watula ndagu wa Imulungu. Niye niza kutenda Malagizo gago gavikizwe. <verse eid="MAT 5:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 5:18"/>Nowalongela ukweli, mbaka ulanga na isi vosegela, haduhu hata mbuli ndodo ng'hani yonda isegesigwe mna Gamalagizo mbaka gose galongigwe gavikizwe. <verse eid="MAT 5:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 5:19"/>Munhu yoyose yolema kukweleleza lagizo dodo mna Gamalagizo gano na kuwafundiza wayagwe watende vivo, munhu ayo kokuwa mdodo mna undewa wa kuulanga. Lakini munhu ija yogagoga Malagizo na kuwafundiza wanhu wayagwe watende vivo, munhu ayo kokuwa mkulu Muundewa wa kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 5:20"/>Nowalongeleni, kamba hamutenda ganogile goyolonda Imulungu kubanza wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, hamwingila ng'o Muundewa wa kuulanga.<verse eid="MAT 5:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofundiza mbuli ya kugevuzika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:57-59">Luka 12:57-59</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 5:21"/>“Muhulika wanhu wa umwaka viwalongeligwe, ‘Sikumukome. Munhu yoyose yonda yakome yatagusigwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 5:22"/>Lakini niye nowalongeleni munhu yoyose yomwihila ndugu yake kotagusigwa. Munhu yoyose yombeza ndugu yake kolondigwa yagaligwe kukitala, na munhu yoyose yomkema ndugu yake, ‘Mbozi!’ ayo kolondigwa yengile muumoto wa jehanamu.<verse eid="MAT 5:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 5:23"/>“Avo kamba wahalonda kumulavila Imulungu nhunza muupango wa nhosa, na kokumbuka mugomba na ndugu yako, <verse eid="MAT 5:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 5:24"/>tanhu ileke nhunza yako aho hana uupango, chola hima ukailumbe na ndugu yako, na abaho ubwele umulavile Imulungu nhunza yako.<verse eid="MAT 5:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 5:25"/>“Munhu yahawa na mbuli na gweye na kolonda kukugala kuna ikitala, uilumbe nayo yang'hali hanakugala kukitala. Buleavo yahakugala kukitala, na kukwika mmakono ga msemi, nayo kokwika mmakono ga wakalizi, na gweye kogodekigwa mkifungo. <verse eid="MAT 5:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 5:26"/>Nokulongela kweli, mumo humulawa ng'o mbaka ulihe sente yose.<verse eid="MAT 5:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya ugoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 5:27"/>“Muhulika wanhu viwalongeligwe, ‘Sikumutende ugoni.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 5:28"/>Lakini niye nowalongela, munhu yoyose yonda yamulole mtwanzi kwa kumsulukila, munhu ayo katenda ugoni na mtwanzi ayo muumoyo wake. <verse eid="MAT 5:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 5:29"/>Avo kamba siso jako da mkono wa kudila dahakuhonza utende nzambi, ding'ole ujase. Kwavija yokuwa vinoga ng'hani gweye wagize kinhu kimoja cha lukuli lwako, kubanza lukuli lwako lose lwasigwe muumoto wa jehanamu. <verse eid="MAT 5:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 5:30"/>Kamba mkono wako wa kudila wahakuhonza utende nzambi, ukanhe uwase! Kwavija vinoga ng'hani kumwako wagize kinhu kimoja cha lukuli lwako kubanza lukuli lwako lose lwasigwe muumoto wa jehanamu.<verse eid="MAT 5:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fundizo da nyasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:9">Matayo 19:9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11-12">Maluko 10:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luka 16:18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 5:31"/>“Vivija muhulika wanhu viwalongeligwe, ‘Munhu yoyose yomwasa mwehe wake kolondigwa yamgwee kibua cha nyasa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 5:32"/>Lakini niye nowalongeleni, mbigalo sikuyamwase mwehe wake, ila kamba mtwanzi ayo katenda ugoni. Kwavija kamba yahamwasa, komtenda yawe mgoni, na mbigalo yonda yamsole mtwanzi ayo yasigwe vivija kotenda ugoni.<verse eid="MAT 5:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fundizo da kuiduwila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 5:33"/>“Muhulika wanhu wa umwaka viwalongeligwe, ‘Sikuuleke kutenda kija kiuiduwile, ila kolondigwa utende mbuli zose ziuiduwile kwa Mndewa.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 5:34"/>Lakini niye nowalongeleni, sikumuiduwile. Sikumuiduwile kwa ulanga, kwavija acho kigoda cha Imulungu, <verse eid="MAT 5:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 5:35"/>vivija sikumuiduwile kwa isi, kwavija aho hanhu ha kwikila magulu gake, hebu kwa Yelusalemu, kwavija dijo buga da Mndewa mkulu. <verse eid="MAT 5:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 5:36"/>Vivija sikuuiduwile kwa pala jako, kwavija hudaha kulutenda hata luvili lumoja luwe luzelu hebu lutitu. <verse eid="MAT 5:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 5:37"/>Wahalonga, ‘Ona’ iwe ‘Ona,’ hebu wahalonga, ‘Bule’ iwe ‘Bule.’ Mbuli yoyose iyagwe kubanza zino yolawa kwa Mwenembago.<verse eid="MAT 5:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kuliha gehile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:29-30">Luka 6:29-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 5:38"/>“Muhulika viilongigwe, ‘Siso kwa siso, na zino kwa zino.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 5:39"/>Lakini niye nowalongeleni, sikuumbwezele munhu yakutendele gehile. Munhu yahakutowa kanza da mkono wa kudila, muhindusile na da kumoso. <verse eid="MAT 5:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 5:40"/>Kamba munhu yahakugala kukitala kwa kulonda kusola shati jako, muleke yasole na koti jako. <verse eid="MAT 5:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 5:41"/>Kamba munhu kokunanahiza umpapile mzigo wake kwa utali wa kilometa imoja, umpapile kwa kilometa mbili. <verse eid="MAT 5:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 5:42"/>Munhu yahakupula kinhu mgwee, munhu yahalonda kukukopa sambi umulemele.<verse eid="MAT 5:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuwanogela wakwihile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:27-28">Luka 6:27-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:32-36">6:32-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 5:43"/>“Muhulika wanhu viwalongeligwe, ‘Wanogele mbwiga zako, na uwehile waja okwihila.’ <verse eid="MAT 5:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 5:44"/>Lakini niye nowalongeleni, wanogeleni wanhu owehila na wapulileni kwa Imulungu waja owadununza, <verse eid="MAT 5:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 5:45"/>baho mokuwa wana wa Tataenu yeli kuulanga. Kwavija heyo kowamwemwesela zuwa jake wanhu wehile na wanogile, na kowagwaa mvula waja otenda goyolonda na waja otenda gomgevuza. <verse eid="MAT 5:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 5:46"/>Vino Imulungu kowagwaa nhunza gani kamba muhawanogela waiyeka wanhu waja owanogela mweye? Vino hata wabokela kodi hawatenda vivo? <verse eid="MAT 5:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 5:47"/>Mwahawalamusa mbwiga zenu waiyeka, motenda kilozo gani? Vino hata wamhazi hawatenda vivo? <verse eid="MAT 5:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 5:48"/>Molondigwa mutelele kamba Tataenu yeli kuulanga viyatelele.<verse eid="MAT 5:48"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 5"/>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MAT 6"/>
  <para style="s">Fundizo da kuwataza wakiwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 6:1"/>“Iteganyeni, sikumutende mbuli zinogile mgameso ga wanhu ili wanhu wawatogole. Muhatenda avo Tataenu wa kuulanga honda yawagwee nhunza yoyose.<verse eid="MAT 6:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 6:2"/>“Avo kamba komgwaa kinhu munhu mkiwa, sikuutowe mhalati kutenda wanhu wakijuwe kija kiutenda, kamba viwotenda watapitapi mna izing'anda za kupulila na mna zinzila ili wanhu wawatogole. Nowalongeleni ukweli, awo wabokela mwaka nhunza yao yose. <verse eid="MAT 6:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 6:3"/>Lakini gweye wahamgwaa kinhu munhu mkiwa, mkono wako wa kumoso sikuujuwe kija kitendigwa na mkono wako wa kudila. <verse eid="MAT 6:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 6:4"/>Tenda avo kwa kinyelegezi. Tatako yolola gotendigwa kinyelegezi kokugwaa nhunza.<verse eid="MAT 6:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fundizo da kumpula Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:2-4">Luka 11:2-4</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 6:5"/>“Mwahampula Imulungu, sikumuigale na watapitapi! Kwavija awo wanogelwa kwima na kumpula Imulungu mna zing'anda za ukupula na mna zinzila mhanda, ili wanhu wawalole. Nowalongeleni ukweli, awo wabokela mwaka nhunza yao yose. <verse eid="MAT 6:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 6:6"/>Lakini gweye wahampula Imulungu, ingila mdigati jako, hinda lwivi lwako, umpule Tatako hakoneka. Tatako iyolola gaja gotendigwa kinyelegezi kokugwaa nhunza.<verse eid="MAT 6:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 6:7"/>“Mwahampula Imulungu, sikumulonge mbuli nyingi za chaka chaka kamba viwotenda wamhazi, kwavija ogesa ohulikigwa kwa mbuli zao nyingi. <verse eid="MAT 6:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 6:8"/>Sikumuigale na hewo, kwavija Tataenu kajuwa kija kimulonda mung'hali hamunampula. <verse eid="MAT 6:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 6:9"/>Lakini mweye puleni vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">‘Tataetu uli kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:9">twaga jako ditogoligwe,<verse eid="MAT 6:9"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 6:10"/>undewa wako wize,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:10">goulonda mwiisi gatendigwe, kamba viili kuulanga.<verse eid="MAT 6:10"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 6:11"/>Utugwee lelo ndiya yetu ya kila siku.<verse eid="MAT 6:11"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 6:12"/>Uzigele kumgongo nzambi zetu zitutendile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:12">kamba vija siye vituzigela kumgongo mbuli za wanhu wayagwe ziwatutendele.<verse eid="MAT 6:12"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 6:13"/>Sikuutugele mmagezo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">lakini utuhonye na ija Imdumuka.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 6:13">[Kwavija siku zose undewa ni wako na inguvu na ukulu. Ona.’]<verse eid="MAT 6:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 6:14"/>“Kamba mwahazigela kumgongo nzambi ziwawatendele wanhu, vivija Tataenu yeli kuulanga kozigela kumgongo nzambi zenu. <verse eid="MAT 6:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 6:15"/>Lakini kamba hamuzigela bule kumgongo nzambi za wanhu wayagwe, Tataenu yeli kuulanga nayo hazigela bule kumgongo nzambi zenu zimutendile.<verse eid="MAT 6:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fundizo da kufunga kuja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 6:16"/>“Mwahafunga kuja, sikumuwe kamba watapitapi, awo ovitenda vihanga vao vigele bazi ili wakoneke kamba wafunga kuja. Nowalongeleni ukweli, awo wabokela mwaka nhunza yao yose. <verse eid="MAT 6:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 6:17"/>Lakini gweye wahafunga kuja, sunha kihanga chako na ubunhe mvili zako, <verse eid="MAT 6:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 6:18"/>ili wanhu wayagwe sikuwakujuwe kamba kufunga kuja ila Tatako yaiyeka yoleka koneka, ayo yonda yajuwe. Nayo Tatako yolola gaja goutenda kinyelegezi kokugwaa nhunza.<verse eid="MAT 6:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ngama ya kuulanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:33-34">Luka 12:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 6:19"/>“Sikumwike ngama zenu mwiisi ino muli na ng'hobo na lungwi luzibananga, na wabavi okwingila na kwiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 6:20"/>Lakini mwike ngama zenu kuulanga, ako ng'hobo na lungwi havidaha kubananga, na wabavi hawadaha kwingila na kwiba. <verse eid="MAT 6:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 6:21"/>Kwavija kuko kuili ngama yako, vivija kuko kondauwe moyo wako.<verse eid="MAT 6:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mulenge wa lukuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:34-36">Luka 11:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 6:22"/>“Meso, gago taa ya lukuli. Kamba meso gako magima, lukuli lwako lose lokuwa na mulenge, <verse eid="MAT 6:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 6:23"/>lakini kamba meso gako gabanangika, lukuli lwako lose lokuwa mdiziza. Avo kamba mulenge ulimgati mmwako wahawa ziza, dokuwa ziza totolo!<verse eid="MAT 6:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumsang'hanila Imulungu na mali</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 16:13">Luka 16:13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:22-31">12:22-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 6:24"/>“Kuduhu munhu yodaha kuwasang'hanila wakulu wabili, kwavija komwihila imoja na kumnogela iyagwe, hebu koilumba na imoja na kumbeza iyagwe. Hamudaha kumsang'hanila Imulungu hamoja na mali.<verse eid="MAT 6:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 6:25"/>“Lekaavo nowalongeleni, sikumuugaiye ugima, kamba moja choni hebu mong'wa choni, hebu ng'huli zenu zovala choni. Vino ugima haunogile bule kubanza ndiya? Hebu lukuli halunogile bule kubanza viwalo? <verse eid="MAT 6:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 6:26"/>Waloleni bondwa, hawahanda, hawasenga, hebu kwika kukanho, lakini Tataenu yeli kuulanga kowadima. Vino mweye hamunogile ng'hani bule kubanza iwabondwa? <verse eid="MAT 6:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 6:27"/>Nani kumwenu kwa kuigaza ng'hani kodaha kwengeza hata saa dimoja da ugima wake?<verse eid="MAT 6:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 6:28"/>“Habali mogaiya viwalo? Loleni maluwa ga kumuhulo vigokula, hagasang'hana hebu kuitendela viwalo. <verse eid="MAT 6:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 6:29"/>Lakini nowalongeleni, hata mndewa Sulemani mwenyego na utajili wake wose, havalile goya kamba luwa dimoja mna gamaluwa gano. <verse eid="MAT 6:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 6:30"/>Kamba Imulungu heyo yodivaza jani da kumuhulo, lelo dabahano na mayo dokwasigwa muumoto, vino hondayawavaze ng'hani mweye? Mweye wanhu mutamanila kidogo!<verse eid="MAT 6:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 6:31"/>“Avo sikumuigaze kwa kulonga, ‘Toja choni?’ hebu, ‘Tong'wa choni?’ hebu, ‘Tovala choni?’ <verse eid="MAT 6:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 6:32"/>Kwavija vinhu vino vivo vowogaiya wamhazi. Tataenu yeli kuulanga kojuwa kamba movilonda vinhu vose avo. <verse eid="MAT 6:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 6:33"/>Lakini tanhu uzahileni Undewa wa Imulungu na gaja goyolonda, na vino vose mogweleligwa. <verse eid="MAT 6:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 6:34"/>Avo sikumugagaiye ga mayo, kwavija mayo yoigaiya yenyego. Kila siku yoigaiya yenyego.<verse eid="MAT 6:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 6"/>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MAT 7"/>
  <para style="s">Kuwatagusa wanhu wayagwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:37-38">Luka 6:37-38</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 6:41-42">41-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 7:1"/>“Sikumuwataguse wanhu wayagwe, avo na mweye sikumutagusigwe na Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 7:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 7:2"/>Kwavija vimuwatagusa wanhu wayagwe, na mweye motagusigwa vivo. Imulungu kowatendela vivija vimuwatendela wayagwe. <verse eid="MAT 7:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 7:3"/>Habali kolola kibanzi kili mdisiso da ndugu yako, lakini hulola biki dili mdisiso jako? <verse eid="MAT 7:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 7:4"/>Hebu kodahaze kumulongela ndugu yako, ‘Chonde leka nikulave kibanzi kili mdisiso jako,’ na kuno gweye mwenyego mdisiso jako mna biki? <verse eid="MAT 7:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 7:5"/>Gweye kwa mtapitapi! Tanhu lava biki dili mdisiso jako, abaho kodaha kulola goya na kulava kibanzi kili mdisiso da ndugu yako.<verse eid="MAT 7:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 7:6"/>“Sikumuwagwee umbwa vinhu vilavigwe kwa Imulungu, kwavija owahinduka na kuwaluma. Hebu sikumuwapigisile nguluwe lulu zenu, kwavija ozibojoga.<verse eid="MAT 7:6"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pula, zahila, gong'onda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:9-13">Luka 11:9-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 7:7"/>“Puleni, na mweye mogweleligwa, zahileni, na mweye movona, gong'ondeni ulwivi, na mweye movugulilwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 7:8"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yompula Imulungu kogweleligwa, na munhu yoyose yozahila kopata, na munhu yoyose yogong'onda ulwivi kovugulilwa. <verse eid="MAT 7:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 7:9"/>Vino kuna munhu yoyose kumwenu mweye kamba mwanage yahampula gate komgwaa dibwe? <verse eid="MAT 7:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 7:10"/>Hebu yahampula somba komgwaa zoka? <verse eid="MAT 7:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 7:11"/>Kamba mweye mmemile nzambi mojuwa kuwagwaa wanenu vinhu vinogile, avo Tataenu yeli kuulanga kowagwaa ng'hani vinhu vinogile wanhu waja ompula.<verse eid="MAT 7:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 7:12"/>“Avo watendeleni wayagwe gaja gose gomulonda mweye kutendeligwa, kwavija dino dijo fambulo da Malagizo ga Musa na mafundizo ga watula ndagu wa Imulungu.<verse eid="MAT 7:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lwivi msisili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:24">Luka 13:24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 7:13"/>“Ingileni kubitila lwivi msisili, kwavija lwivi lwa kwingilila kuna ukupotela lugazi, na nzila ilongoza kuko ibuha, na wanhu wengi obitila nzila ayo. <verse eid="MAT 7:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 7:14"/>Lakini nzila ilongoza kuugima ni ndodo na sisili, wanhu kidogo awo oyona.<verse eid="MAT 7:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biki na matunda gake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-44">Luka 6:43-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 7:15"/>“Iteganyeni na watula ndagu wa uvizi. Owezila kwa kukoneka kwa kunze kamba ng'hondolo, lakini mgati mmwao waigala na mbwizi. <verse eid="MAT 7:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 7:16"/>Mowajuwa kwa sang'hano zao, mkese haudaha kulela fulu na mgude haudaha kulela ngama. <verse eid="MAT 7:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 7:17"/>Vivija kila biki dinogile dolela matunda ganogile, na biki dihile dolela matunda gehile. <verse eid="MAT 7:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 7:18"/>Biki dinogile hadilela matunda gehile, na biki dihile hadilela matunda ganogile. <verse eid="MAT 7:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 7:19"/>Kila biki hadilela matunda ganogile dokanhigwa na kwasigwa muumoto. <verse eid="MAT 7:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 7:20"/>Avo mowajuwa watula ndagu wa uvizi kwa kija kiwosang'hana.<verse eid="MAT 7:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mweye siwajuwile bule</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:25-27">Luka 13:25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 7:21"/>“Siyo kila munhu yong'hema, ‘Mndewa, Mndewa’ kokwingila mna Undewa wa kuulanga, ila waja waiyeka otenda gaja goyolonda Tatangu yeli kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 7:22"/>Siku ya nhaguso yahavika, wanhu wengi onongela, ‘Mndewa, Mndewa! Kwa twaga jako tuwapetela wanhu usenga wa Imulungu, na kwa twaga jako tuwalava wanhu vinyamkela na kutenda unzonza!’ <verse eid="MAT 7:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 7:23"/>Abaho nowalongela, ‘Ka, mweye siwajuwile bule. Segeleni kumwangu, mweye wanhu mutenda gehile!’<verse eid="MAT 7:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wazengaji ng'anda wabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:47-49">Luka 6:47-49</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 7:24"/>“Munhu yoyose yohulika mbuli zangu na kuzigoga, ayo kaigala na munhu mbala yazengile ng'anda yake mdibwe kulu. <verse eid="MAT 7:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 7:25"/>Mvula itowa, vizanda vimema mazi, beho dibuma na kuitowa ng'anda ija, lakini hailagale bule, kwavija chandusilo chake kizengwa mdibwe.<verse eid="MAT 7:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 7:26"/>“Lakini munhu yoyose yohulika mbuli zangu na kolema kuzigoga, ayo kaigala na munhu mbozi yazengile ng'anda yake mumsanga. <verse eid="MAT 7:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 7:27"/>Mvula itowa, vizanda vimema mazi, beho dibuma na kuitowa ng'anda ija, nayo igwa kwa nguvu.”<verse eid="MAT 7:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Udahi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 7:28"/>Yesu viyamambukize kulonga avo, lunhu lose lwa wanhu lukanganya kwa mafundizo gake, <verse eid="MAT 7:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 7:29"/>kwavija hafundize kamba wafundiza wao wa Malagizo ga Musa, lakini kafundiza kwa udahi.<verse eid="MAT 7:29"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 7"/>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MAT 8"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu yeli na dikulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Maluko 1:40-45</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luka 5:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 8:1"/>Yesu viyahumuluke kulawa kukigongo lunhu lwa wanhu lumkweleleza. <verse eid="MAT 8:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 8:2"/>Munhu imoja yeli na utamu wa dikulu kamgendela Yesu, kamfugamila kalonga, “Go mkulu, wahalonda kodaha kunihonya.”<verse eid="MAT 8:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 8:3"/>Yesu kamgolosela mkono wake, kamkwasa munhu ayo kalonga, “Nolonda, hona!” Bahaja munhu ayo kahona. <verse eid="MAT 8:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 8:4"/>Abaho Yesu kamulongela, “Tegeleza! Sikuumulongele munhu yoyose, lakini goga inzila mbaka kwa mulava nhosa yakakulolese lolese. Abaho kalave nhosa kamba viyalagize Musa ili kutenda kila munhu yatogole kamba kuhonyigwa.”<verse eid="MAT 8:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya msang'hanaji wa mkulu wa wakalizi wa Lumi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:1-10">Luka 7:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 8:5"/>Yesu viyengile Kapelinaumu, mkulu imoja wa wakalizi wa Lumi kamgendela kampula yamtaze. <verse eid="MAT 8:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 8:6"/>Kalonga, “Go mkulu, msang'hanaji wangu kawasa ukae, kaholola na kolumwa ng'hani.”<verse eid="MAT 8:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 8:7"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Nochola kumuhonya.”<verse eid="MAT 8:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 8:8"/>Mkulu ayo kamwidika, “Go mkulu niye sifaya gweye wingile mng'anda yangu. Lakini longa mbuli na msang'hanaji wangu kohona. <verse eid="MAT 8:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 8:9"/>Na niye vivija na hasi ya udahi wa wakulu na nina wakalizi hasi yangu. Nahamulongela ino ‘Chola!’ nayo kochola, nahamulongela iyagwe ‘Izo!’ nayo kokwiza, vivija nahamulongela msang'hanaji wangu, ‘Tenda vino!’ nayo kotenda vivo.”<verse eid="MAT 8:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 8:10"/>Yesu viyahulike avo, kakanganya kawalongela waja wamkweleleze, “Nowalongeleni, sinamona munhu yoyose mwiisi ya Izilaeli yotamanila kamba ino. <verse eid="MAT 8:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 8:11"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli, wanhu wengi okwiza kulawa mwambu wa kudilawila zuwa na mwambu wa kudihongela, okala hamoja na Abulahamu na Isaka na Yakobo kuna indiya ako Kuundewa wa kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 8:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 8:12"/>Lakini waja walondigwe wawe muundewa wa Imulungu okwasigwa kunze kudiziza, ako olila na kudafuna meno.” <verse eid="MAT 8:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 8:13"/>Abaho Yesu kamulongela mkulu ayo, “Chola ukae, na kija chuupulile chotendigwa.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 8:13">Saa iija msang'hanaji wake kahona.<verse eid="MAT 8:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wanhu wengi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Maluko 1:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luka 4:38-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 8:14"/>Yesu viyacholile ukae kumwake Petulo, kamvika mkwe wa kitwanzi wa Petulo kawasa mulusazi, kolumwa homa. <verse eid="MAT 8:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 8:15"/>Yesu kamgoga mkono wake na homa imulawa, nayo kenuka kasonga kuwasang'hanila.<verse eid="MAT 8:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 8:16"/>Ichungulo viivikile, wanhu wamgalila Yesu wanhu wengi wakalile na vinyamkela. Yesu kawalava vinyamkela kwa kulonga na kawahonya wakalile watamu. <verse eid="MAT 8:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 8:17"/>Katenda avo ili kilawilile kija kiyalongile mtula ndagu wa Imulungu Isaya, “Heyo mwenyego kasola magayo getu na kapapa mitamu yetu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanahina wa Yesu viwolondigwa kukala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 9:57-62">Luka 9:57-62</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 8:18"/>Yesu viyaluwone lunhu lwa wanhu lumzunguluka, kawalagiza wanahina zake waloke mwambu uyagwe wa lamba. <verse eid="MAT 8:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 8:19"/>Mfundiza Malagizo ga Musa imoja kamcholela kamulongela, “Mfundiza, nokuwinza kokose kuuchola.”<verse eid="MAT 8:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 8:20"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Vizongo wana mhango na ndege wana mvulu, lakini Mwana wa Munhu kabule hanhu ha kubwihila.”<verse eid="MAT 8:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 8:21"/>Mwanahina wake imoja kamulongela, “Go mkulu, beta tanhu mbweleganye hamzike tatangu.”<verse eid="MAT 8:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 8:22"/>Lakini Yesu kamulongela, “Nikweleleze, waleke wanhu wafile wawazike wanhu wao wafile.”<verse eid="MAT 8:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kohoza beho</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Maluko 4:35-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luka 8:22-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 8:23"/>Yesu kengila mwiingalawa na wanahina zake wamkweleleza. <verse eid="MAT 8:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 8:24"/>Bahaja dilawilila beho kulu kudilamba, na mawimbi gamazi gaitowa ingalawa, mbaka ingalawa ilonda kudidimila. Lakini Yesu kakala yawasile. <verse eid="MAT 8:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 8:25"/>Wanahina zake wamgendela wamulamusa, wamulongela “Go mkulu, tukombole todidimila!”<verse eid="MAT 8:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 8:26"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Mweye mutamanila kidogo, habali modumba?” Avo kenuka kadikomhokela beho na ng'humbi ya mazi vinyamale na baho dinyamala kukala tuluu.<verse eid="MAT 8:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 8:27"/>Wanhu wakanganya, wauza, “Vino ino munhu gani? Mbaka beho na ng'humbi vomuhulika!”<verse eid="MAT 8:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wanhu wabili weli na vinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Maluko 5:1-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luka 8:26-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 8:28"/>Yesu viyavikile umwambu, mwiisi ya Gadala, kaiting'hana na wanhu wabili weli na vinyamkela, walawa kuna gamapanga. Wanhu awo wakala odumbigwa, avo kuduhu munhu yadahile kubita nzila ayo. <verse eid="MAT 8:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 8:29"/>Bahaja viwamone Yesu waguta mizangi olonga, “Gweye Mwana wa Imulungu, kotulonda choni? Kwiza kutudununza kipindi king'hali hakinavika?”<verse eid="MAT 8:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 8:30"/>Behi na hanhu aho hakala na bumbila da nguluwe oja. <verse eid="MAT 8:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 8:31"/>Avo vinyamkela wampula Yesu, “Wahatulava tuleke twingile mna iwanguluwe.”<verse eid="MAT 8:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 8:32"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Choleni,” Avo walawa na wengila mna iwanguluwe. Bumbila jose dihumulukila mna ingema ya dilamba na wose wafa mgamazi.<verse eid="MAT 8:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 8:33"/>Wasusilaji wa nguluwe awo wakimbila, wachola kudibuga, ako walonga mbuli zose zilawilile na walonga mbuli ya wanhu waja wakalile na vinyamkela. <verse eid="MAT 8:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 8:34"/>Avo wanhu wose walawa kudibuga dija, wachola kuiting'hana na Yesu. Na viwamone wampula yasegele mwiisi yao.<verse eid="MAT 8:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 8"/>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MAT 9"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu yaholole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Maluko 2:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luka 5:17-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 9:1"/>Yesu kengila mwiingalawa kaloka umwambu wa lamba kachola kudibuga diyakalile. <verse eid="MAT 9:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 9:2"/>Wanhu wayagwe wamgalila munhu yaholole lukuli, yatambalale mulusazi. Yesu viyone kutamanila kwao, kamulongela munhu ayo yaholole, “Mwanangu, gangamala! Nzambi zako zigeligwa kumgongo.”<verse eid="MAT 9:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 9:3"/>Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wayagwe wailongela, “Munhu ino komuliga Imulungu!”<verse eid="MAT 9:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 9:4"/>Yesu kajuwa viwagesile, avo kawalongela, “Habali mogesa gehile mna imizoyo yenu? <verse eid="MAT 9:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 9:5"/>Vino choni kibuhile kulonga, ‘Nzambi zako zigeligwa kumgongo,’ hebu kulonga, ‘Ima utembele’? <verse eid="MAT 9:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 9:6"/>Lakini nolonda mujuwe vino, Mwana wa Munhu kana udahi mwiisi wa kuzigela kumgongo nzambi za wanhu.” Avo kamulongela munhu ija yaholole, “Ima, papa lusazi lwako, uchole ukae kumwako!”<verse eid="MAT 9:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 9:7"/>Munhu ija kenuka kachola ukae kumwake. <verse eid="MAT 9:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 9:8"/>Wanhu viwonile avo, wadumba, wamtogola Imulungu kwa kuwagwaa wanhu udahi awo.<verse eid="MAT 9:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komkema Matayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Maluko 2:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luka 5:27-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 9:9"/>Yesu kasegela hanhu aho, na viyakalile kochola, kamona mbokela kodi, twaga jake Matayo, kakala hanhu hakulihila kodi. Yesu kamulongela, “Nikweleleze.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:9">Matayo kenuka, kamkweleleza.<verse eid="MAT 9:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 9:10"/>Yesu viyakalile koja mng'anda ya Matayo, wabokela kodi wengi na wanhu wehile weza, waja hamoja na Yesu na wanahina zake. <verse eid="MAT 9:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 9:11"/>Mafalisayo wayagwe viwone avo, wawauza wanahina zake, “Habali mfundiza wenu koja hamoja na wanhu wano?”<verse eid="MAT 9:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 9:12"/>Yesu viyahulike avo, kalonga, “Wanhu wagima hawamulonda mganga, ila wanhu watamu. <verse eid="MAT 9:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 9:13"/>Lakini choleni mkaifunze mna Gamaandiko Gang'alile, Imulungu kalonga, ‘Kinilonda niye bazi, siyo nhosa.’ Niye sizile kuwakema wanhu ogesa wanoga, lakini niza kuwakema wanhu wene nzambi.”<verse eid="MAT 9:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kufunga kuja</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Maluko 2:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luka 5:33-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 9:14"/>Wanahina wa Yohana Mbatizaji wamcholela Yesu wamuuza, “Habali siye tofunga kuja na Mafalisayo vivija ofunga kuja, lakini wanahina zako hawafunga kuja bule?”<verse eid="MAT 9:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 9:15"/>Yesu kawedika, “Vino yodahika vilihi wanhu wagonekigwe kuna idizengele wanyunyuwale kipindi munhu yosola kahamoja nao? Haidahika bule! Lakini kipindi chokwiza munhu yosola vonda yasegesigwe kumwao, aho ofunga kuja.”<verse eid="MAT 9:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 9:16"/>“Kuduhu munhu yokwika kilaka cha sambi mna ikiwalo cha umwaka, yahatenda vivo kilaka cha sambi chokidega kiwalo cha umwaka na aho hadegeke hokongezeka.”<verse eid="MAT 9:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 9:17"/>“Vivija kuduhu munhu yogida divai ya sambi mna imifuko ya ng'hwembe ya umwaka, kwavija yahatenda avo imifuko ayo yotulika, divai yokwitika na imifuko yobanangika. Ila divai ya sambi yogidigwa mna imifuko ya ng'hwembe ya sambi, vose vokuwa vigima.”<verse eid="MAT 9:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mndele wa mkulu imoja na mtwanzi mtamu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Maluko 5:21-43</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luka 8:40-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 9:18"/>Yesu viyakalile kolonga avo, mkulu wa Wayahudi kamgendela kamfugamila kalonga, “Mwanangu kafa, nokupula tuchole ukamwikile makono, nayo kokuwa mgima.”<verse eid="MAT 9:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 9:19"/>Yesu na wanahina zake wenuka, wachola hamoja nayo.<verse eid="MAT 9:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 9:20"/>Mtwanzi imoja yakalile na utamu wa kutumika kwa miyaka longo na mibili, kamcholela Yesu kuchugu, kakwasa mhindo ya kiwalo chake. <verse eid="MAT 9:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 9:21"/>Kailongela mwenyego, “Nahakwasa kiwalo chake, nohona.”<verse eid="MAT 9:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 9:22"/>Yesu kahinduka, kamona mtwanzi ayo, kamulongela, “Mndele, gangamala! Kutamanila kwako kukuhonya.” Bahaja mtwanzi ija kahona.<verse eid="MAT 9:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 9:23"/>Yesu viyengile mna ing'anda ya mkulu ija, kawona watowa ving'weng'we va nyila za ndilo na lunhu lwa wanhu lukala lolila. <verse eid="MAT 9:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 9:24"/>Kawalongela, “Laweni kunze. Imwana hafile bule, ila kawasa!” Nao wamseka. <verse eid="MAT 9:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 9:25"/>Lunhu lwa wanhu vilulawile kunze, Yesu kengila kudigati da mndele ayo, kamgoga mkono wake, nayo kenuka. <verse eid="MAT 9:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 9:26"/>Mbuli ayo ibwililika kila hanhu mwiisi ija.<verse eid="MAT 9:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wasuwameso wabili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 9:27"/>Yesu kasegela hanhu aho, viyakalile kochola wanhu wabili wasuwameso wamkweleleza kuno okemelela, “Mwana wa Daudi, tonele bazi!”<verse eid="MAT 9:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 9:28"/>Yesu viyengile mng'anda, wasuwameso waja wabili wamgendela, Yesu kawauza, “Motogola kamba nodaha kuwahonya?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 9:28">Wamwidika, “Ona, go mkulu!”<verse eid="MAT 9:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 9:29"/>Yesu kawakwasa meso gao, kalonga, “Ilawilile kamba vimutogola.” <verse eid="MAT 9:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 9:30"/>Meso gao galola, Yesu kawazuma ng'hani, “Sikumumulongele munhu yoyose mbuli ino!”<verse eid="MAT 9:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 9:31"/>Lakini wao wachola, wazibwililisa mbuli za Yesu mwiisi ija yose.<verse eid="MAT 9:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya munhu halonga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 9:32"/>Wanhu viwakalile osegela, wanhu wayagwe wamgalila Yesu munhu yakalile halonga, kwavija kakala na kinyamkela. <verse eid="MAT 9:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 9:33"/>Kinyamkela viyalavigwe, munhu ija yakalile halonga, kasonga kulonga. Wanhu wakanganya na kulonga, “Hatunachona kinhu kamba kino mwiisi ya Izilaeli!”<verse eid="MAT 9:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 9:34"/>Lakini Mafalisayo walonga, “Kana mwenembago ayo yomgwaa udahi wa kuwalava vinyamkela.”<verse eid="MAT 9:34"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowonela bazi wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 9:35"/>Yesu kachola mna gamabuga gose na ivijiji, kafundiza mna izing'anda zao za kumpula Imulungu, kawapetela Mbuli Inogile ya Undewa wa Imulungu na kuwahonya wanhu weli na mitamu na magayo. <verse eid="MAT 9:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 9:36"/>Yesu viyawone wanhu, kawonela bazi kwavija wakala ogaya na haduhu munhu wa kuwataza, kamba ng'hondolo welibule msusilaji. <verse eid="MAT 9:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 9:37"/>Abaho kawalongela wanahina zake, “Ndiya nyingi, lakini wasang'hanaji wadodo. <verse eid="MAT 9:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 9:38"/>Mpuleni Mndewa wa indiya, yawatume wasang'hanaji mumgunda wake.”<verse eid="MAT 9:38"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 9"/>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MAT 10"/>
  <para style="s">Watumigwa longo na wabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Maluko 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luka 6:12-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 10:1"/>Yesu kawakema wanahina zake longo na wabili na kawagwaa udahi wa kulava vinyamkela, kuhonya mitamu na magayo. <verse eid="MAT 10:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 10:2"/>Gano gago matwaga ga watumigwa longo na wabili, wa ichanduso Simoni yakemigwe Petulo na ndugu yake Andeleya, Yakobo na ndugu yake Yohana wana wa Zebedayo. <verse eid="MAT 10:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 10:3"/>Filipo na Batulumayo, Tomaso na Matayo mbokela kodi, Yakobo mwana wa Alufayo, na Tadayo, <verse eid="MAT 10:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 10:4"/>Simoni Mkananayo, na Yuda Isikaliote, yamuhinduke Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 10:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sang'hano ya watumigwa longo na wabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Maluko 6:7-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luka 9:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 10:5"/>Yesu kawatuma watumigwa wano longo na wabili kawalagiza, “Sikumuchole kwa wanhu wamhazi, hebu kwingila mna gamabuga ga Wasamalia. <verse eid="MAT 10:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 10:6"/>Ila choleni kwa wanhu wa isi ya Izilaeli waigalile na ng'hondolo wapotele. <verse eid="MAT 10:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 10:7"/>Mwahachola, wapeteleni usenga uno, ‘Undewa wa kuulanga wammabehi!’ <verse eid="MAT 10:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 10:8"/>Muwahonye watamu, wazilibuleni wafile, muwahonye waja weli na utamu wa dikulu, muwalave vinyamkela. Mugweleligwa bule, laveni bule. <verse eid="MAT 10:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 10:9"/>Mna imifuko yenu, sikumusole zahabu hebu shaba hebu sente. <verse eid="MAT 10:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 10:10"/>Muumwanza wenu, sikumusole mkoba hebu viwalo vibili hebu vilatu hebu mkongoja. Kwavija msang'hanaji kolondigwa yagweleligwe kija kilondigwa.<verse eid="MAT 10:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 10:11"/>“Mwahengila mna dibuga jojose hebu mna ikijiji, mumzahile munhu yonda yawabokele, kaleni ukae kumwake mbaka vonda musegele. <verse eid="MAT 10:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 10:12"/>Mwahengila mng'anda, walamuseni wenekae. <verse eid="MAT 10:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 10:13"/>Wanhu wa ng'anda ayo wahawabokela goya, tindiwalo jenu dokala nao, kamba wahaleka kuwabokela, tindiwalo jenu dowabweleleni mweye. <verse eid="MAT 10:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 10:14"/>Munhu yoyose yahalema kuwabokela hebu kuwategeleza, vonda musegele baho kung'huseni matimbwisi mmagulu genu kamba kilaguso cha kuwalema. <verse eid="MAT 10:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 10:15"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli mna isiku ya nhaguso Imulungu kowonela bazi wanhu wa buga da Sodoma na Gomola kubanza buga dijo.”<verse eid="MAT 10:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Madununzo gonda geze</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:9-13">Maluko 13:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:12-17">Luka 21:12-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 10:16"/>“Nowatuma kamba ng'hondolo hagati ya mbwizi. Avo muwe wabala kamba zoka na wahole kamba huwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 10:17"/>Muiteganye na wanhu, kwavija owagala mna ivitala, owatowa mbalati mna izing'anda za kumpula Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 10:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 10:18"/>Mbuli ya niye mogaligwa haulongozi ha wakulu na wandewa, ili muwalongele wao na wamhazi Mbuli Inogile. <verse eid="MAT 10:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 10:19"/>Vonda wawagale mkitala, sikumugese gaja gondamulonge, kipindi chahavika mogweleligwa cha kulonga.” <verse eid="MAT 10:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 10:20"/>Kwavija siyo mweye mondamulonge, lakini Loho wa Tataenu kolonga kubitila mweye.<verse eid="MAT 10:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 10:21"/>“Munhu komuhinduka ndugu yake too yakomigwe na tata komuhinduka mwanage yakomigwe, na wana owahinduka tata zao na mama zao wakomigwe. <verse eid="MAT 10:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 10:22"/>Wanhu wose owehila mweye mbuli ya twaga jangu. Lakini yoyose yonda yafunge umoyo mbaka kukimambukizo, kokomboligwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 10:23"/>Wahawadununza kudibuga dimoja, kimbilileni kudibuga diyagwe, nowalongeleni ukweli, hamumambukiza sang'hano yenu kuna gamabuga gose ga Izilaeli yang'hali Mwana wa Munhu hanakwiza.<verse eid="MAT 10:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 10:24"/>“Mwanahina hali mkulu kubanza mfundiza wake, wala mtumwa hambita mndewa wake. <verse eid="MAT 10:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 10:25"/>Vimnogela mwanahina kuigala na mfundiza wake na mtumwa kuigala na mndewa wake. Kamba mkulu wa ng'anda kakemigwa Belizebuli, vino wanhu wa ng'anda yake honda wakemigwe matwaga gehile ng'hani?”<verse eid="MAT 10:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nani wa kumdumba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:2-7">Luka 12:2-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 10:26"/>“Avo sikumuwadumbe wanhu. Chochose kigubikigwe chogubuligwa na chochose kifisigwe chokoneka. <verse eid="MAT 10:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 10:27"/>Kiniwalongeleni mdiziza, mkilonge imisi, na mbuli imuihulike kwa kinyelegezi, mweye ilongeni mkiswili. <verse eid="MAT 10:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 10:28"/>Sikumuwadumbe waja iwokoma lukuli, lakini hawadaha kuikoma loho, ila mumdumbe Imulungu yodaha kulukoma lukuli na loho muumoto wa jehanamu. <verse eid="MAT 10:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 10:29"/>Vino nhongwa wabili hawauzigwa kwa sente imoja? Lakini kuduhu hata imoja wao yofa bila Tataenu kujuwa. <verse eid="MAT 10:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 10:30"/>Lakini mweye, hata mvili zili mmapala genu zipetigwa zose. <verse eid="MAT 10:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 10:31"/>Avo sikumudumbe, mweye munoga ng'hani kubanza nhongwa wengi!”<verse eid="MAT 10:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumtogola na kumulema Kilisito</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:8-9">Luka 12:8-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 10:32"/>“Munhu yoyose yonitogola niye mgameso ga wanhu na niye nomtogola mgameso ga Tatangu yeli kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 10:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 10:33"/>Lakini munhu yoyose yonibela niye mgameso ga wanhu na niye nombela mgameso ga Tatangu yeli kuulanga.”<verse eid="MAT 10:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Sizile kugala tindiwalo ila zele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:51-53">Luka 12:51-53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:26-27">14:26-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 10:34"/>“Sikumugese kamba niza kugala tindiwalo kwa wanhu wa mwiisi. Sizile kugala tindiwalo, ila zele. <verse eid="MAT 10:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 10:35"/>Kwavija niza kuwagola wana na tata zao wandele na mama zao, wandele na wakwe zao wa kitwanzi. <verse eid="MAT 10:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 10:36"/>Wehi wa munhu ni wanhu wa mng'anda mmwake.<verse eid="MAT 10:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 10:37"/>“Munhu yoyose yomnogela tatake hebu mamake kubanza niye hafaya yawe mwanahina wangu. Na munhu yoyose yowanogela wanage hebu mndele wake kubanza niye hafaya yawe mwanahina wangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 10:38"/>Munhu yoyose yoleka kupapa msalaba wake na kunikweleleza niye, hafaya yawe mwanahina wangu. <verse eid="MAT 10:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 10:39"/>Munhu yougomesa ugima wake kowagiza lakini munhu youlava ugima wake mbuli ya niye, koupata.<verse eid="MAT 10:39"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhunza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:41">Maluko 9:41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 10:40"/>“Munhu yoyose yowabokela mweye kombokela niye, na munhu yoyose yombokela niye kombokela ija yanhumile. <verse eid="MAT 10:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 10:41"/>Munhu yoyose yombokela mtula ndagu wa Imulungu, kwavija ayo mtula ndagu wa Imulungu, kobokela nhunza ya munhu ayo. Na munhu yoyose yombokela munhu yanogile, kwavija heyo kanoga kobokela nhunza ya munhu ayo. <verse eid="MAT 10:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 10:42"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli, munhu yoyose yomgwaa mwanahina kikasi cha mazi govega kwavija heyo imoja wa wanahina zangu wadodo, kobokela nhunza yake.”<verse eid="MAT 10:42"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 10"/>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MAT 11"/>
  <para style="s">Yohana Mbatizaji kowatuma wanahina zake kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 7:18-35">Luka 7:18-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 11:1"/>Yesu viyamambukize kuwagwaa malagizo gano wanahina zake longo na wabili, kasegela hanhu aho, kachola kufundiza na kuwapetela wanhu mna gamabuga ga Galilaya.<verse eid="MAT 11:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 11:2"/>Yohana Mbatizaji yakalile mkifungo viyahulike gaja gayakalile yotenda Kilisito, kawatuma wanahina zake kwa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 11:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 11:3"/>Wamuuza Yesu, “Vino gweye heyo ija iyalongile Yohana kokwiza, hebu tumbete iyagwe?”<verse eid="MAT 11:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 11:4"/>Yesu kawedika, “Bweleni mkamulongele Yohana gaja gomuhulika na kugona, <verse eid="MAT 11:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 11:5"/>wasuwameso olola, mbetembete otembela, na weli na utamu wa dikulu ohonyigwa na wanhu hawahulika ohulika, wafile ozilibuka na wakiwa opeteligwa Mbuli Inogile. <verse eid="MAT 11:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 11:6"/>Wamweda waja wose weliduhu shaka na niye!”<verse eid="MAT 11:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 11:7"/>Wanahina wa Yohana viwakalile osegela, Yesu kasonga kululongela lunhu mbuli za Yohana, “Vino vimucholile kuluwala muchola kulola choni? Muchola kulola lusanze vilutigisigwa na beho? <verse eid="MAT 11:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 11:8"/>Kumbe muchola kulola choni? Muchola kumulola munhu yavalile viwalo vinogile? Wanhu ovala kamba avo okala mna zing'anda za Wandewa! <verse eid="MAT 11:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 11:9"/>Nongeleni, vino muchola kulola choni? Muchola kumulola mtula ndagu wa Imulungu? Ona, lakini mona vingi ng'hani kubanza mtula ndagu wa Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 11:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 11:10"/>Kwavija Yohana ayo yalongigwe mna Gamaandiko Gang'alile, ‘Imulungu kalonga, nomtuma msenga wangu yakulongolele, yaitande nzila yako.’ <verse eid="MAT 11:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 11:11"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli, hanalawilila munhu yoyose yeli munhu mkulu kubanza Yohana Mbatizaji. Lakini yeli munhu mdodo ng'hani Muundewa wa kuulanga ni munhu mkulu kubanza Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 11:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 11:12"/>Kulawa kipindi cha Yohana Mbatizaji mbaka sambi, wanhu waulema kwa nguvu Undewa wa kuulanga na wanhu wene nguvu ogeza kuuboka. <verse eid="MAT 11:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 11:13"/>Kwavija Malagizo ga Musa na watula ndagu wa Imulungu, galonga mbuli ya undewa mbaka kwiza kwa Yohana Mbatizaji. <verse eid="MAT 11:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 11:14"/>Mwahazitogola mbuli zao, Yohana heyo Eliya yalongigwe kokwiza. <verse eid="MAT 11:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 11:15"/>Yeli na magwiti yahulike!<verse eid="MAT 11:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 11:16"/>“Vino wanhu wa lukolo lwa sambi waigala na choni? Waigala na wana wadodo wakalile mna gamagulilo. Kibumbila kimoja chokemelela kiyagwe, <verse eid="MAT 11:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 11:17"/>‘Tuwatowela gombe sugu, lakini hamuvinile bule! Tuwembila nyila za kuiyalala, lakini hamulilile bule!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 11:18"/>Kwavija Yohana viyezile kafunga kuja na hang'wile divai, nao walonga, ‘Kana kinyamkela!’ <verse eid="MAT 11:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 11:19"/>Mwana wa Munhu viyezile, kaja na kung'wa, nao walonga, ‘Muloleni munhu ino! Mmelo na mlevi, mbwiga zake wabokela kodi na wanhu wene nzambi!’ Lakini nzewele ya Imulungu yokoneka inoga kwa sang'hano zake.”<verse eid="MAT 11:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mabuga golema kutogola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luka 10:13-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 11:20"/>Yesu kasonga kuwakomhokela wanhu wa mabuga gayatendile unzonza mwingi, kwavija wanhu awo hawazilekile bule nzambi zao. <verse eid="MAT 11:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 11:21"/>“Kogaya, gweye buga da Kolazini! Kogaya gweye buga da Betisaida! Maza unzonza utendigwe kumwenu mweye, wahatendigwe mna gamabuga ga Tilo na Sidoni, wanhu zake wahalekile mwaka nzambi zao na kuvala magunia na kuibakaza mitozi, kulagusa kamba waleka nzambi zao! <verse eid="MAT 11:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 11:22"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli, siku ya nhaguso Imulungu kowonela bazi wanhu wa isi za Tilo na Sidoni kubanza mweye! <verse eid="MAT 11:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 11:23"/>Vivija na gweye Kapelinaumu! Vino kolonda kuinula mwenyego mbaka kuulanga? Kohumulusigwa mbaka kowochola wanhu wafile! Maza unzonza utendigwe kumwako gweye wahatendigwe Sodoma, isi ayo yahasigale mbaka lelo! <verse eid="MAT 11:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 11:24"/>Nowalongeleni, mna isiku ya nhaguso Imulungu kowonela bazi wanhu wa isi ya Sodoma kubanza mweye!”<verse eid="MAT 11:24"/></para>
  <para style="s">Izoni kumwangu mubwihile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 10:21-22">Luka 10:21-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 11:25"/>Mna ikipindi acho Yesu kalonga, “Tata, Mndewa wa kuulanga na mwiisi, nokutogola kwavija kuwafisa mbuli zino wanhu weli na nzewele na ubala, na kuwagubulila wana wadodo. <verse eid="MAT 11:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 11:26"/>Ona, Tata, vino vivo viulondile.<verse eid="MAT 11:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 11:27"/>“Tatangu kanigwaa vinhu vose. Kuduhu munhu yamjuwile Mwana ila Tata yaiyeka, na kuduhu munhu yamjuwile Tata, ila Mwana yaiyeka na waja Mwana yawasagule kuwagubulila wamjuwe Tata.<verse eid="MAT 11:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 11:28"/>“Izoni kumwangu mweye mose mugaya na kulemelwa na mizigo mikulu, na niye nowatenda mubwihile. <verse eid="MAT 11:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 11:29"/>Soleni nila yangu muifunze kumwangu, kwavija niye simgaza munhu hebu kumbezeli, na mweye mokala mizoyo iholile. <verse eid="MAT 11:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 11:30"/>Kwavija nila yangu ibuha na mizigo yonda niwadikwe mibewe.”<figure style="fig" file="13 Yoke.jpg" size="col" ref="11:30">Ng'ombe wabili wafungigwa nila walime mgunda</figure><verse eid="MAT 11:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 11"/>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MAT 12"/>
  <para style="s">Mndewa wa Kubwihila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Maluko 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luka 6:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 12:1"/>Mna ikipindi acho, Yesu kakala yobita mna imigunda ya uhemba, mwiisiku ya Kubwihila. Wanahina zake wakala na nzala, avo wasonga kuhulula uhemba na kuja. <verse eid="MAT 12:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 12:2"/>Mafalisayo viwonile avo, wamulongela Yesu, “Lola, wanahina zako otenda kinhu kigomesigwe kutendigwa mwiisiku ya Kubwihila!”<verse eid="MAT 12:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 12:3"/>Yesu kawedika, “Hamusomile kija kiyatendile Daudi, kipindi heyo na wayage viwakalile na nzala? <verse eid="MAT 12:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 12:4"/>Kengila Mng'anda ya Imulungu, heyo na wayage wagaja magate galavigwe nhosa kwa Imulungu, hamoja hailondeke wao wagaje, ila walava nhosa waiyeka. <verse eid="MAT 12:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 12:5"/>Vino hamusomile mna Gamalagizo ga Musa, kila siku ya Kubwihila walava nhosa obena lagizo da siku ya Kubwihila mna Ing'anda ya Imulungu, na hawakoneka kamba wabananga? <verse eid="MAT 12:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 12:6"/>Nowalongeleni hano hana munhu mkulu kubanza Ng'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 12:7"/>Maza mujuwile fambulo da ulonzi uno, ‘Nolonda bazi, silonda sadaka,’ sambi muwataguse wanhu welibule gehile. <verse eid="MAT 12:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 12:8"/>Kwavija Mwana wa Munhu heyo Mndewa wa Kubwihila.”<verse eid="MAT 12:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Munhu yeli na mkono uholole</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Maluko 3:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luka 6:6-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 12:9"/>Yesu kasegela hanhu aho kengila mng'anda ya kumpula Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 12:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 12:10"/>Ako kukala na munhu yakalile na mkono uholole. Wanhu wayagwe wakalile aho walonda kilamuso cha kumtagusila, avo wamuuza Yesu, “Vino Malagizo getu gogomesa kumuhonya munhu mwiisiku ya Kubwihila?”<verse eid="MAT 12:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 12:11"/>Yesu kawedika, “Vino kamba munhu imoja kumwenu kana ng'hondolo wake kengila mdikolombo mwiisiku ya Kubwihila, hamulava kunze bule? <verse eid="MAT 12:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 12:12"/>Vino munhu hanogile bule kubanza ng'hondolo? Avo malagizo getu gotulonda kusang'hana ganogile mwiisiku ya Kubwihila.” <verse eid="MAT 12:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 12:13"/>Abaho kamulongela munhu ija yaholole mkono, “Golosa mkono wako.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 12:13">Avo kaugolosa mkono wake, nao uhona kamba uja uyagwe. <verse eid="MAT 12:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 12:14"/>Abaho Mafalisayo walawa kunze wakala kiseto cha kumkoma Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 12:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Msang'hanaji yasaguligwe na Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 12:15"/>Yesu viyahulike mbuli ayo, kasegela hanhu aho, na lunhu mkulu lumkweleleza. Nayo kawahonya wose wakalile watamu. <verse eid="MAT 12:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 12:16"/>Kawalagiza sikuwamulongele munhu yoyose mbuli zake. <verse eid="MAT 12:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 12:17"/>Katenda avo ili kilawilile kija kiyalongile mtula ndagu wa Imulungu Isaya,<verse eid="MAT 12:17"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 12:18"/>“Ino ayo msang'hanaji wangu, inimsagule</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">inimnogela na moyo wangu unogezigwa nayo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">Noika loho yangu kumwake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:18">nayo kowapetela wanhu wa mwiisi nhaguso yangu.<verse eid="MAT 12:18"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 12:19"/>Nayo kaduhu ndwagi wala haguta,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:19">kuduhu munhu yonda yaihulike sauti yake mna izinzila.<verse eid="MAT 12:19"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 12:20"/>Honda yalubene ludete luveduke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">hebu kuuzima utambi ulava yosi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 12:20">mbaka vonda yaitende haki itawale.<verse eid="MAT 12:20"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 12:21"/>Wanhu wose wa mwiisi oditamanila twaga jake.”<verse eid="MAT 12:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu na Mwenembago</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:20-30">Maluko 3:20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luka 11:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 12:22"/>Abaho wanhu wayagwe wamgalila Yesu msuwameso na halonga, kwavija kakala na kinyamkela. Yesu kamuhonya, kadaha kulonga na kulola. <verse eid="MAT 12:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 12:23"/>Wanhu wose wakanganya. Walonga, “Vino ino siyo Mwanage Daudi?”<verse eid="MAT 12:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 12:24"/>Mafalisayo viwahulike avo walonga, “Munhu ino kolava vinyamkela kwa udahi wa Belizebuli, mkulu wa vinyamkela.”<verse eid="MAT 12:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 12:25"/>Yesu kajuwa kiwakalile ogesa, avo kawalongela, “Kamba undewa wowose wahaigola wenyego undewa awo ofa. Na lubuga lwahaigola lwenyego lubuga lulo lofa. <verse eid="MAT 12:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 12:26"/>Avo kamba Mwenembago komulava Mwenembago miyage, ayo kaigola mwenyego na undewa wake okwimaze? <verse eid="MAT 12:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 12:27"/>Mweye molonga niye nolava vinyamkela kwa udahi wa Belizebuli. Avo wanhu wenu olava vinyamkela kwa udahi wa nani? Kwa mbuli ayo wanhu wenu wenyego owatagusa kamba mobananga! <verse eid="MAT 12:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 12:28"/>Lakini kamba nowalava vinyamkela kwa Loho wa Imulungu, avo mujuwe kamba Undewa wa Imulungu uvika mwaka kumwenu.<verse eid="MAT 12:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 12:29"/>“Kuduhu munhu yodaha kutula ng'anda ya munhu mwene nguvu na kusola vinhu vake, mbaka yasonge kumgodeka nzabi munhu ayo, baho kodaha kusola vinhu vake.<verse eid="MAT 12:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 12:30"/>“Munhu yoyose heli ubanzi wangu konilema, na munhu yoyose yolema kunitaza kwika hamoja ayo kopwililisa. <verse eid="MAT 12:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 12:31"/>Avo nowalongela, nzambi zose na maligo ga wanhu gogeligwa kumgongo, lakini maligo kwa Loho Yang'alile honda gageligwe kumgongo bule. <verse eid="MAT 12:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 12:32"/>Munhu yoyose yolonga mbuli za kumliga Mwana wa Munhu, maligo gake gogeligwa kumgongo, lakini munhu yomuliga Loho Yang'alile, maligo gake honda gageligwe kumgongo ng'o mwiisi ino hebu mwiisi yonda ize.<verse eid="MAT 12:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Biki na matunda gake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 6:43-45">Luka 6:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 12:33"/>“Matunda ganogile golawa mdibiki dinogile, wahawa na biki dihile kokuwa na matunda gehile. Kwavija biki dojuwika kwa matunda gake. <verse eid="MAT 12:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 12:34"/>Mweye lukolo lwa mizoka! Vino modahaze kulonga mbuli zinogile na kuno mweye wenyego mwiha? Kwavija munhu kolonga kija kimemile muumoyo. <verse eid="MAT 12:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 12:35"/>Munhu yanogile kolava ganogile mna ingama ya ganogile geli mmwake, na munhu yehile kolava gehile mna ingama ya gehile geli mmwake.<verse eid="MAT 12:35"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 12:36"/>“Nowalongela ukweli, mna isiku ya nhaguso, wanhu olondigwa walonge habali walonga avo kwa mbuli yoyose ihile iwalongile. <verse eid="MAT 12:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 12:37"/>Mbuli zako azo zonda zikutaguse, kulagusa kunoga hebu kwiha.”<verse eid="MAT 12:37"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu olonda vilaguso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-12">Maluko 8:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:29-32">Luka 11:29-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 12:38"/>Abaho wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wayagwe na Mafalisayo wayagwe wamulongela, “Mfundiza, tolonda utende kilaguso.”<verse eid="MAT 12:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 12:39"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mweye wanhu wa lukolo lwa sambi, mwihile na hamumjuwile Imulungu molonda kilaguso? Bule! Kuduhu kilaguso chonda mugweleligwe, ila kilaguso cha mtula ndagu wa Imulungu Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 12:40"/>Kamba vija Yona viyakalile siku ndatu imisi na ikilo mna iinda ya somba mkulu, vivo ili kwa Mwana wa Munhu kokala siku ndatu imisi na ikilo hasi ya isi. <verse eid="MAT 12:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 12:41"/>Mna isiku ya nhaguso wanhu wa Ninawi okwima na kuwatagusa mweye, kwavija awo waleka nzambi Yona viyawapetele. Lakini nowalongela hano hana munhu mkulu kubanza Yona. <verse eid="MAT 12:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 12:42"/>Mna isiku ya nhaguso Malikia wa Sheba kokwima na kuwatagusa mweye kamba mubananga, kwavija heyo kafunga mwanza kulawa mwiisi yake kachola kumtegeleza Mndewa Sulemani na mafundizo gake geli na nzewele. Nowalongela, hano hana munhu mkulu kubanza Sulemani.<verse eid="MAT 12:42"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela kwa kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:24-26">Luka 11:24-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 12:43"/>“Kinyamkela yahamulawa munhu kochola mwiisi inyalile kuzahila hanhu ha kubwihila, kamba hapatile hanhu, <verse eid="MAT 12:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 12:44"/>koilongela mwenyego, ‘Nobweleganya mng'anda yangu.’ Avo yahabweleganya koivika ng'anda yabule kinhu, ifagiligwa na kila kinhu kikigwa goya. <verse eid="MAT 12:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 12:45"/>Abaho kochola na kusola vinyamkela wayagwe saba wehile kubanza heyo, awo okwiza na kukala mumo. Avo ugima wa munhu ayo okuwa wiha kubanza aho haichanduso. Kino acho chonda kiwalawilile wanhu wa lukolo luno lwihile.”<verse eid="MAT 12:45"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mamake Yesu na ndugu zake Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Maluko 3:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luka 8:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 12:46"/>Yesu viyakalile yang'hali kolonga na wanhu, mamake na ndugu zake weza, wema kunze walonda kulonga nayo. <verse eid="MAT 12:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 12:47"/>Avo munhu imoja kamulongela, “Go mkulu, mamako na ndugu zako wema kunze olonda kulonga na gweye.”<verse eid="MAT 12:47"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 12:48"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Mamangu ayo nani? Na ndugu zangu awo kina nani?” <verse eid="MAT 12:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 12:49"/>Abaho kawagolosela mkono wanahina zake, kalonga, “Lola! Wano awo mamangu na ndugu zangu! <verse eid="MAT 12:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 12:50"/>Munhu yoyose yotenda gaja golondigwa na Tatangu yeli kuulanga, ayo mamangu na ndugu zangu na lumbu jangu.”<verse eid="MAT 12:50"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 12"/>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MAT 13"/>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa munhu yohanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Maluko 4:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luka 8:4-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 13:1"/>Siku didija Yesu kalawa mng'anda, kachola kumgwazo wa lamba, ako kakala hasi na kufundiza. <verse eid="MAT 13:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 13:2"/>Lunhu lwa wanhu lumzunguluka Yesu mbaka kengila mwiingalawa na kukala mumo, na wanhu wose wakala kumgwazo wa lamba. <verse eid="MAT 13:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 13:3"/>Kawalongela mbuli nyingi kwa simo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:3">“Kukala na munhu kachola kuhanda mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 13:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 13:4"/>Viyakalile komiza, mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila mnzila, ndege weza na kuzija. <verse eid="MAT 13:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 13:5"/>Ziyagwe zilagalila mgamabwe hakalile na udongo mdodo. Zota himahima kwavija udongo ukala mdodo. <verse eid="MAT 13:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 13:6"/>Lakini zuwa vidilawile, mimea inyala kwavija imizizi haingile hasi. <verse eid="MAT 13:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 13:7"/>Mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila mvisolo va miba, miba ayo ikula na kuizonga imimea. <verse eid="MAT 13:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 13:8"/>Lakini mbeyu ziyagwe zilagalila hanhu heli na udongo unogile, zota zikula na kulela mbeyu nyingi kubanza zija zihandigwe, ziyagwe zilela gana dimoja, ziyagwe zilela malongo sita, na ziyagwe malongo madatu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 13:9"/>Yesu kamambukiza kwa kulonga, “Munhu yeli na magwiti yahulike.”<verse eid="MAT 13:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kilamuso cha simo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Maluko 4:10-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luka 8:9-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 13:10"/>Abaho wanahina zake wamcholela Yesu wamuuza, “Habali kolonga na wanhu kwa simo?”<verse eid="MAT 13:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 13:11"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mweye mumweda kuzijuwa mbuli zifisigwe za Undewa wa kuulanga, lakini kumwao awo haili vivo. <verse eid="MAT 13:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 13:12"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yeli na kinhu kokongezelwa ng'hani, lakini ija yelibule kinhu kobokigwa hata kija kidodo kiyelinacho. <verse eid="MAT 13:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 13:13"/>Kilamuso cha kulonga kwa simo, ili walole lakini sikuwone, na wategeleze lakini sikuwahulike hebu kujuwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 13:14"/>Avo kilawilile kiyalongile mtula ndagu wa Imulungu Isaya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">‘Kutegeleza motegeleza, lakini honda mujuwe bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:14">kulola molola, lakini hamona bule.<verse eid="MAT 13:14"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 13:15"/>Kwavija mizoyo ya wanhu wano midala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na magwiti gao hagahulika vinogile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na wafing'hiliza meso gao.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">Buleavo, meso gao gahalolile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">magwiti gao gahahulike,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">nzewele zao zahajuwile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na wahanibwelele niye, Imulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:15">na niye nahawahonyile.’”<verse eid="MAT 13:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 13:16"/>Yesu kalonga kabili, “Lakini mweye mumweda! Kwavija meso genu golola na magwiti genu gohulika. <verse eid="MAT 13:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 13:17"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli, watula ndagu bwando wa Imulungu na wanhu bwando wa Imulungu walonda ng'hani kugona gaja gomona mweye, lakini hawagonile bule, hebu kuhulika gaja gomuhulika mweye, lakini hawahulike bule.<verse eid="MAT 13:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofambula lusimo lwa munhu yohanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Maluko 4:13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luka 8:11-15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 13:18"/>“Tegelezeni na muifunze fambulo da lusimo lwa munhu yohanda. <verse eid="MAT 13:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 13:19"/>Munhu yoyose youhulika usenga wa Undewa wa Imulungu lakini haujuwa, kaigala na mbeyu zilagalile mnzila. Mwenembago kokwiza na kusola gaja gahandigwe muumoyo wake. <verse eid="MAT 13:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 13:20"/>Mbeyu zilagalile mgamabwe ziigala na munhu youhulika usenga na bahaja viyoubokela kodeng'helela, <verse eid="MAT 13:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 13:21"/>lakini kwavija kaduhu mizizi, kogendelela kwa kipindi kidodo. Avo yahagaya na kudununzika mbuli ya usenga awo kobwela kuchugu. <verse eid="MAT 13:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 13:22"/>Mbeyu zilagalile mna ivisolo va miba ziigala na munhu youhulika usenga, lakini mbuli ya magayo ga ugima uno na kulonda utajili youzonga uusenga, nayo halela matunda. <verse eid="MAT 13:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 13:23"/>Mbeyu zilagalile muudongo unogile ziigala na munhu youhulika usenga na kuujuwa. Ayo kolela ng'hani kubanza mbeyu zija zihandigwe, imoja gana dimoja, iyagwe malongo sita na iyagwe malongo madatu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa sani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 13:24"/>Yesu kawalongela lusimo luyagwe, “Undewa wa kuulanga uigala na gaja galawilile kwa munhu yahandile mbeyu inogile mumgunda wake. <verse eid="MAT 13:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 13:25"/>Kilo kimoja, wanhu viwawasile, munhu yamwihile keza na kuhanda sani hagati ya uhemba abaho kasegela. <verse eid="MAT 13:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 13:26"/>Uhemba viukulile na kusonga kuzamiza, sani nayo yoneka. <verse eid="MAT 13:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 13:27"/>Wasang'hanaji zake wamgendela wamulongela, ‘Go mkulu, gweye kuhanda mbeyu inogile mumgunda wako. Lelo sani ilawa kwahi?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 13:28"/>Mkulu ayo kawedika, ‘Ija yanihile heyo yatendile vivo.’ Wamuuza, ‘Kolonda tuchole tukaing'ole isani?’ <verse eid="MAT 13:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 13:29"/>Kawedika, ‘Bule, kwavija mwahang'ola sani modaha kung'ola na uuhemba. <verse eid="MAT 13:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 13:30"/>Lekeni uhemba na sani vikule hamoja mbaka kipindi cha kusenga. Baho nowalongela wasengaji wasonge kuikanha isani na kuifunga makinza na kuisoma moto, abaho wausole uhemba na wawike kukanho jangu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 13:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa mbeyu ndodo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Maluko 4:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luka 13:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 13:31"/>Yesu kawalongela lusimo luyagwe, “Undewa wa kuulanga uigala na kija kilawilile kwa munhu yahandile mbeyu ndodo mumgunda wake. <verse eid="MAT 13:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 13:32"/>Yenyego ndodo kubanza mbeyu zose zilimumgunda, lakini yahakula, yokuwa biki kulu kubanza yose ihandigwe mumgunda, mbaka ndege okwiza na kuzenga mvulu mna gamatambi gake.”<verse eid="MAT 13:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa hamila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:20-21">Luka 13:20-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 13:33"/>Yesu kawalongela lusimo luyagwe, “Undewa wa kuulanga uigala na kija kilawilile kwa mtwanzi yasolile sasu na kuitibwiliza hamoja na madebe mabili ga usage mbaka usage wose usasa.”<verse eid="MAT 13:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofundiza wanhu kwa simo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:33-34">Maluko 4:33-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 13:34"/>Yesu kalulongela lunhu gano gose kwa simo. Halongile nao mbuli yoyose bila simo. <verse eid="MAT 13:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 13:35"/>Katenda gano ili galawilile gaja gayalongile mtula ndagu wa Imulungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">“Nolonga nao kwa simo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 13:35">Nowalongela mbuli zifisigwe kusongela kulumbigwa kwa isi.”<verse eid="MAT 13:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofambula lusimo lwa sani</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 13:36"/>Yesu viyalulekile lunhu lwa wanhu na kwingila mng'anda, wanahina zake wamcholela wamulongela, “Tulongele fambulo da lusimo lwa sani ili mumgunda.”<verse eid="MAT 13:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 13:37"/>Yesu kawedika, “Munhu yahandile mbeyu inogile ayo Mwana wa Munhu. <verse eid="MAT 13:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 13:38"/>Mgunda ayo isi, mbeyu inogile awo wanhu waja Undewa wa Imulungu uli wao, na sani awo wanhu waja weli wa ija Imdumuka. <verse eid="MAT 13:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 13:39"/>Ija yamwihile yahandile sani ayo Mwenembago. Kusenga ayo siku ya kimambukizo, na wasengaji ni wasenga wa kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 13:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 13:40"/>Kamba vija sani viikigwa hamoja na kusomigwa moto, vivo vonda ilawilile mna isiku ya kimambukizo cha isi. <verse eid="MAT 13:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 13:41"/>Mwana wa Munhu kowatuma wasenga zake wa kuulanga wawagole na wawalave Muundewa wake wanhu owahonza wayagwe watende nzambi na wose wayagwe otenda gehile. <verse eid="MAT 13:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 13:42"/>Wasenga wa kuulanga owapigisa mna umoto, mumo olila na kudafuna meno. <verse eid="MAT 13:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 13:43"/>Abaho wanhu wanogile mgameso ga Imulungu ong'ala kamba zuwa Muundewa wa Tatao. Yeli na magwiti yahulike.”<verse eid="MAT 13:43"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa ngama ifisigwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 13:44"/>“Undewa wa kuulanga uigala na zahabu ifisigwe mumgunda. Munhu imoja kaiyona abaho kaifisa kabili, na kwa deng'ho kulu diyakalile najo kachola kuuza vose viyalinavo abaho kaugula mgunda uja.”<verse eid="MAT 13:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa lulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 13:45"/>“Vivija Undewa wa Imulungu uigala na munhu yozahila lulu inogile, <verse eid="MAT 13:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 13:46"/>viyaiyonile lulu imoja inogile ng'hani, kachola na kuuza kila kinhu kiyalinacho, ili yaigule lulu ayo.”<verse eid="MAT 13:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa lwavu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 13:47"/>“Vivija Undewa wa kuulanga uigala na wavula somba wategile lwavu lwao mdilamba na kunamata somba odigwa na howodigwa. <verse eid="MAT 13:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 13:48"/>Lwavu vilumemile, walukwega kuimwhani, wakala hasi na kusonga kusagula, somba odigwa waweka mvigelo vao na waja hawadigwa wawasa. <verse eid="MAT 13:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 13:49"/>Avo vonda iwe mna isiku ya kimambukizo cha isi, wasenga wa kuulanga okwiza na kuwabagula wanhu wehile hagati ya wanogile, <verse eid="MAT 13:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 13:50"/>na wanhu wehile okwasigwa muumoto, ako olila na kudafuna meno gao.”<verse eid="MAT 13:50"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mafundizo ga sambi na gaumwaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 13:51"/>Yesu kawauza, “Vino muzijuwa mbuli zino zose?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:51">Wamwidika, “Ona.”<verse eid="MAT 13:51"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 13:52"/>Avo kawalongela, “Mfundiza yoyose wa Malagizo ga Musa yahawa mwanahina wa Undewa wa kuulanga koigala na munhu mwene ng'anda, yolava vinhu va sambi na va umwaka kulawa mna digati jake da kwikila vinhu.”<verse eid="MAT 13:52"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolemigwa ako Nazaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Maluko 6:1-6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luka 4:16-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 13:53"/>Yesu viyamambukize kuwalongela simo azo, kasegela hanhu aho <verse eid="MAT 13:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 13:54"/>na kachola ukae kumwake. Kafundiza mna izing'anda za kumpula Imulungu, na waja wamuhulike wakanganya. Waiuza, “Kazipata kwahi nzewele zino? Kaupata kwahi udahi wa kutenda unzonza uno? <verse eid="MAT 13:54"/><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 13:55"/>Vino ino siyo mwanage fundi selemala? Vino ino siyo mwanage Malia? Vino ndugu zake siyo Yakobo na Yusufu na Simoni na Yuda? <verse eid="MAT 13:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 13:56"/>Vino lumbu zake hawakala bahano bule? Gano gose kagapata kwahi?” <verse eid="MAT 13:56"/><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 13:57"/>Avo wamulema.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 13:57">Yesu kawalongela, “Mtula ndagu kotegelezigwa kila hanhu, lakini hategelezigwa ukae kumwake na mna ulukolo lwake mwenyego.” <verse eid="MAT 13:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 13:58"/>Kwavija wanhu wakala wabule kutamanila, Yesu hatendile unzonza ng'hani hanhu aho.<verse eid="MAT 13:58"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 13"/>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MAT 14"/>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Yohana Mbatizaji</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Maluko 6:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luka 9:7-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 14:1"/>Mna ikipindi acho Mndewa Helode kakala mkulu wa isi ya Galilaya, viyazihulike mbuli za Yesu, <verse eid="MAT 14:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 14:2"/>kawalongela wasang'hanaji zake, “Munhu ino ayo Yohana Mbatizaji, kazilibuka kulawa kwa wafile, lekaavo kana udahi wa kutenda unzonza.”<verse eid="MAT 14:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 14:3"/>Kwavija Helode ayo yalagize Yohana yagogigwe na yagodekigwe. Katenda avo mbuli ya Helodiya mwehe wa Filipo, mdodo wake. <verse eid="MAT 14:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 14:4"/>Kwavija Yohana Mbatizaji kamulongela Helode, “Havinogile gweye kumsola Helodiya!” <verse eid="MAT 14:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 14:5"/>Helode kalonda kumkoma Yohana, lakini kawadumba wanhu, kwavija wamtogola Yohana kamba mtula ndagu wa Imulungu.<verse eid="MAT 14:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 14:6"/>Mna isiku ya kukumbuka kuvumbuka kwa Helode, mndele wa Helodiya kacheza mgameso ga wanhu. Helode kanogelwa ng'hani, <verse eid="MAT 14:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 14:7"/>mbaka kaiduwila, “Nokugwaa chochose chondaupule!”<verse eid="MAT 14:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 14:8"/>Kwa kufunzigwa na mamake, kalonga, “Nigwelele sambi baha pala da Yohana Mbatizaji mditanda!”<verse eid="MAT 14:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 14:9"/>Mndewa kona usungu, lakini kwavija kakala yaiduwile mgameso ga wanhu wagonekigwe, avo kalagiza wamgwelele. <verse eid="MAT 14:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 14:10"/>Kalagiza Yohana yakanhigwe pala ako mkifungo. <verse eid="MAT 14:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 14:11"/>Pala jake digaligwa mditanda, wamgwelela mndele ayo, nayo kamgalila mamake. <verse eid="MAT 14:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 14:12"/>Wanahina zake Yohana wachola kulusola lukuli lwake, waluzika, abaho wachola kumulongela Yesu.<verse eid="MAT 14:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowagwaa ndiya lunhu lwa wanhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Maluko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luka 9:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yohana 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 14:13"/>Yesu viyagahulike gago, kasegela hanhu aho kwa ngalawa, kachola hanhu helibule wanhu. Wanhu viwahulike, walawa mmabuga gao wamkweleleza kwa magulu. <verse eid="MAT 14:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 14:14"/>Yesu viyahumuluke mwiingalawa, kaluwona lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu, kawonela bazi, kawahonya wanhu wakalile watamu.<verse eid="MAT 14:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 14:15"/>Viivikile ichungulo wanahina zake wamcholela, wamulongela, “Hano hatwili twa kuluwala na zuwa dohonga, waleke wanhu wachole kuna ivijiji wakagule ndiya.”<verse eid="MAT 14:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 14:16"/>Yesu kawedika, “Habali wachole? Mweye wagweleleni ndiya!”<verse eid="MAT 14:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 14:17"/>Awo wamwidika, “Tunago magate matano na somba wabili.”<verse eid="MAT 14:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 14:18"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Ngalileni hano.” <verse eid="MAT 14:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 14:19"/>Kawalongela wanhu wakale hasi mna gamajani. Abaho kasola magate matano na waja iwasomba wabili. Kalola uchanha kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu, kagabanzula gaja gamagate kawagwaa wanahina zake wawagolele wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 14:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 14:20"/>Wanhu wose waja na kwiguta. Abaho wanahina zake wadondola magate gasigale na iwasomba na kumemeza vigelo longo na vibili. <verse eid="MAT 14:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 14:21"/>Wahaleka watwanzi na wana, wambigalo waiyeka wadile wakala kamba elufu tano.<verse eid="MAT 14:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotembela uchanha mgamazi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:45-52">Maluko 6:45-52</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yohana 6:15-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 14:22"/>Yesu viyakalile kowalaga wanhu, kawalongela wanahina zake wengile mwiingalawa wamulongolele wachole mwambu wa lamba. <verse eid="MAT 14:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 14:23"/>Viyamambukize kuwalaga wanhu, kakwela yaiyeka kukigongo kumpula Imulungu. Viivikile ichungulo kakala kuko yaiyeka. <verse eid="MAT 14:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 14:24"/>Kipindi acho ngalawa ikala hagati ya lamba, kuno yozoligwa na ng'humbi, kwavija beho dikala doisung'ha.<verse eid="MAT 14:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 14:25"/>Nzogolo zikwika, Yesu kawagendela kuno kotembela uchanha mgamazi. <verse eid="MAT 14:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 14:26"/>Wanahina zake viwamone kotembela uchanha mgamazi, wadumba walonga, “Mzimu!” na wakemelela kwa bwembwe.<verse eid="MAT 14:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 14:27"/>Bahaja Yesu kawalongela, “Gangamaleni! Iyo nene! Sikumudumbe!”<verse eid="MAT 14:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 14:28"/>Petulo kamulongela, “Mndewa, kamba ayo gweye, longa nize kumwako kwa kutembela uchanha mgamazi.”<verse eid="MAT 14:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 14:29"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Izo!” Petulo kahumuluka mwiingalawa, kasonga kutembela uchanha mgamazi kumcholela Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 14:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 14:30"/>Lakini viyone beho kadumba na kasonga kudidimila, kakemelela, “Mndewa, mhonye!”<verse eid="MAT 14:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 14:31"/>Bahaja Yesu kagolosa mkono wake kamgoga, kamulongela, “Gweye utamanila kidogo! Habali kokona shaka?”<verse eid="MAT 14:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 14:32"/>Viwakwelile mwiingalawa, beho najo dinyamala tuluu. <verse eid="MAT 14:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 14:33"/>Wanahina wakalile mwiingalawa wamtambikila Yesu, walonga, “Kweli gweye kwa Mwana wa Imulungu!”<verse eid="MAT 14:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya mtamu ako Genesaleti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 6:53-56">Maluko 6:53-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 14:34"/>Waloka umwambu wa lamba na kuvika isi ya Genesaleti. <verse eid="MAT 14:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 14:35"/>Wanhu viwamone Yesu wamjuwa. Avo wazibwililisa mbuli zake mvijiji vili mmabehi, wanhu wamgalila Yesu waja wakalile watamu. <verse eid="MAT 14:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 14:36"/>Wampula yawaleke watamu wakwase mhindo ya kiwalo chake, na wose wakwasile wahona.<verse eid="MAT 14:36"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 14"/>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MAT 15"/>
  <para style="s">Mafundizo ga wahenga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:1-13">Maluko 7:1-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 15:1"/>Abaho Mafalisayo wayagwe na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa walawile Yelusalemu wamcholela Yesu wamuuza, <verse eid="MAT 15:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 15:2"/>“Habali wanahina zako hawakweleleza mafundizo gatugweleligwe na wahenga zetu? Hawasunha makono gao kamba viilondigwa wang'hali hawanakuja.”<verse eid="MAT 15:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 15:3"/>Yesu kawedika, “Habali hamugagoga malagizo ga Imulungu ila mogagoga mafundizo genu wenyego? <verse eid="MAT 15:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 15:4"/>Imulungu kalonga, ‘Mtegeleze tatako na mamako na munhu yoyose yonda yamulige tatake hebu mamake kolondigwa yakomigwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 15:5"/>Lakini mweye mofundiza, kamba munhu kana kinhu chochose kodaha kumtaza tatake hebu mamake, lakini kolonga, ‘Kinhu kino nimulavila Imulungu.’ <verse eid="MAT 15:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 15:6"/>Munhu ayo halondigwa kumtegeleza tatake hebu mamake, kwa kutenda avo hamugatonga malagizo ga Imulungu, kwa kukweleleza mafundizo genu wenyego. <verse eid="MAT 15:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 15:7"/>Mweye mwa watapitapi! Kumbe mtula ndagu wa Imulungu Isaya kalagula goya mbuli ya mweye!<verse eid="MAT 15:7"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 15:8"/>Imulungu kalonga, ‘Wanhu wano onitegeleza kwa mbuli zao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:8">lakini mizoyo yao ya kutali na niye.<verse eid="MAT 15:8"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 15:9"/>Wao onitambikila bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 15:9">kwavija ofundiza mafundizo ga wanhu na kugatenda kamba malagizo gangu!’ ”<verse eid="MAT 15:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vinhu vimfitiza munhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:14-23">Maluko 7:14-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 15:10"/>Yesu kalukema lunhu lwa wanhu, kalulongela, “Tegelezeni na muvijuwe! <verse eid="MAT 15:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 15:11"/>Kuduhu kinhu kingila mmulomo chodaha kumfitiza munhu, lakini kija kilawa mmulomo wa munhu acho kimfitiza munhu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 15:12"/>Abaho wanahina zake Yesu wamcholela wamuuza, “Vino kuvijuwa kamba Mafalisayo viwahulike mbuli ziulongile wehilwa?”<verse eid="MAT 15:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 15:13"/>Yesu kawedika, “Biki jojose hadihandigwe na Tatangu wa kuulanga dong'oligwa. <verse eid="MAT 15:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 15:14"/>Sikumuwatonge! Awo vilongozi hawalola wa wanhu hawalola, kamba munhu halola komulongoza munhu halola miyage, wose wabili otumbukila mdikolombo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 15:15"/>Petulo kamulongela, “Tufambulile ulonzi awo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 15:16"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Vino na mweye mung'hali hamujuwile? <verse eid="MAT 15:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 15:17"/>Mweye hamujuwile bule? Kinhu kingila mmulomo wa munhu chochola mna iinda, abaho cholawa kunze? <verse eid="MAT 15:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 15:18"/>Lakini vija vilawa mmulomo, volawa muumoyo, navo vivo vimfitiza munhu. <verse eid="MAT 15:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 15:19"/>Kwavija muumoyo wa munhu, mumo mulawa magesa gehile, ubavi, ukomaji, ugoni, kuwalonga wayagwe vihile, uvizi na nzambi. <verse eid="MAT 15:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 15:20"/>Vino avo vimfitiza munhu, lakini kuja bila kusunha makono hakumfiza bule munhu.”<verse eid="MAT 15:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kutamanila kwa mtwanzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 7:24-30">Maluko 7:24-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 15:21"/>Yesu kahalawa hanhu aho kachola mwiimbaka ili behi na kudibuga da Tilo na Sidoni. <verse eid="MAT 15:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 15:22"/>Mtwanzi imoja Mkaanani wa isi ayo kamcholela kuno kotowa nyangi, kamulongela, “Go mkulu, Mwana wa Daudi! Nyonele bazi mndele wangu kana kinyamkela komgaza ng'hani.”<verse eid="MAT 15:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 15:23"/>Lakini Yesu hamwidike mbuli. Wanahina zake wamcholela Yesu wampula, “Mulongele yasegele! Kwavija kotukweleleza na kotutowela mizangi!”<verse eid="MAT 15:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 15:24"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nhumigwa kwa wanhu wa isi ya Izilaeli weli kamba ng'hondolo wapotele.”<verse eid="MAT 15:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 15:25"/>Mtwanzi ayo keza kamfugamila kamulongela, “Go mkulu, nhaze!”<verse eid="MAT 15:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 15:26"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Havinogile bule kusola ndiya ya iwana na kuwapigisila umbwa.”<verse eid="MAT 15:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 15:27"/>Mtwanzi ayo kamwidika, “Ona, go mkulu, lakini hata umbwa oja kija kilagale hasi mmeza ya wakulu zao.”<verse eid="MAT 15:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 15:28"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Gweye kwa mtwanzi utamanila ng'hani! Kiulondile kotendiligwa.” Bahaja mndele wake kahona.<verse eid="MAT 15:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wanhu wengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 15:29"/>Yesu kahalawa hanhu aho, kachola kumgwazo wa lamba da Galilaya. Kakwela kukigongo kakala hasi. <verse eid="MAT 15:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 15:30"/>Lunhu lwa wanhu lumcholela na wamgalila wanhu wakalile mbetembete, wasuwameso, walemale, wanhu hawalonga na wanhu wengi watamu, waweka haulongozi wake, nayo kawahonya. <verse eid="MAT 15:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 15:31"/>Wanhu wakanganya viwone wanhu hawalonga olonga, walemale wahona, mbetembete otembela na wasuwameso olola, nao wamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu wa Izilaeli.<verse eid="MAT 15:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowagwaa ndiya lunhu luyagwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:1-10">Maluko 8:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 15:32"/>Yesu kawakema wanahina zake, kalonga, “Nowonela bazi wanhu wano, kwavija wakala na niye siku ndatu na wabule ndiya. Silonda niwaleke wachole na nzala, sikuwasinduke mnzila.”<verse eid="MAT 15:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 15:33"/>Wanahina zake wamuuza, “Hano hatwili twa kuluwala, togapata kwahi magate ga kuwagwaa wanhu wose wano waje?”<verse eid="MAT 15:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 15:34"/>Yesu kawauza, “Mna magate mangapi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 15:34">Wamwidika, “Saba na visomba vidoododo kidogo.”<verse eid="MAT 15:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 15:35"/>Avo Yesu kawalongela wanhu wakale hasi. <verse eid="MAT 15:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 15:36"/>Kasola gamagate saba na waja iwasomba, kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu, kagabanzula gamagate, kawagwaa wanahina zake, nao wawagolela wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 15:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 15:37"/>Wose waja na kwiguta. Abaho wanahina zake wadondola vija visigale na kumemeza vigelo saba. <verse eid="MAT 15:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 15:38"/>Wambigalo wadile wakala elufu nne, watwanzi na wana hawapetigwe bule.<verse eid="MAT 15:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 15:39"/>Abaho Yesu kawalaga wanhu, kengila mwiingalawa, kachola mwiisi ya Magadani.<verse eid="MAT 15:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 15"/>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MAT 16"/>
  <para style="s">Wanhu olonda vilaguso</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:11-13">Maluko 8:11-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:54-56">Luka 12:54-56</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 16:1"/>Mafalisayo na Masadukayo wayagwe wamcholela Yesu walonda kumgeza, wampula yawalagusile kilaguso kulawa kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 16:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 16:2"/>Yesu kawedika, “Zuwa dahahonga, molonga, ‘Honoga, kwavija ulanga mdung'hu.’ <verse eid="MAT 16:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 16:3"/>Na imitondo molonga, ‘Lelo mvula kotowa, kwavija ulanga mdung'hu na mawingu totolo.’ Modaha kujuwa ulanga viuli, lakini hamujuwa vilaguso va kipindi acho. <verse eid="MAT 16:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 16:4"/>Lukolo lwa sambi lwihile na lulibule kutamanila molonda kilaguso! Lakini kuduhu kilaguso chonda mugweleligwe kubanza kija cha Yona.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 16:4">Yesu kawaleka baho, kasegela.<verse eid="MAT 16:4"/></para>
  <para style="s">Usasu wa Mafalisayo na Masadukayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:14-21">Maluko 8:14-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 16:5"/>Wanahina zake viwalokile umwambu uyagwe wa lamba, wakala waisemwile kusola magate. <verse eid="MAT 16:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 16:6"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Muiteganye na mkale meso na hamila ya Mafalisayo na Masadukayo.”<verse eid="MAT 16:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 16:7"/>Wasonga kuilongela wenyego, “Kolonga vino kwavija hatusolile magate.”<verse eid="MAT 16:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 16:8"/>Yesu kajuwa kija kiwakalile olonga, kawauza, “Mweye mutamanila kidogo, habali molongelela mbuli za kuwa bule magate? <verse eid="MAT 16:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 16:9"/>Mung'hali hamuvijuwile? Vino hamukumbuka vinigabanzule gamagate matano na kuwagwaa wanhu elufu tano? Vino mmemeza vigelo vingapi? <verse eid="MAT 16:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 16:10"/>Na vivija gaja magate saba kwa wanhu elufu nne? Vino, mmemeza vigelo vingapi? <verse eid="MAT 16:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 16:11"/>Vino hamujuwile vilihi kamba sikalile nolonga mbuli ya magate? Muiteganye na hamila ya Mafalisayo na Masadukayo!”<verse eid="MAT 16:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 16:12"/>Baho wanahina wajuwa kamba Yesu hawazumile waiteganye na hamila ya magate, ila mafundizo ga Mafalisayo na Masadukayo.<verse eid="MAT 16:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo kolonga Mwana wa Munhu ayo nani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:27-30">Maluko 8:27-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luka 9:18-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 16:13"/>Yesu viyavikile mwiisi ya Kaisalia Filipi, kawauza wanahina zake, “Vino, wanhu olonga Mwana wa Munhu ayo nani?”<verse eid="MAT 16:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 16:14"/>Wamwidika, “Wayagwe olonga Yohana Mbatizaji, wayagwe olonga Eliya, kuno wayagwe olonga Yelemia na wayagwe olonga imoja wa watula ndagu wa Imulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 16:15"/>Yesu kawauza, “Na mweye molonga niye na nani?”<verse eid="MAT 16:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 16:16"/>Simoni Petulo kamwidika, “Gweye kwa Kilisito, Mwana wa Imulungu yeli mgima.”<verse eid="MAT 16:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 16:17"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Kumweda gweye Simoni, mwanage Yohana, kwavija mbuli yuulongile hufunzigwe na munhu, ila ilawa kwa Tatangu yeli kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 16:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 16:18"/>Niye nokulongela, Petulo, gweye kwa dibwe kulu na uchanha mwa dibwe dino nozenga kanisa jangu, hata ifa haidaha bule kudihuma. <verse eid="MAT 16:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 16:19"/>Nokugwaa luvugulo lwa Undewa wa kuulanga, chochose chondaufunge mwiisi chofungigwa kuulanga, na chochose chondaufungule mwiisi chofunguligwa kuulanga.”<verse eid="MAT 16:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 16:20"/>Abaho Yesu kawazuma wanahina zake sikuwamulongele munhu yoyose kamba heyo kakala Kilisito Mkombola.<verse eid="MAT 16:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mbuli ya kugaya na ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 8:31-9:1">Maluko 8:31-9:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:22-27">Luka 9:22-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 16:21"/>Kulawa baho, Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake fulu ipile, “Nolondigwa kuchola Yelusalemu, kuko nodununzigwa ng'hani mmakono ga wavele, wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo. Ako nokomigwa na siku da kadatu nozilibuka.”<verse eid="MAT 16:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 16:22"/>Petulo kamsola Yesu kumgwazo kasonga kumkomhokela, “Bule, Mndewa! Dino hadikulawilila bule!”<verse eid="MAT 16:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 16:23"/>Yesu kahinduka, kamulongela Petulo, “Segela kumwangu, Mwenembago! Gweye kong'himila, kwavija hugesa ga Imulungu, ila kogesa ga iwanhu.”<verse eid="MAT 16:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 16:24"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Munhu yoyose yolonda kwiza kumwangu, yaileme mwenyego, yaupape msalaba wake na yanikweleleze. <verse eid="MAT 16:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 16:25"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yolonda kuukombola ugima wake kowagiza, lakini munhu yoyose yowagiza ugima wake mbuli ya niye koupata. <verse eid="MAT 16:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 16:26"/>Vino munhu kopata choni kamba yahaipata isi yose, lakini kowagiza ugima wake? Hebu munhu kolava choni yaupate kabili ugima wake? <verse eid="MAT 16:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 16:27"/>Kwavija Mwana wa Munhu kokwiza muukulu wa Tatake hamoja na wasenga wa kuulanga, abaho komgwaa kila munhu nhunza yake iigalile na sang'hano yake. <verse eid="MAT 16:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 16:28"/>Nowalongela ukweli, wanhu wayagwe wemile hano, hondawafe bule, mbaka vondawamone Mwana wa Munhu vonda yeze muundewa wake.”<verse eid="MAT 16:28"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 16"/>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="MAT 17"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaluka kihanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:2-13">Maluko 9:2-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luka 9:28-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 17:1"/>Vizibitile siku sita, Yesu kamsola Petulo na Yakobo na Yohana ndugu yake Yakobo, kachola nao waiyeka kulugongo lutali. <verse eid="MAT 17:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 17:2"/>Viwakalile olola, Yesu kagaluka. Kihanga chake king'ala kamba zuwa, na viwalo vake vikala vizelu chuwee kamba mulenge. <verse eid="MAT 17:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 17:3"/>Baho wanahina waja wadatu wamona Musa na Eliya olonga na Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 17:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 17:4"/>Petulo kamulongela Yesu, “Mndewa, vinoga siye tukale hano! Kamba wahalonda nozenga viheha vidatu, kimoja chako gweye, kimoja cha Musa na kimoja cha Eliya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 17:5"/>Viyakalile yang'hali kolonga, wingu ding'alile diwagubika na sauti ilawa mdiwingu ilonga, “Ino ayo Mwanangu inimnogele. Mumtegeleze!”<verse eid="MAT 17:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 17:6"/>Wanahina zake viwahulike vivo, wadumba ng'hani wagwa kingubanguba. <verse eid="MAT 17:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 17:7"/>Yesu kawacholela kawakwasa kawalongela, “Inukeni, sikumudumbe!” <verse eid="MAT 17:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 17:8"/>Viwalolile uchanha, hawamonile munhu ila Yesu yaiyeka.<verse eid="MAT 17:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 17:9"/>Viwakalile ohumuluka kulugongo, Yesu kawazuma, “Sikumumulongele munhu yoyose mbuli zino zimone, mbaka Mwana wa Munhu vonda yazilibuke kulawa kwa wafile.”<verse eid="MAT 17:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 17:10"/>Abaho wanahina wamuuza, “Habali wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa olonga Eliya kolondigwa yeze tanhu?”<verse eid="MAT 17:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 17:11"/>Yesu kawedika, “Kweli, Eliya kokwiza tanhu, nayo kokwiza kutanda kila kinhu. <verse eid="MAT 17:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 17:12"/>Lakini nowalongeleni, Eliya kamala kwiza na wanhu hawamjuwile bule, wamtendela viwalondile. Vivo vonda wamdununze Mwana wa Munhu.”<verse eid="MAT 17:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 17:13"/>Abaho wanahina zake wajuwa kamba Yesu kakala kolonga mbuli ya Yohana Mbatizaji.<verse eid="MAT 17:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu komuhonya mbwanga yeli na kinyamkela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:14-29">Maluko 9:14-29</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43">Luka 9:37-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 17:14"/>Viwaluvikile lunhu lwa wanhu, munhu imoja kamcholela Yesu, kamfugamila, <verse eid="MAT 17:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 17:15"/>kamulongela, “Go mkulu, monele bazi mwanangu, kana kisango na kogaya ng'hani. Miyanza mingi kogwa muumoto hebu mgamazi. <verse eid="MAT 17:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 17:16"/>Nimgala kwa wanahina zako, lakini hawadahile bule kumuhonya.”<verse eid="MAT 17:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 17:17"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mweye lukolo lwihile na mulibule kutamanila! Ng'hale na mweye mbaka lini? Nogela kitumbe kumgongo mbaka lini? Mgaleni hano imbwanga!” <verse eid="MAT 17:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 17:18"/>Yesu kamkomhokela ikinyamkela, nayo kamulawa mbwanga ayo, bahaja kahona.<verse eid="MAT 17:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 17:19"/>Abaho wanahina zake wamcholela Yesu kinyelegezi wamuuza, “Habali siye hatudahile kumulava ikinyamkela?”<verse eid="MAT 17:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 17:20"/>Yesu kawedika, “Kwavija mutamanila kidogo. Nowalongeleni ukweli, mwahawa na kutamanila kidogo kamba mbeyu ndodo ya haladali, modaha kukilongela kigongo kino, ‘Segela hano uchole haja!’ nacho chochola. Mwahatendile kila kinhu!” <verse eid="MAT 17:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 17:21"/>Kinyamkela kamba ino hadaha kulawa mbaka upule na kufunga kuja.<verse eid="MAT 17:21"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga kabili mbuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Maluko 9:30-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43-45">Luka 9:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 17:22"/>Wanahina viwakalile hamoja kuko Galilaya, Yesu kawalongela, “Mwana wa Munhu kogeligwa mmakono ga wanhu, <verse eid="MAT 17:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 17:23"/>nao omkoma, lakini siku da kadatu kozilibuka.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:23">Wanahina zake wakala wanyunyuwale.<verse eid="MAT 17:23"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuliha kodi ya Ng'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 17:24"/>Yesu na wanahina zake viwavikile Kapelinaumu, wabokela kodi wa Ng'anda ya Imulungu wamcholela Petulo, wamuuza, “Vino mfundiza wenu kalihaga kodi ya Ng'anda ya Imulungu?”<verse eid="MAT 17:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 17:25"/>Petulo kawedika, “Ona, kalihaga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:25">Petulo viyengile mng'anda, Yesu kasonga kulonga, “Simoni, gweye kogesaze? Wandewa wa isi wasolaga kodi na malipo kulawa kwa nani? Kwa wenekae hebu kwa wanhu baki?”<verse eid="MAT 17:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 17:26"/>Petulo kamwidika, “Kwa wanhu baki.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 17:26">Yesu kamwidika, “Vinoga, ino yofambula kamba wenekae hawalondigwa kuliha. <verse eid="MAT 17:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 17:27"/>Lakini hatulonda kuwagevuza wanhu wano. Avo chola kudilamba tega ndoano. Msole somba yonda yalongole kunamata, mbabazule umulomo na mgati yake kokona sente ya kuliha kodi ya Ng'anda ya Imulungu, yangu niye na gweye. Isole kalihile kodi yetu.”<verse eid="MAT 17:27"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 17"/>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="MAT 18"/>
  <para style="s">Nani yeli mkulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Maluko 9:33-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luka 9:46-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 18:1"/>Kipindi acho wanahina wamcholela Yesu, wamuuza, “Nani yeli mkulu Muundewa wa kuulanga?”<verse eid="MAT 18:1"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 18:2"/>Yesu kamkema mwana mdodo, kamwimiza haulongozi wao, <verse eid="MAT 18:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 18:3"/>kalonga, “Nowalongeleni ukweli, kamba mwahaleka kugaluka na kuigala na mwana mdodo, hamkwingila ng'o Muundewa wa kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 18:4"/>Munhu yoyose yoihumulusa kamba mwana ino ayo mkulu kubanza wose Muundewa wa kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 18:5"/>Yoyose yombokela mwana mdodo kamba ino kwa twaga jangu, kombokela niye.<verse eid="MAT 18:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Vinhu vimuhonza munhu yatende nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:42-48">Maluko 9:42-48</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luka 17:1-2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 18:6"/>“Munhu yoyose yonda yamuhonze imoja wa wadodo wano onitogola, yatende nzambi yokuwa vinoga munhu ayo yagodekigwe dibwe kulu da kudugila msingo na yasigwe mbahali.<figure style="fig" file="01 Millstone.jpg" size="col" ref="18:6">Wanhu wabili oduga kwa dibwe</figure> <verse eid="MAT 18:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 18:7"/>Mogaya wanhu wa mwiisi mbuli ya gaja gowatenda wanhu wagize kutamanila kwao! Magayo golondigwa galawilile lakini kogaya munhu ija yonda yatende galawilile.<verse eid="MAT 18:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 18:8"/>“Kamba mkono wako hebu mgulu wako wahakuhonza utende nzambi ukanhe uwase! Yokuwa vinoga kwingila kuna uugima wa milele na mkono hebu mgulu, kubanza kwingila na makono mabili hebu magulu mabili na kwasigwa mna umoto wa jehanamu. <verse eid="MAT 18:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 18:9"/>Kamba siso jako dahakuhonza utende nzambi, ding'ole na ujase! Yokuwa vinoga gweye wingile kuna uugima wa milele na siso dimoja kubanza kuwa na meso mabili na kwasigwa muumoto wa jehanamu.<verse eid="MAT 18:9"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa ng'hondolo yapotele.</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 15:3-7">Luka 15:3-7</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 18:10"/>“Iteganyeni sikumumbeze imoja wa wadodo wano. Kwavija nowalongeleni wasenga wa kuulanga olola kihanga cha tatangu yeli kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 18:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 18:11"/>Kwavija Mwana wa Munhu keza kukikombola kija kipotele.<verse eid="MAT 18:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 18:12"/>“Mogesaze? Kamba munhu kana ng'hondolo gana dimoja, na ng'hondolo imoja kapotela, avo hawaleka waja malongo tisa na tisa mna ikigongo na kuchola kumzahila ija ng'hondolo yapotele? <verse eid="MAT 18:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 18:13"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli yahampata, kodeng'helela ng'hani kubanza waja malongo tisa na tisa walekile kupotela. <verse eid="MAT 18:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 18:14"/>Vivija Tata yeli kuulanga halonda hata imoja wa wadodo wano yapotele.<verse eid="MAT 18:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kumtaza ndugu yatendile nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 18:15"/>“Kamba ndugu yako yahakutendela gehile. Chola ukamzume, heyo na gweye muli mwiiyeka. Yahakutegeleza, kumpata ndugu yako. <verse eid="MAT 18:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 18:16"/>Yahalema kukutegeleza, msole munhu imoja hebu wabili hamoja na gweye, ili chochose kilongigwa kitogoligwe na wanhu wabili hebu wadatu. <verse eid="MAT 18:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 18:17"/>Kamba yahalema kuwategeleza, walongele wanhu wamtogole Yesu, vivija yahalema kuwategeleza, muleke yawe kumwako kamba mmhazi hebu mbokela kodi.<verse eid="MAT 18:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 18:18"/>“Nowalongeleni, jojose dondamudifunge mwiisi dofungigwa kuulanga, na jojose dondamfungule mwiisi dofunguligwa kuulanga.<verse eid="MAT 18:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 18:19"/>“Nowalongeleni kabili, wanhu wabili kumwenu mweye wahaitogolela mwiisi kupula kinhu chochose, Tatangu yeli kuulanga kowatendela. <verse eid="MAT 18:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 18:20"/>Kwavija kokose konda waiting'hane wanhu wabili hebu wadatu kwa twaga jangu, niye na hamoja nao.”<verse eid="MAT 18:20"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa msang'hanaji yelibule bazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 18:21"/>Abaho Petulo kamcholela Yesu kamuuza, “Mndewa, kamba ndugu yangu yahanhendela vihile, ngele kumgongo miyanza mingapi? Mbaka miyanza saba?”<verse eid="MAT 18:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 18:22"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Nokulongela siyo miyanza saba, lakini saba miyanza malongo saba, <verse eid="MAT 18:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 18:23"/>kwavija Undewa wa Imulungu uigala na Mndewa yalondile kupeta sente zake na wasang'hanaji zake. <verse eid="MAT 18:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 18:24"/>Viyasongile kupeta sente, kagaligwa munhu imoja yakalile kodaigwa talanta elufu kumi. <verse eid="MAT 18:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 18:25"/>Msang'hanaji ayo kakala kabule kinhu cha kumuliha, avo mndewa kalagiza yauzigwe, heyo, mwehe wake na wanage na vose viyalinavo ili yalihe dideni. <verse eid="MAT 18:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 18:26"/>Msang'hanaji ayo kamfugamila kampula, ‘Go mkulu, nibetele kwa kufunga umoyo nokuliha kila kinhu!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 18:27"/>Mndewa ija kamonela bazi, avo kamulekelela dideni dija na kamuleka yachole.”<verse eid="MAT 18:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 18:28"/>“Abaho munhu ija viyasegela kamting'hana msang'hanaji miyage yakalile komdai sente gana dimoja, kamgoga kasonga kumbota isingo kuno kolonga, ‘Liha sente yangu.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 18:29"/>Msang'hanaji miyage kamfugamila, kampula, ‘Nibetele kwa kufunga umoyo nokuliha!’ <verse eid="MAT 18:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 18:30"/>Lakini kalema, kachola na kumgodeka miyage mkifungo mbaka vonda yalihe deni dija. <verse eid="MAT 18:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 18:31"/>Wasang'hanaji wayage viwonile kija kilawilile ona usungu, wachola kumulongela mndewa mbuli zose zilawilile. <verse eid="MAT 18:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 18:32"/>Avo mndewa kamkema msang'hanaji ayo, kamulongela. ‘Gweye kwa msang'hanaji wihile, niye nikulekelela deni jako kwavija kunipula nhende vivo. <verse eid="MAT 18:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 18:33"/>Kulondigwa umonele bazi msang'hanaji miyago kamba niye vinikonele bazi.’ <verse eid="MAT 18:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 18:34"/>Mndewa wake kagevuzika ng'hani, kamgodeka mkifungo mbaka vondayalihe deni jose.”<verse eid="MAT 18:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 18:35"/>Yesu kamambukiza, “Vino vivo Tatangu yeli kuulanga vonda yawatendeleni mweye, kamba hamuzigela kumgongo mbuli za ndugu zenu kwa mizoyo yenu yose.”<verse eid="MAT 18:35"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 18"/>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="MAT 19"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kofundiza mbuli ya nyasa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:1-12">Maluko 10:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 19:1"/>Yesu viyamambukize kulonga mbuli azo, kasegela isi ya Galilaya na kachola mwiisi ya Yudea, kuna umwambu wa lwanda lwa Yolidani. <verse eid="MAT 19:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 19:2"/>Lunhu mkulu lwa wanhu lumkweleleza, na kuko kawahonya wanhu wakalile watamu.<verse eid="MAT 19:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 19:3"/>Mafalisayo wayagwe wamcholela Yesu na wamgeza kwa kumuuza, “Vino vinoga mbigalo kumwasa mwehe wake kwa mbuli yoyose?”<verse eid="MAT 19:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 19:4"/>Yesu kawedika, “Vino hamugasomile bule Maandiko Gang'alile vigalonga kulawa kuna ichanduso, Imulungu kamulumba mbigalo na mtwanzi? <verse eid="MAT 19:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 19:5"/>Avo Imulungu kalonga, ‘Kwa mbuli ayo mbigalo komuleka tatake na mamake nayo koilumba na mwehe wake, na wabili awo okuwa kinhu kimoja. <verse eid="MAT 19:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 19:6"/>Avo haweli wabili kabili lakini kinhu kimoja. Avo kiyalumbilize Imulungu, munhu sikuyakigole.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 19:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 19:7"/>Mafalisayo wamuuza Yesu, “Habali Musa katugwaa lagizo kamba mbigalo kodaha kumgwaa kibua cha nyasa mwehe wake na kumwasa?”<verse eid="MAT 19:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 19:8"/>Yesu kawedika, “Musa kawagwaa lagizo muwaleke wehe zenu kwavija mizoyo yenu midala, lakini havikalile vivo bule kipindi Imulungu viyalumbile isi. <verse eid="MAT 19:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 19:9"/>Nowalongeleni, mbigalo yoyose yomwasa mwehe wake, na kumsola mtwanzi iyagwe, kotenda ugoni. Ila kodaha kumwasa mwehe wake kamba yahatenda ugoni.”<verse eid="MAT 19:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 19:10"/>Wanahina zake wamulongela, “Kamba vino vivo ili kwa mbigalo na mwehe wake, vinoga kuleka kusola.”<verse eid="MAT 19:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 19:11"/>Yesu kawedika, “Siyo kila munhu kodaha kuitogola mbuli ino, lakini waja wagweleligwe na Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 19:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 19:12"/>Kuna vilamuso vingi viwatenda wanhu waleke kusola, wayagwe waleligwa vivo, wayagwe watendigwa vivo na wanhu. Na wayagwe hawasola mbuli ya Undewa wa kuulanga. Lakini ija yodaha kugagoga mafundizo gano yagagoge.”<verse eid="MAT 19:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowatambikila wana wadodo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Maluko 10:13-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luka 18:15-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 19:13"/>Wanhu wayagwe wamgalila Yesu wana wadodo yawahagatile na kuwatambikila, lakini wanahina zake wawakomhokela. <verse eid="MAT 19:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 19:14"/>Yesu kalonga, “Walekeni wana wadodo weze kumwangu sikumuwagomese, kwavija Undewa wa kuulanga wa wanhu kamba wana wano.”<verse eid="MAT 19:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 19:15"/>Kawahagatila, abaho kasegela hanhu aho.<verse eid="MAT 19:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbwanga tajili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Maluko 10:17-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luka 18:18-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 19:16"/>Mbwanga imoja kamcholela Yesu, kamuuza, “Mfundiza nhende choni kinogile niupate ugima wa milele?”<verse eid="MAT 19:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 19:17"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Habali koniuza mbuli ya kinhu kinogile? Kuna imoja yaiyeka yanogile. Wahalonda kwingila muugima wa milele, gagoge malagizo ga Imulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 19:18"/>Kamuuza, “Malagizo gani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 19:18">Yesu kamwidika, “Sikuukome, sikuutende ugoni, sikuwibe, sikuulave usindila wa uvizi, <verse eid="MAT 19:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 19:19"/>wategeleze tatako na mamako, na umnogele miyago kamba viuinogela mwenyego.”<verse eid="MAT 19:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 19:20"/>Mbwanga ayo kamwidika, “Malagizo gano gose nigagoga. Choni kiyagwe kinilondigwa kutenda?”<verse eid="MAT 19:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 19:21"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Wahalonda udahe kutenda goyolonda Imulungu, genda kachuuze vinhu vose viuli navo na ukawagwelele wakiwa zisente, na gweye kokuwa na utajili kuulanga, abaho wize unikweleleze.”<verse eid="MAT 19:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 19:22"/>Mbwanga ija viyahulike avo, kasegela kuno kanyunyuwala, kwavija kakala tajili ng'hani.<verse eid="MAT 19:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 19:23"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela wanahina zake, “Nowalongeleni ukweli, yokuwa vidala ng'hani kwa munhu tajili kwingila Muundewa wa kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 19:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 19:24"/>Nowalongeleni kabili, vibuha kwa ngamiya kubita mna ikizonzo cha sanzia, kubanza tajili kwingila Muundewa wa Imulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 19:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 19:25"/>Wanahina zake viwahulike avo, wakanganya ng'hani wamuuza, “Vino nani yonda yadahe kukomboligwa?”<verse eid="MAT 19:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 19:26"/>Yesu kawalola bunhuu kawalongela, “Kwa munhu havidahika, lakini kwa Imulungu gose godahika.”<verse eid="MAT 19:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 19:27"/>Petulo kamwidika, “Lola siye tuleka kila kinhu na kukukweleleza gweye. Avo topata choni?”<verse eid="MAT 19:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 19:28"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongeleni ukweli, Mwana wa Munhu vondayakale mna ikigoda chake cha ukulu mna iisi yonda ize, mweye wanahina zangu longo na wabili mokala mna ivigoda va ukulu na mogatawala makabila longo na mabili ga Izilaeli. <verse eid="MAT 19:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 19:29"/>Munhu yoyose yalekile ng'anda hebu ndugu hebu lumbu jake hebu tatake hebu mamake hebu wanage hebu migunda mbuli ya niye kobokela miyanza gana kwa vija viyelinavo, na koupata ugima wa milele. <verse eid="MAT 19:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 19:30"/>Lakini wanhu wengi weli wa ichanduso okuwa wa ikimambukizo, na waja wa ikimambukizo okuwa wa ichanduso.<verse eid="MAT 19:30"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 19"/>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="MAT 20"/>
  <para style="s">Wasang'hanaji mumgunda wa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 20:1"/>“Undewa wa kuulanga uigala na kija kilawilile kwa munhu yeli na mgunda wa mizabibu, kalawa imitootondo ng'hani, kachola kugoneka wanhu wakasang'hane mumgunda wake. <verse eid="MAT 20:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 20:2"/>Kailagana nao yawalihe sente kwa sang'hano ya siku dimoja, abaho kawagala mumgunda wake wakasang'hane. <verse eid="MAT 20:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 20:3"/>Abaho saa ndatu kachola kudigulilo kawavika wanhu wema aho wabule cha kutenda. <verse eid="MAT 20:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 20:4"/>Avo kawalongela, ‘Mweye vivija gendeni kumgunda wangu mukasang'hane na nowaliha chochose cha kufaya.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 20:5"/>Avo wachola. Viivikile saa sita na saa tisa imisi ayo mwene mgunda kachola katenda vivija viyatendile ichanduso. <verse eid="MAT 20:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 20:6"/>Viivikile saa kumi na moja kachola na kawavika wanhu wayagwe wema, kawauza, ‘Habali mwima hano imisi yose mwabule cha kusang'hana?’ <verse eid="MAT 20:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 20:7"/>Wanhu waja wamwidika, ‘Kwavija kuduhu munhu yatugwelele sang'hano.’ Kawalongela, ‘Na mweye vivija mkasang'hane kumgunda wangu wa mizabibu!’<verse eid="MAT 20:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 20:8"/>“Viivikile ichungulo, munhu mwene mgunda kamulongela mwamizi wake wa mgunda, ‘Wakeme wanhu wasang'hane na uwalihe sente zao, kusongela waja wakimambukizo na waja wa ichanduso.’ <verse eid="MAT 20:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 20:9"/>Wanhu wasang'hane kusongela saa kumi na moja, walihigwa kila munhu sente imoja. <verse eid="MAT 20:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 20:10"/>Avo waja wanduse kusang'hana viwezile wagesa kamba olihigwa sente nyingi, lakini kila imoja wao kagweleligwa sente imoja. <verse eid="MAT 20:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 20:11"/>Wasola zisente na kusonga kumnung'unikila ija yawagoneke. <verse eid="MAT 20:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 20:12"/>Walonga, ‘Wanhu wano wagonekigwe kukimambukizo wasang'hana kwa saa dimoja diiyeka, siye tusang'hana siku ngima mdizuwa, abaho kuwaliha vivija viutulihile siye!’<verse eid="MAT 20:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 20:13"/>“Ija mwene mgunda kamwidika imoja wao, ‘Mbwigangu tegeleza, niye sikubunzile bule. Vino hatuilagane nikulihe sente imoja kwa kusang'hana siku dimoja? <verse eid="MAT 20:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 20:14"/>Sola sente yako uchole, niye ninogelwa kumliha munhu ino inimgoneke kukimambukizo kamba vinikulihile gweye. <verse eid="MAT 20:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 20:15"/>Vino havinogile bule niye kutenda kija kinilonda kwa sente zangu mwenyego? Hebu gweye kokona migongo kwavija niye nina moyo unogile?’ ”<verse eid="MAT 20:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 20:16"/>Yesu kamambukiza kulonga, “Avo wose weli wa ikimambukizo sambi okuwa wa ichanduso kumwande, na wose weli wa ichanduso sambi okuwa wa ikimambukizo kumwande.”<verse eid="MAT 20:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mwanza wa kadatu mbuli ya ifa yake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Maluko 10:32-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luka 18:31-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 20:17"/>Yesu viyakalile kochola Yelusalemu, kainega kumgwazo na wanahina zake longo na wabili, kawalongela, <verse eid="MAT 20:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 20:18"/>“Tegelezeni, tochola Yelusalemu, kuko Mwana wa Munhu kogeligwa mmakono ga wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa. Nao omtagusa yafe. <verse eid="MAT 20:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 20:19"/>Na omwika mmakono ga Wamhazi, nao omzeha omtowa mbalati na omkoma kwa kumuwamba mumsalaba, lakini siku da kadatu kozilibuka.”<verse eid="MAT 20:19"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kupula kwa mama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:35-45">Maluko 10:35-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 20:20"/>Abaho mwehe wa Zebedayo na wanage wabili kamcholela Yesu, kamfugamila kampula yamtendele kija kiyolonda.<verse eid="MAT 20:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 20:21"/>Yesu kamuuza, “Kolonda choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:21">Kamwidika, “Chonde, nhogolela wanangu wano wabili, imoja yakale mwambu wa mkono wako wa kudila na iyagwe mwambu wa mkono wako wa kumoso muundewa wako.”<verse eid="MAT 20:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 20:22"/>Yesu kawedika, “Hamkijuwile kinhu kimpula, vino modaha kuking'wela kikasi cha madununzo chonda niking'wele niye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 20:22">Wamwidika, “Todaha.”<verse eid="MAT 20:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 20:23"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Kweli moking'wela kikasi changu, lakini nabule udahi wa kusagula nani yakale mwambu wa mkono wangu wa kudila hebu wa kumoso. Hanhu aho wekiligwa wanhu wasaguligwe na Tatangu.”<verse eid="MAT 20:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 20:24"/>Baho wanahina longo viwahulike avo, wawagevuzikila ng'hani Yakobo na Yohana. <verse eid="MAT 20:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 20:25"/>Yesu kawakema wose hamoja kawalongela, “Mojuwa kamba wakulu wa wanhu wa mwiisi owalanguliza kwa nguvu, na wakulu wao wana udahi. <verse eid="MAT 20:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 20:26"/>Lakini haili vivo kumwenu. Munhu yoyose yolonda kuwa munhu mkulu, yawe msang'hanaji wa wose, <verse eid="MAT 20:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 20:27"/>na munhu yolonda kuwa wa ichanduso, yawe mtumwa wa wose. <verse eid="MAT 20:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 20:28"/>Kamba vija Mwana wa Munhu, hezile kusang'hanilwa, lakini keza kuwasang'hanila na kuulava ugima wake kwa kuwakombola wanhu wengi.”<verse eid="MAT 20:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowahonya wasuwameso wabili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Maluko 10:46-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luka 18:35-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 20:29"/>Yesu na wanahina zake viwakalile osegela kudibuga da Yeliko, lunhu lwa wanhu lumkweleleza. <verse eid="MAT 20:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 20:30"/>Wanhu wabili wasuwameso wakalile kumgwazo wa inzila, viwahulike Yesu kobita, wasonga kukemelela, “Mwana wa Daudi! Tonele bazi!”<verse eid="MAT 20:30"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 20:31"/>Lunhu lwa wanhu luwakomhokela luwalongela wanyamale. Lakini wagendelela kukemelela ng'hani, “Mwana wa Daudi! Tonele bazi!”<verse eid="MAT 20:31"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 20:32"/>Yesu kema kawakema kawauza, “Molonda niwatendele choni?”<verse eid="MAT 20:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 20:33"/>Wamwidika, “Go mkulu, tolonda kulola!”<verse eid="MAT 20:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 20:34"/>Yesu kawonela bazi kawakwasa meso gao, bahaja wadaha kulola, nao wamkweleleza.<verse eid="MAT 20:34"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 20"/>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="MAT 21"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kokwingila Yelusalemu kwa ng'henze</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Maluko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luka 19:28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yohana 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 21:1"/>Yesu na wanahina zake viwavikile Yelusalemu, wachola Betifage kuna Ulugongo lwa Mizeituni. Baho kawatuma wanahina zake wabili wamulongolele, <verse eid="MAT 21:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 21:2"/>kawalongela, “Gendeni kuna ikijiji kili kuulongozi wenu, aho momvika kihongwe kafungigwa na mwanage kumgwazo. Wafunguleni mungalile hano. <verse eid="MAT 21:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 21:3"/>Munhu yoyose yahawauza, mulongeleni, Mndewa kowalonda, nayo kowaleka wachole.”<verse eid="MAT 21:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 21:4"/>Gano gatendeka ili kiyalongile mtula ndagu wa Imulungu kilawilile,<verse eid="MAT 21:4"/></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 21:5"/>“Dilongele buga da Sayuni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Lola, mndewa wako kokwiza!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">Muhole na kakwela kihongwe na</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:5">mwanage kihongwe.”<verse eid="MAT 21:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 21:6"/>Avo wanahina wachola watenda vivija viyawalongele Yesu watende. <verse eid="MAT 21:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 21:7"/>Wamgala ija ikihongwe na mwanage, watandika viwalo vao mmigongo mwa waja ivihongwe, na Yesu kakwela uchanha. <verse eid="MAT 21:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 21:8"/>Lunhu lwa wanhu lwanzanza viwalo vao mnzila kuno wayagwe wabena mibunho na kuyanzanza mnzila ili yabite. <verse eid="MAT 21:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 21:9"/>Wanhu wakalile kuchugu na kuulongozi wa Yesu wakemelela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">“Yatogoligwe mwana wa Daudi!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Imulungu yamtambikile ija yokwiza kwa twaga da Mndewa!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:9">Imulungu yatogoligwe!”<verse eid="MAT 21:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 21:10"/>Yesu viyengile Yelusalemu, wanhu wose wa kudibuga wading'huka na waiuza, “Ino ayo nani?”<verse eid="MAT 21:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 21:11"/>Lunhu lwa wanhu lwidika, “Ino ayo Yesu, mtula ndagu wa Imulungu kolawa Nazaleti mwiisi ya Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 21:11"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kokwingila Mng'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Maluko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luka 19:45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yohana 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 21:12"/>Yesu kengila Mng'anda ya Imulungu, kawawinga wanhu wose wakalile ogula na kuchuuza vinhu. Kazibidula meza za wanhu wakalile ovunja sente na vigoda va wanhu wakalile ochuuza njiwa. <verse eid="MAT 21:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 21:13"/>Kawalongela, “Yandikigwa mna Gamaandiko Gang'alile, ‘Ng'anda yangu yokuwa kae ya kupulila.’ Lakini moitenda mhango ya wabavi!”<verse eid="MAT 21:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 21:14"/>Wasuwameso na wanhu mbetembete wamcholela Yesu kuna Ing'anda ya Imulungu, nayo kawahonya. <verse eid="MAT 21:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 21:15"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa wagevuzika viwonile mbuli za unzonza ziyakalile yotenda Yesu na wana viwakalile okemelela Mng'anda ya Imulungu, “Yatogoligwe Mwana wa Daudi!” <verse eid="MAT 21:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 21:16"/>Avo wamuuza Yesu, “Vino kohulika viwolonga wana wano?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:16">Yesu kawedika, “Mhulika, hamugasomile gaja Gamaandiko Gang'alile golonga, ‘Muwafundiza wana na ving'hele kulava nhogolwa inogile.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 21:17"/>Yesu kawaleka na kachola Betania kunze ya buga, kawasa kuko.<verse eid="MAT 21:17"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kodiduwila biki</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:12-14">Maluko 11:12-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:20-24">11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 21:18"/>Imitootondo, Yesu viyakalile kobwela mna idibuga, kakala na nzala. <verse eid="MAT 21:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 21:19"/>Behi na nzila kajona biki da mtini kadicholela, yalole kamba kodaha kupata tunda jojose, lakini honile kinhu ila majani gaiyeka. Avo kadilongela, “Sikuulele matunda ng'o!” Bahaja biki dijo dinyala gogodaa.<verse eid="MAT 21:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 21:20"/>Wanahina zake viwonile avo wakanganya ng'hani, waiuza, “Habali biki dino da mtini dinyala himahima?”<verse eid="MAT 21:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 21:21"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nowalongeleni ukweli kamba mwahatogola na kuleka kunyawanyawa, modaha kutenda kamba kija kinitendile kwa biki dino da mtini. Siyo kino kiiyeka, lakini modaha kukilongela kigongo kino, ‘Ng'oka ukayase mbahali,’ na yokuwa vivo. <verse eid="MAT 21:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 21:22"/>Kamba mwahatogola, mobokela chochose chonda mupule.”<verse eid="MAT 21:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya udahi wa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Maluko 11:27-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luka 20:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 21:23"/>Yesu kengila Mng'anda ya Imulungu, na viyakalile kofundiza, wakulu wa walava nhosa na wavele wamwizila wamuuza, “Vino kotenda gano gose kwa udahi wa nani? Nani yakugwelele udahi uno wa kutenda gano?”<verse eid="MAT 21:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 21:24"/>Yesu kawedika, “Nowauza mbuli imoja munilongele, na niye nowalongeleni kwa udahi wa nani notenda gano. <verse eid="MAT 21:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 21:25"/>Nongeleni, vino udahi wa Yohana wa kubatiza ulawa kwahi? Ulawa kwa Imulungu hebu ulawa kwa wanhu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:25">Wasonga kuilongela, “Twahalonga ulawa kwa Imulungu, kotuuza, ‘Habali hamumtogole Yohana?’ <verse eid="MAT 21:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 21:26"/>Lakini twahalonga, ‘Ulawa kwa wanhu,’ towadumba wanhu kwavija wose wamtogola Yohana kamba mtula ndagu wa Imulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 21:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 21:27"/>Avo wamwidika Yesu, “Hatujuwile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:27">Abaho Yesu kawalongela, “Na niye siwalongela bule notenda gano kwa udahi wa nani.”<verse eid="MAT 21:27"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa wana wabili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 21:28"/>“Mweye mogesaze? Munhu imoja kakala na wana wabili, kachola kwa ija mwana imkulu kamulongela, ‘Mwanangu, lelo chola ukasang'hane kumgunda wa mizabibu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 21:29"/>Nayo kamwidika, ‘Sichola bule.’ Lakini kumwande kidogo kagimbula na kuchola. <verse eid="MAT 21:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 21:30"/>Abaho tata ija kachola kwa mwana iyagwe kamulongela mbuli iija. Nayo kamwidika, ‘Ona tata nochola,’ lakini hacholile bule. <verse eid="MAT 21:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 21:31"/>Avo nani mna iwana waja wabili yatendile kija kiyalondile tatao?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Wamwidika, “Ija mwana imkulu.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 21:31">Avo Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongeleni wabokela kodi na wagoni owalongolela kwingila mna Undewa wa Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 21:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 21:32"/>Kwavija Yohana Mbatizaji keza kuwalagusila nzila inogile, na mweye hamumtogole lakini wabokela kodi na wagoni wamtogola. Vivija na mweye vimonile avo, hamulekile nzambi zenu na kumtogola.”<verse eid="MAT 21:32"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa walimaji mumgunda wa mizabibu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Maluko 12:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luka 20:9-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 21:33"/>Yesu kalonga, “Tegelezeni lusimo luyagwe, kukala na munhu imoja mwene mgunda kahanda mizabibu mumgunda wake, kazungulusila lwigo, kahimba hanhu ha kukamila zabibu, kazenga lingo na kawakodisha walimaji. Abaho kafunga mwanza kachola isi ya kutali. <verse eid="MAT 21:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 21:34"/>Msimu wa kubawa zabibu viuvikile, kawatuma wasang'hanaji zake kwa waja walimaji wamgalile zabibu kulawa mumgunda wake. <verse eid="MAT 21:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 21:35"/>Walimaji waja wawagoga wasang'hanaji awo, imoja wamtowa, iyagwe wamkoma, na iyagwe wamtowa mabwe. <verse eid="MAT 21:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 21:36"/>Kawatuma kabili wasang'hanaji wayagwe, wengi kubanza waja wa ichanduso, walimaji awo wawatendela vivija. <verse eid="MAT 21:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 21:37"/>Kukimambukizo kamtuma mwanage, kalonga, ‘Ino omtegeleza kwavija mwanangu.’ <verse eid="MAT 21:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 21:38"/>Lakini walimaji viwamonile mwanage, wailongela, ‘Ino ayo muhazi lekeni tumkome na tusole uhazi wake!’ <verse eid="MAT 21:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 21:39"/>Avo wamgoga na wamwasa kunze ya umgunda na wamkoma.”<verse eid="MAT 21:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 21:40"/>Yesu kawauza, “Vino munhu mwene mgunda yaheza kowatenda choni waja walimaji?”<verse eid="MAT 21:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 21:41"/>Wamwidika, “Kowakoma walimaji wose wehile na kowakodisha wanhu wayagwe mgunda awo, nao omgolela zabibu mumsimu wa kubawa zabibu.”<verse eid="MAT 21:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 21:42"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Hamusomile mna Gamaandiko Gang'alile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">‘Dibwe wadilemile wazengaji,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">sambi digalamuka dibwe kulu kubanza gose.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">Mbuli ino itendigwa na Mndewa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 21:42">nayo yotukanganya.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 21:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 21:43"/>Yesu kengeza kulonga, “Avo nowalongeleni ukweli, Undewa wa Imulungu obokigwa kumwenu na ogweleligwa wanhu olela matunda ganogile. <verse eid="MAT 21:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 21:44"/>Munhu yoyose yonda yaikwale mdibwe ajo kobeneka beneka na munhu donda dimulagalile domuhonda tipitipi.”<verse eid="MAT 21:44"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 21:45"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa na Mafalisayo viwahulike simo azo wajuwa kamba kakala kowalonga hewo. <verse eid="MAT 21:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 21:46"/>Avo wazahila nzila ya kumgogela, lakini waludumba lunhu lwa wanhu, kwavija wamtogola Yesu kakala mtula ndagu wa Imulungu.<verse eid="MAT 21:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 21"/>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="MAT 22"/>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa zengele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 14:15-24">Luka 14:15-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 22:1"/>Yesu kalonga nao kabili kwa simo, kawalongela, <verse eid="MAT 22:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 22:2"/>“Undewa wa kuulanga uigala na kija kilawilile kwa mndewa yamtandile mwanage wa kimbigalo zengele. <verse eid="MAT 22:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 22:3"/>Kawatuma wasang'hanaji zake wawalongele waja wagonekigwe weze kuna idizengele, lakini waja wagonekigwe walema kwiza. <verse eid="MAT 22:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 22:4"/>Avo kawatuma wasang'hanaji wayagwe kawalongela, ‘Walongeleni vino waja wagonekigwe kuna idizengele, zengele jangu niditanda, nyhinja ng'ombe wanonile, kila kinhu nimala kukitanda goya. Izoni kuna idizengele!’ <verse eid="MAT 22:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 22:5"/>Lakini waja wagonekigwe hawatongile bule, kila munhu kachola kuna isang'hano yake, imoja kumgunda wake, na iyagwe kuna ibiyashala yake. <verse eid="MAT 22:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 22:6"/>Wayagwe wawagoga wasang'hanaji zake, wawatowa na kuwakoma. <verse eid="MAT 22:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 22:7"/>Mndewa kagevuzika ng'hani, avo kawatuma wakalizi zake wakawakome waja wawakomile wasang'hanaji zake na wadisome moto buga jao. <verse eid="MAT 22:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 22:8"/>Abaho kawakema wasang'hanaji zake na kawalongela, ‘Zengele jangu nimala kuditanda, lakini wanhu wagonekigwe kuna idizengele hawafaya kugonekigwa.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 22:9"/>Avo choleni kuna izinzila na munhu yoyose yonda mumone mumgoneke yeze kudizengele. <verse eid="MAT 22:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 22:10"/>Avo wasang'hanaji wachola mna izinzila na wawagala wanhu wose wawavikile, wanogile na wehile, avo gati da zengele dimema wanhu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 22:11"/>“Mndewa viyengile kuwalola wageni zake, kamona munhu imoja havalile kiwalo cha zengele. <verse eid="MAT 22:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 22:12"/>Kamuuza, ‘Mbwigangu, kwingilaze muno kuno kwabule kiwalo cha zengele?’ Lakini munhu ayo hamwidike bule. <verse eid="MAT 22:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 22:13"/>Abaho mndewa kawalongela wasang'hanaji, ‘Mfungeni magulu na makono, mumwase kunze kudiziza ako kolila na kudafuna meno.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 22:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 22:14"/>Yesu kamambukiza kwa kulonga, “Wagonekigwe wengi, lakini wasaguligwe wadodo.”<verse eid="MAT 22:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kuliha kodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Maluko 12:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luka 20:20-26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 22:15"/>Mafalisayo walawanya wamkalila kiseto Yesu wamgoge kwa mbuli zake. <verse eid="MAT 22:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 22:16"/>Wawatuma wanahina zao hamoja na wanhu wayagwe mna ikibumbila cha Helode. Walonga, “Mfundiza, tokujuwa gweye kwa munhu ulonga ukweli na kofundiza nzila za Imulungu mna ikweli. Humdumba munhu yoyose, kwavija hutonga ukulu wa munhu. <verse eid="MAT 22:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 22:17"/>Tulongele, gweye kokonaze? Vino vinoga kuliha kodi kwa Mndewa wa Lumi hebu havinogile bule?”<verse eid="MAT 22:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 22:18"/>Lakini Yesu kagajuwa magesa gao gehile, kawalongela, “Mweye mwa watapitapi, habali monigeza? <verse eid="MAT 22:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 22:19"/>Ndagusileni isente imulihilaga kodi!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:19">Nao wamgalila isente. <verse eid="MAT 22:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 22:20"/>Nayo kawauza, “Vino kihanga kino cha nani? Na twaga dino da nani?”<verse eid="MAT 22:20"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 22:21"/>Nao wamwidika, “Va Mndewa wa Lumi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:21">Abaho Yesu kawalongela, “Mgweleleni Mndewa wa Lumi vili va Mndewa wa Lumi, na mgweleleni Imulungu vili va Imulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 22:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 22:22"/>Viwahulike avo, wakanganya, wamuleka wasegela.<verse eid="MAT 22:22"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kuzilibuka kwa wafile</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Maluko 12:18-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luka 20:27-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 22:23"/>Siku didija Masadukayo wayagwe wanhu olonga kuduhu kuzilibuka wamcholela Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 22:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 22:24"/>Walonga, “Mfundiza, Musa katulongela mbigalo yahafa yang'hali hanalela wana, ndugu yake kolondigwa yamsole mgane ayo, ili yalele nayo wana mbuli ya ndugu yake. <verse eid="MAT 22:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 22:25"/>Hano kumwetu kukala na ndugu saba. Ija imkulu kasola mwehe na kafa halekile wana, na mdodo wake kamuhala mgane ayo. <verse eid="MAT 22:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 22:26"/>Kinhu kikija kimulawilila mwana wa kabili, wa kadatu mbaka wose saba. <verse eid="MAT 22:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 22:27"/>Ako kumwande, mtwanzi ija nayo kafa. <verse eid="MAT 22:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 22:28"/>Mna isiku ya kuzilibuka wanhu wafile, mtwanzi ayo kokuwa wa nani? Kwavija wose saba wakala wamsolile.”<verse eid="MAT 22:28"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 22:29"/>Yesu kawedika, “Mweye mopotela! Kwavija hamugajuwile Maandiko Gang'alile hebu udahi wa Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 22:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 22:30"/>Kwavija mna isiku ya kuzilibuka wanhu wafile, wanhu hawasola wala hawasoligwa okuwa kamba wasenga wa kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 22:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 22:31"/>Lakini kwa mbuli ya kuzilibuka kwa wanhu, hamusomile kija kiyawalongele Imulungu? Kalonga, <verse eid="MAT 22:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 22:32"/>‘Niye na Imulungu wa Abulahamu, Imulungu wa Isaka, Imulungu wa Yakobo.’ Heyo heli Imulungu wa wanhu wafile, ila Imulungu wa wanhu wagima.”<verse eid="MAT 22:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 22:33"/>Lunhu lwa wanhu viluhulike avo, lukanganya kwa mafundizo gake.<verse eid="MAT 22:33"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lagizo kulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:28-34">Maluko 12:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luka 10:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 22:34"/>Mafalisayo viwahulike kamba Yesu kawatenda Masadukayo wanyamale tuluu, waiting'hana hamoja, <verse eid="MAT 22:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 22:35"/>na imoja wao, kakala munhu yagajuwile goya Malagizo ga Musa, kamgeza Yesu kwa kumuuza, <verse eid="MAT 22:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 22:36"/>“Mfundiza, mna Gamalagizo lagizo gani dili kulu?”<verse eid="MAT 22:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 22:37"/>Yesu kamwidika, “ ‘Mnogele Mndewa Imulungu wako kwa moyo wako wose, kwa loho yako yose na kwa nzewele zako zose.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 22:38"/>Dino ijo lagizo dili kulu na da ichanduso. <verse eid="MAT 22:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 22:39"/>Da kabili doigala na dino, ‘Mnogele miyago kamba viuinogela mwenyego.’ <verse eid="MAT 22:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 22:40"/>Malagizo gose ga Musa na mafundizo ga watula ndagu wa Imulungu gema mna gamalagizo gano mabili.”<verse eid="MAT 22:40"/></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya Kilisito Mkombola</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Maluko 12:35-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luka 20:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 22:41"/>Mafalisayo viwaiting'hane hamoja, Yesu kawauza, <verse eid="MAT 22:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 22:42"/>“Vino mweye mogesa choni kwa mbuli ya Kilisito? Mwanage nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 22:42">Wamwidika, “Mwanage Daudi.”<verse eid="MAT 22:42"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 22:43"/>Yesu kawauza, “Habali Loho Yang'alile kamulongoza Daudi yamkeme, ‘Mndewa’? Kwavija kalonga, <verse eid="MAT 22:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 22:44"/>‘Mndewa Imulungu kamulongela Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">Kala hano mwambu wa mkono wangu wa kudila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="MAT 22:44">mbaka niweke hasi mmagulu gako wanhu wakwihile.’<verse eid="MAT 22:44"/></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 22:45"/>Kamba Daudi komkema ‘Mndewa’, yokuwaze Kilisito yawe mwanage Daudi?”<verse eid="MAT 22:45"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 22:46"/>Kuduhu munhu yamwidike, kulawa siku dijo na kugendelela kuduhu munhu yagezile kumuuza Yesu mbuli yoyose.<verse eid="MAT 22:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 22"/>
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="MAT 23"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowazuma wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:38-39">Maluko 12:38-39</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:43">Luka 11:43</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:46">46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-46">20:45-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 23:1"/>Abaho Yesu kalulongela ulunhu na wanahina zake, <verse eid="MAT 23:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 23:2"/>kawalongela, “Wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo wana udahi wa kufambula Malagizo ga Musa. <verse eid="MAT 23:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 23:3"/>Avo gogeni na mtende gaja gose gonda wawalongeleni, lakini sikumutende gaja gowotenda hewo, kwavija hawatenda gaja gowopetela wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 23:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 23:4"/>Owadikwa wanhu mgamaega mbahasha ng'hulu na kuno hewo wenyego hawalonda kugolosa makono kuwataza kupapa. <verse eid="MAT 23:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 23:5"/>Gose gowotenda, otenda ili wakoneke na wanhu. Kwavija ovala vikumbi vandikigwe Maandiko Gang'alile mna ivihanga vao na ofunga mna gamakono gao, na ovala viwalo vili na vinhu vitali oneke kamba wailava kwa Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 23:6"/>Onogezwa kukala hanhu hanogile mna izinyimwilinyimwili na kukala mna ivigoda va haulongozi mna izing'anda za kumpula Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 23:7"/>Onogezwa kulamusigwa na wanhu mna gamagulilo na kukemigwa na wanhu, ‘Mfundiza’. <verse eid="MAT 23:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 23:8"/>Lakini mweye sikumukemigwe ‘Mfundiza’. Kwavija mweye mwa wanhu wa lubuga lumoja na Mfundiza wenu imoja. <verse eid="MAT 23:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 23:9"/>Sikumumkeme munhu yoyose hano mwiisi, ‘Tata’, kwavija munayo Tata imoja yeli kuulanga. <verse eid="MAT 23:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 23:10"/>Vivija sikumukemigwe, ‘Vilongozi’, kwavija munayo kilongozi imoja, nayo ayo Kilisito Mkombola <verse eid="MAT 23:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 23:11"/>Yeli mkulu hagati yenu yawe msang'hanaji wenu. <verse eid="MAT 23:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 23:12"/>Munhu yoyose yoitenda mwenyego mkulu kotendigwa mdodo, na munhu yoyose yoitenda mwenyego mdodo kotendigwa mkulu.<verse eid="MAT 23:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koukomhokela utapitapi wao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:40">Maluko 12:40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:39-42">Luka 11:39-42</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:44">44</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 11:52">52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:47">20:47</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 23:13"/>“Mogaya mweye wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, mweye mwa watapitapi! Mohinda mulango wa Undewa wa kuulanga mgameso ga wanhu, kuno mweye wenyego hamwingila, wala hamulonda kuwatogolela waja olonda kwingila wengile! <verse eid="MAT 23:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 23:14"/>Mogaya mweye wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, mweye mwa watapitapi! Mosola vinhu vili mzikae za wagane, abaho moitenda munoga kwa kulonga mbuli nyingi mwahampula Imulungu! Mbuli ya gano nhaguso yenu yokuwa ng'hulu ng'hani.<verse eid="MAT 23:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 23:15"/>“Mogaya mweye wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, mweye mwa watapitapi! Moloka bahali na kuchola mziisi ili mumpate munhu wa kutogola kamba vimutogola mweye, na mwahampata momtenda yehe miyanza mibili kubanza mweye kwa kwiingila jehanamu!<verse eid="MAT 23:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 23:16"/>“Mogaya mweye vilongozi hamulola! ‘Mofundiza munhu yahaiduwila kwa Ng'anda ya Imulungu siyo mbuli. Lakini yahaiduwila kwa zahabu ili Mng'anda ya Imulungu, koifunga mwenyego.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 23:17"/>Mweye hamulola na wabozi! Kilihi kili kikulu, zahabu hebu Ng'anda ya Imulungu iitenda zahabu ing'ale? <verse eid="MAT 23:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 23:18"/>Vivija mweye mofundiza, ‘Munhu yahaiduwila kwa upango wa kulavila nhosa siyo mbuli, lakini yahaiduwila kwa nhosa ili muupango, koifunga mwenyego.’ <verse eid="MAT 23:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 23:19"/>Mweye hamulola! Kilihi kili kikulu, inhosa hebu uupango wa kulavila nhosa uitenda inhosa ing'ale? <verse eid="MAT 23:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 23:20"/>Avo munhu yahaiduwila kwa upango wa kulavila nhosa, koiduwila kwa upango wa kulavila nhosa hamoja na nhosa yose ili uchanha yake, <verse eid="MAT 23:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 23:21"/>na ija yoiduwila kwa Ng'anda ya Imulungu, kaiduwila kwa Ng'anda ayo ya Imulungu na kwa Imulungu yokala mumo. <verse eid="MAT 23:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 23:22"/>Yoyose yoiduwila kwa ulanga, koiduwila kwa kigoda cha undewa cha Imulungu na kwa ayo yokikalila.<verse eid="MAT 23:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 23:23"/>“Mogaya mweye wafundiza Malagizo na Mafalisayo, mweye mwa watapitapi! Momgwaa Imulungu fungu da longo da majani gonung'hila goya, binzali na kalafuu, lakini moleka kugagoga mafundizo makulu Gamalagizo, kamba vija haki, bazi na kutamanila. Molondigwa kugatenda gano na sikumugaleke gaja gayagwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 23:24"/>Mweye vilongozi hamulola! Molava ng'honzi mgamazi lakini momeza ngamiya!<verse eid="MAT 23:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 23:25"/>“Mogaya mweye wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, mweye mwa watapitapi! Mosunha kikasi na sahani kwa kunze, lakini moleka mgati mmema vinhu vimpatile kwa kuboka na ugila. <verse eid="MAT 23:25"/><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 23:26"/>Gweye Mfalisayo hulola! Tanhu sunha mgati ya kikasi na kunze kokuwa kuzelu.<verse eid="MAT 23:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 23:27"/>“Mogaya mweye wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, mweye mwa watapitapi! Muigala na vikuta va mapanga vibakigwe langi nzelu, kwa kunze gokoneka ganoga, lakini mgati gamema mizege ya wanhu wafile na kila kinhu kihile. <verse eid="MAT 23:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 23:28"/>Vivija na mweye kwa kunze mokoneka kamba wanhu munogile, lakini mgati mmwenu mmema utapitapi na nzambi.”<verse eid="MAT 23:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolagula nhaguso yao</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 11:47-51">Luka 11:47-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 23:29"/>“Mogaya mweye wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na Mafalisayo, mweye mwa watapitapi! Mozengela vikuta va mapanga ga watula ndagu wa Imulungu na kugahamba mapanga ga wanhu wanogile. <verse eid="MAT 23:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 23:30"/>Mweye molonga maza tukalile mna ikipindi cha wahenga zetu, sambituilumbe nao kuwakoma watula ndagu wa Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 23:31"/>Avo moilagusa wenyego kamba mwa wazukulu wa hewo wawakomile watula ndagu wa Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 23:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 23:32"/>Avo mambukizeni kija wakisongile wahenga zenu. <verse eid="MAT 23:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 23:33"/>Mweye mizoka na wana wa mizoka! Modahaze kuikimbila nhaguso ya jehanamu? <verse eid="MAT 23:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 23:34"/>Avo nowagalila watula ndagu wa Imulungu na wanhu weli na nzewele, na wafundiza. Wayagwe mowakoma, wayagwe mowawamba na wayagwe mowatowa mbalati mna zing'anda za kumpula Imulungu na kuwawinga kulawa buga dino wachole buga diyagwe. <verse eid="MAT 23:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 23:35"/>Avo damu yose ya wanhu wanogile itike mwiisi yodaigwa kumwenu, kusongela damu ya Habili ija yakalile yanogile, mbaka damu ya Zakalia mwana wa Balakia yumumkomile hagati ya Ng'anda ya Imulungu na upango wa kulavila nhosa. <verse eid="MAT 23:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 23:36"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli, nhaguso ya ukomaji wose uno yokuwa mna iwanhu wa lukolo luno!<verse eid="MAT 23:36"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowanogela wanhu wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 13:34-35">Luka 13:34-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 23:37"/>“Gweye Yelusalemu, Gweye Yelusalemu! Kowakoma watula ndagu wa Imulungu na kuwatowa kwa mabwe waja Imulungu yawatumile kumwako! Miyanza mingapi nilonda kuwahagata wanago kwa makono gangu, kamba vija nguku viyovihagata vinziya vake mna gamabawa gake, lakini hulondile bule. <verse eid="MAT 23:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 23:38"/>Avo Ng'anda yako ya Imulungu ilekigwa ukiwa. <verse eid="MAT 23:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 23:39"/>Nowalongeleni, honda mumbone kabili mbaka vonda mulonge, ‘Imulungu yamtambikile ija yokwiza kwa twaga da Mndewa.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 23:39"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 23"/>
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="MAT 24"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolonga mbuli ya kubanangika kwa Ng'anda ya Imulungu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:1-2">Maluko 13:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luka 21:5-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 24:1"/>Yesu viyakalile kolawa Mng'anda ya Imulungu, wanahina zake wamcholela, wamulagusile ng'anda zili behi na Ng'anda ya Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 24:2"/>Yesu kawauza, “Mogona gano gose? Nowalongela ukweli, haduhu dibwe donda dilekigwe uchanha ya diyagwe, kila dibwe dokwasigwa hasi.”<verse eid="MAT 24:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kugaya na kudununzika</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Maluko 13:3-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luka 21:7-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 24:3"/>Yesu viyakalile kuna Ulugongo lwa Mizeituni, wanahina zake weli waiyeka wamgendela, wamuuza, “Tulongele, yolawilila lini? Na choni chondakitendeke kulagusa kwiza kwako na kimambukizo cha isi?”<verse eid="MAT 24:3"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 24:4"/>Yesu kawedika, “Muiteganye, munhu yoyose sikuyawavizile. <verse eid="MAT 24:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 24:5"/>Kwavija wanhu wengi okwiza kwa twaga jangu na kulonga, ‘Niye ayo Kilisito!’ Nao owavizila wanhu wengi. <verse eid="MAT 24:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 24:6"/>Mohulika ng'hondo na mbuli zake, lakini sikumudumbe, kwavija gano gose golondigwa galawilile, ila kimambukizo king'hali kuvika. <verse eid="MAT 24:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 24:7"/>Isi yoitowa na isi iyagwe, undewa oitowa na undewa uyagwe. Kila hanhu hokuwa na lufilili lwa nzala na mitigisiko mikulu ya isi. <verse eid="MAT 24:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 24:8"/>Gano gose kamba mwanduso wa usungu wa kulela mwana.<verse eid="MAT 24:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 24:9"/>“Abaho mogogigwa, modununzigwa na kukomigwa. Wanhu wa isi zose owehila mbuli ya niye. <verse eid="MAT 24:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 24:10"/>Kipindi acho wanhu wengi oleka kutamanila kwao, oihinduka na oihila, <verse eid="MAT 24:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 24:11"/>na watula ndagu wengi wa uvizi olawilila na kuwavizila wanhu wengi. <verse eid="MAT 24:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 24:12"/>Mbuli ya kongezeka kwa gehile, unogelwa wa wanhu wengi ohunguka, <verse eid="MAT 24:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 24:13"/>lakini munhu yonda yafunge umoyo mbaka kukimambukizo kokomboligwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 24:14"/>Na kimambukizo king'hali hakinavika, Mbuli Inogile ya Undewa yopetigwa kwa wanhu wa kabila zose iwe usindila kwa isi zose.<verse eid="MAT 24:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Magayo makulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:14-23">Maluko 13:14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luka 21:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 24:15"/>“Muhachona, ‘Kinhu kinyolodoke kigala Ubananzi’ kilongigwe na mtula ndagu wa Imulungu Danieli, kima Mng'anda ya Imulungu. Ija yosoma yajuwe. <verse eid="MAT 24:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 24:16"/>Abaho wanhu weli mwiisi ya Yudea wakimbilile kuna ikigongo.” <verse eid="MAT 24:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 24:17"/>Munhu yeli mkiswili cha ng'anda yake, sikuyahumuluke hasi mna ing'anda yake kusola kinhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 24:18"/>Yeli kumgunda sikuyabwele ukae kusola kiwalo chake. <verse eid="MAT 24:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 24:19"/>Ogaya watwanzi wali na zinda na waja okong'heza mna izisiku azo. <verse eid="MAT 24:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 24:20"/>Mpuleni Imulungu ili sikumukimbile mumsimu wa kihuhwe hebu mna isiku ya Kubwihila! <verse eid="MAT 24:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 24:21"/>Kwavija siku ayo kokuwa na magayo makulu, haganalawila toka kulumbigwa kwa isi mbaka sambi na honda galawilile kabili. <verse eid="MAT 24:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 24:22"/>Imulungu kazihunguza siku azo, maza hazihunguze sambi yahone munhu yoyose. Lakini mbuli ya wanhu zake yawasagule, Imulungu kozihunguza siku azo.<verse eid="MAT 24:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 24:23"/>“Avo, munhu yoyose yahawalongela, ‘Amweye, Kilisito Mkombola kahano!’ hebu ‘Ka ako!’ sikumutogole. <verse eid="MAT 24:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 24:24"/>Kwavija olawilila makilisito na watula ndagu wa uvizi, otenda unzonza na vilaguso ili yahadahika wawavizile hata waja wasaguligwe na Imulungu. <verse eid="MAT 24:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 24:25"/>Tegelezeni! Niwalongela mbuli zino kipindi king'hali hakinavika.”<verse eid="MAT 24:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 24:26"/>“Avo munhu yoyose yahawalongela, ‘Loleni, kakuja kuluwala!’ sikumuchole, hebu yahalonga, ‘Loleni, kaifisa hano!’ sikumutogole. <verse eid="MAT 24:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 24:27"/>Kamba vija lumwesa lumwemwesa ulanga wose kulawa kudilawila zuwa mbaka kudihongela vivo vonda yoneke Mwana wa Munhu yaheza.”<verse eid="MAT 24:27"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 24:28"/>“Kokose kuli na mzoga, baho hoiting'hana mhungu.”<verse eid="MAT 24:28"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Mwana wa Munhu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Maluko 13:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luka 21:25-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 24:29"/>“Gahamala magayo ga siku azo, zuwa dokuwa ziza, mbalamwezi honda imwemwese bule, nhondo zolagala kulawa kuulanga, na vinhu vili kuulanga votigisika. <verse eid="MAT 24:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 24:30"/>Abaho kilaguso cha Mwana wa Munhu cholawilila kuulanga, wanhu wa mwiisi yose olila vonda wamone Mwana wa Munhu kokwiza mna gamawingu ga kuulanga kwa nguvu na ukulu. <verse eid="MAT 24:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 24:31"/>Mhalati yotoigwa, na kowatuma wasenga zake wa kuulanga mna izibanzi nne za mwiisi, nao oweka hamoja wanhu zake yawasagule kulawa mwambu uno wa isi na uyagwe.<verse eid="MAT 24:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Fundizo da biki da mtini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Maluko 13:28-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luka 21:29-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 24:32"/>“Ifunzeni kubitila biki da mtini, matambi gake gahasonga kuzuka na kwika majani, mujuwe kamba vuli da mmabehi. <verse eid="MAT 24:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 24:33"/>Vivija, mwahazona mbuli azo, mojuwa kamba kammabehi kwiza. <verse eid="MAT 24:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 24:34"/>Nowalongeleni ukweli, wanhu wa lukolo luno hawafa wose mbaka gano gose galawilile. <verse eid="MAT 24:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 24:35"/>Ulanga na isi vobita, lakini mbuli zangu hondazibite ng'o.<verse eid="MAT 24:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuduhu yaijuwile siku hebu saa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 13:32-37">Maluko 13:32-37</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:26-30">Luka 17:26-30</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 17:34-36">34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 24:36"/>“Kuduhu yaijuwile siku hebu saa ya kwiza, siyo wasenga wa kuulanga wala Mwana,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:36 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Wala Mwana yamduhu mna ivitabu vose va kigiliki</char></note> lakini Tata yaiyeka ayo yaijuwile. <verse eid="MAT 24:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 24:37"/>Kwiza kwa Mwana wa Munhu kuigala na kija kilawilile kipindi cha Nuhu. <verse eid="MAT 24:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 24:38"/>Kwavija kipindi kija ing'hali hainatowa mvula ng'hulu wanhu waja na kung'wa, wanhu wasola na kusoligwa, mbaka mna isiku ija Nuhu viyengile mna idisafina. <verse eid="MAT 24:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 24:39"/>Lakini wanhu hawajuwile chondakilawilile mbaka mvula ng'hulu viitowile na kuwafagila wose. Vivo vonda iwe kipindi Mwana wa Munhu yaheza. <verse eid="MAT 24:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 24:40"/>Kipindi acho wanhu wabili okuwa kumgunda, imoja kosoligwa na iyagwe kolekigwa. <verse eid="MAT 24:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 24:41"/>Watwanzi wabili okuwa oduga, imoja kosoligwa na iyagwe kolekigwa.<verse eid="MAT 24:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 24:42"/>“Avo muiteganye, kwavija hamuijuwile siku ya kwiza Mndewa wenu. <verse eid="MAT 24:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 24:43"/>Lakini mujuwe vino, maza mwene ng'anda yahaijuwile siku ya kwiza mbavi, yahakalile meso na sambi yamuleke mbavi yaitule ng'anda yake. <verse eid="MAT 24:43"/><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 24:44"/>Avo, muitande siku zose, kwavija Mwana wa Munhu kokwiza mna isaa hamuigesile bule.<verse eid="MAT 24:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Msang'hanaji yotamaniligwa na hatamaniligwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 12:41-48">Luka 12:41-48</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 24:45"/>“Nani yeli msang'hanaji yotamaniligwa na yeli na nzewele? Ayo ija mkulu wake kamwika yawalolese goya wasang'hanaji wayagwe na kowagwaa ndiya mna isaa inogile. <verse eid="MAT 24:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 24:46"/>Kamweda msang'hanaji ija kamba mkulu wake yahabwela komvika kosang'hana vivo! <verse eid="MAT 24:46"/><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 24:47"/>Nowalongela ukweli, mkulu wake komwika msang'hanaji ayo yawe mulolesaji wa vinhu vake vose. <verse eid="MAT 24:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 24:48"/>Lakini yahawa msang'hanaji hatamaniligwa, koilongela mwenyego, ‘Mkulu wangu kokawa kubwela,’ <verse eid="MAT 24:48"/><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 24:49"/>na kosonga kuwatowa wasang'hanaji wayage na kuja na kung'wa hamoja na walevi. <verse eid="MAT 24:49"/><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 24:50"/>Abaho mkulu wake kobwela mna isiku msang'hanaji ija haigesile na mna isaa haijuwile bule. <verse eid="MAT 24:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 24:51"/>Mkulu ayo komtowa ng'hani na kumwika hamoja na watapitapi. Baho kolila na kudafuna meno.”<verse eid="MAT 24:51"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 24"/>
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="MAT 25"/>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa wali longo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 25:1"/>“Undewa wa kuulanga oigala na kija kilawilile kwa wali longo wasolile taa zao na kuchola kumbokela munhu yosola. <verse eid="MAT 25:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 25:2"/>Wali watano wakala wabozi na watano wakala wabala. <verse eid="MAT 25:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 25:3"/>Waja iwabozi wasola taa zao, lakini hawasolile ngama yoyose ya mavuta. <verse eid="MAT 25:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 25:4"/>Waja iwabala wasola nyhupa zimemile za mavuta hamoja na taa zao. <verse eid="MAT 25:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 25:5"/>Munhu yosola viyakawile kwiza, wali wose wasonga kukukila na wawasa.<verse eid="MAT 25:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 25:6"/>“Kilo kikulu, kulawilila nyangi, ‘Msola mwehe kavika! Laweni mukambokele!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 25:7"/>Wali wose walamuka wazitanda taa zao. <verse eid="MAT 25:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 25:8"/>Waja iwabozi wawalongela waja iwabala, ‘Mtuhunguzile mavuta genu kidogo kwavija taa zetu zolonda kufa.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 25:9"/>Lakini waja iwabala wawedika, ‘Bule, twabule mavuta gakutwenela siye na mweye. Vinoga muchole mkagule genu.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 25:10"/>Avo waja iwabozi wachola kugula mavuta, viwakalile ochola, munhu yosola kavika. Waja watano waitandile wengila nayo mna ing'anda ya dizengele, lwivi luhindigwa.<verse eid="MAT 25:10"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 25:11"/>“Kumwande kidogo waja iwali wabozi wavika, wasonga kukemelela, ‘Go mkulu, go mkulu! Tuvugulile!’ <verse eid="MAT 25:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 25:12"/>Ayo yosola kawedika, ‘Bule! Niye siwajuwile bule mweye.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 25:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 25:13"/>Yesu kamambukiza kwa kulonga, “Muiteganye, kwavija hamuijuwile siku hebu saa.<verse eid="MAT 25:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Lusimo lwa wasang'hanaji wadatu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="LUK 19:11-27">Luka 19:11-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 25:14"/>“Vivija Undewa wa kuulanga uigala na kija kilawilile kwa munhu imoja yafungile mwanza, kawakema wasang'hanaji zake kaweka walole goya vinhu vake. <verse eid="MAT 25:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 25:15"/>Kila imoja kamgwaa kamba viyadahile, imoja kamgwaa mifuko mitano ya sente, iyagwe kamgwaa mifuko mibili ya sente, na iyagwe kamgwaa mfuko umoja wa sente. Abaho kachola mwanza wake. <verse eid="MAT 25:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 25:16"/>Msang'hanaji yagweleligwe mifuko mitano ya sente kachola kazisang'hanila zisente kapata mifuko mitano iyagwe ya sente. <verse eid="MAT 25:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 25:17"/>Vivija msang'hanaji yagweleligwe mifuko mibili ya sente kazisang'hanila na kupata mifuko mibili iyagwe ya sente. <verse eid="MAT 25:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 25:18"/>Lakini msang'hanaji yagweleligwe mfuko umoja wa sente, kachola kauhimbila mfuko wa sente wa mkulu wake.<verse eid="MAT 25:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 25:19"/>“Vizibitile siku nyingi mkulu wao awo iwasang'hanaji kabwela kapeta zisente hamoja nao. <verse eid="MAT 25:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 25:20"/>Msang'hanaji yagweleligwe mifuko mitano ya sente keza kagala mifuko mitano iyagwe ya sente, kalonga, ‘Go mkulu, kunigwaa mifuko mitano ya sente, lola mhata mifuko mitano iyagwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 25:21"/>Mkulu wake kalonga, ‘Kutenda goya, msang'hanaji unogile na utamaniligwa! Kwavija kotamaniligwa kwa kulolesa vinhu vidodo, avo nokwika ulolese vinhu vingi. Wize udeng'helele hamoja na niye!’<verse eid="MAT 25:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 25:22"/>“Abaho msang'hanaji ija yagweleligwe mifuko mibili ya sente keza kalonga, ‘Go mkulu, kunigwaa mifuko mibili ya sente, lola mhata mifuko mibili iyagwe.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 25:23"/>Mkulu wake kalonga, ‘Kutenda goya, msang'hanaji unogile na utamaniligwa! Kwavija kotamaniligwa kwa kulolesa vinhu vidodo, avo nokwika ulolese vinhu vingi. Wize udeng'helele hamoja na niye!’<verse eid="MAT 25:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 25:24"/>“Abaho msang'hanaji ija yabokele mfuko umoja wa sente keza, kalonga, ‘Go mkulu, nikujuwa gweye kuna gahigahi, kosenga hanhu huhahandile, kokwika hamoja indiya hanhu huhamizile mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 25:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 25:25"/>Avo nidumba, nyhola niuhimbila mfuko wako wa sente. Lola, uno awo mfuko wako wa sente.’<verse eid="MAT 25:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 25:26"/>“Mkulu wake kamwidika, ‘Gweye kwa msang'hanaji wihile na mnyeke! Ona, kujuwa nosenga hanhu sihahandile na kwika hamoja hanhu sihamizile mbeyu. <verse eid="MAT 25:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 25:27"/>Wahawikile mfuko wangu wa sente kwa iwanhu okwika sente, ili vonda mbwele na niye nyambulile faida. <verse eid="MAT 25:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 25:28"/>Sambi baha, mbokeni umfuko wa sente mumgwee ayo yeli na mifuko longo ya sente. <verse eid="MAT 25:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 25:29"/>Kwavija munhu yoyose yeli na kinhu kokongezelwa, lakini ija yelibule kinhu, kobokigwa hata kija kidodo kiyelinacho. <verse eid="MAT 25:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 25:30"/>Na msang'hanaji ino yehile mwaseni kunze kudiziza, ako kolila na kudafuna meno.’<verse eid="MAT 25:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Nhaguso ya kimambukizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 25:31"/>“Mwana wa Munhu yeli Mndewa vonda yeze muukulu wake, hamoja na wasenga zake wa kuulanga, kokala mkigoda chake cha undewa. <verse eid="MAT 25:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 25:32"/>Wanhu wose mwiisi oiting'hana haulongozi wake, nayo kowabagula kamba msusilaji viyowabagula ng'hondolo na mbuzi. <verse eid="MAT 25:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 25:33"/>Nayo koweka wanhu watendile goyolonda Imulungu mwambu wa mkono wake wa kudila na wanhu watendile gehile mwambu wa kumoso. <verse eid="MAT 25:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 25:34"/>Abaho Mndewa kowalongela waja wakalile mwambu wa mkono wake wa kudila, ‘Izoni mweye munogeligwe na Tatangu! Bokeleni uhazi wenu, undewa umutandiligwe tangu kulumbigwa kwa isi. <verse eid="MAT 25:34"/><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 25:35"/>Ng'hala na nzala mweye mungwaa ndiya, ng'hala na ng'hilu mweye mungwaa mazi, ng'hala mgeni mweye mumbokela mzing'anda zenu. <verse eid="MAT 25:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 25:36"/>Ng'hala mwazi mweye mumvaza, ng'hala mtamu mweye mwiza kundola, ng'hala ngodekigwe mkifungo mweye mwiza kundola.’<verse eid="MAT 25:36"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 25:37"/>“Wanhu watendile goyolonda Imulungu omwidika, ‘Mndewa, kipindi gani tukona kuna nzala na tukugwaa ndiya, hebu kuna ng'hilu na tukugwaa mazi? <verse eid="MAT 25:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 25:38"/>Kipindi gani viukalile mgeni na tukubokela mzing'anda zetu, hebu viukalile mwazi na siye tukuvaza? <verse eid="MAT 25:38"/><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 25:39"/>Kipindi gani tukona mtamu hebu kugodekigwa mkifungo, twiza kukulola?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 25:40"/>Mndewa kokwidika, ‘Nowalongela fulu ipile, chochose kimumtendele imoja wa ndugu zangu awo weli wadodo, munhendela niye!’<verse eid="MAT 25:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 25:41"/>“Abaho kowalongela waja weli mwambu wa kumoso, ‘Segeleni kumwangu, mweye muduwiligwe! Muchole kuna umoto haufaga, uyekiligwe Mwenembago na wasenga zake! <verse eid="MAT 25:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 25:42"/>Ng'hala na nzala mweye hamungwelele ndiya, ng'hala na ng'hilu mweye hamungwelele mazi, <verse eid="MAT 25:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 25:43"/>ng'hala mgeni mweye hamumbokele bule mzing'anda zenu, ng'hala mwazi mweye hamnivazile bule, ng'hala mtamu na mkifungo mweye hamwizile kundola.’<verse eid="MAT 25:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 25:44"/>“Abaho omwidika, ‘Mndewa, kipindi gani tukona kuna nzala hebu ng'hilu hebu kwa mgeni hebu kwa mwazi hebu kwa mtamu hebu mkifungo na siye hatukutazile bule?’ <verse eid="MAT 25:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 25:45"/>Mndewa kokwidika, ‘Nowalongela fulu ipile, chochose hamumtendele imoja wa wanhu awo iwadodo, hamunhendele niye.’ <verse eid="MAT 25:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 25:46"/>Wano ogaligwa mmagazo ga milele, lakini waja watendile goyolonda Imulungu ogenda muugima wa milele.”<verse eid="MAT 25:46"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 25"/>
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="MAT 26"/>
  <para style="s">Kiseto cha kumkoma Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:1-2">Maluko 14:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luka 22:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yohana 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 26:1"/>Yesu viyamambukize kuwafundiza mbuli zino zose, kawalongela wanahina zake, <verse eid="MAT 26:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 26:2"/>“Kamba vimujuwile zahabita siku mbili kokuwa na nyimwilinyimwili ya Pasaka, abaho Mwana wa Munhu kogogigwa ili yawambigwe mumsalaba.”<verse eid="MAT 26:2"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 26:3"/>Abaho wakulu wa walava nhosa na wavele waiting'hana hamoja mna uluhelengo lwa Mkulu wa walava nhosa, yakemigwe Kayafa. <verse eid="MAT 26:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 26:4"/>Na wakala kiseto wamgoge Yesu kinyelegezi abaho wamkome. <verse eid="MAT 26:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 26:5"/>Walonga, “Lakini sikututende avo kipindi cha nyimwilinyimwili ya Pasaka, buleavo wanhu oding'huka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:5"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kobakigwa mavuta ako Betania</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:3-9">Maluko 14:3-9</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yohana 12:1-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 26:6"/>Yesu kakala Betania mng'anda ya Simoni, munhu yakalile na utamu wa dikulu. <verse eid="MAT 26:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 26:7"/>Yesu viyakalile koja, mtwanzi imoja kamcholela na nyhupa ya alabasita<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Alabasita ni dibwe da bei ng'hulu</char></note> imemile mavuta gonung'hila goya ga bei ng'hulu, kamgidila Yesu mdipala. <verse eid="MAT 26:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 26:8"/>Wanahina viwonile avo wagevuzika. Wauza, “Unanzi gani uno?” <verse eid="MAT 26:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 26:9"/>“Mavuta gano gahauzigwe kwa bei ng'hulu na zisente wahagweleligwe wakiwa!”<verse eid="MAT 26:9"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 26:10"/>Yesu kajuwa kiwakalile olonga, avo kawalongela, “Habali momgaza mtwanzi ino? Niye kanitendela mbuli inogile. <verse eid="MAT 26:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 26:11"/>Wanhu wakiwa mokala nao siku zose, lakini honda mukale na niye siku zose. <verse eid="MAT 26:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 26:12"/>Viyakalile yonigidila mavuta mulukuli lwangu, kalutanda lukuli lwangu kwa kuzikigwa. <verse eid="MAT 26:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 26:13"/>Avo nowalongeleni ukweli, kokose konda ipetigwe Mbuli Inogile mwiisi, kino kiyatendile mtwanzi ino cholongigwa, avo wanhu omkumbuka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:13"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yuda kotogola kumuhinduka Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:10-11">Maluko 14:10-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luka 22:3-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 26:14"/>Abaho imoja wa wanahina longo na wabili yakemigwe Yuda Isikaliote kachola kwa wakulu wa walava nhosa. <verse eid="MAT 26:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 26:15"/>Kawauza, “Monigwaa sente ngapi nahamuhinduka Yesu kumwenu?” Avo wampetela sente malongo madatu wamgwaa. <verse eid="MAT 26:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 26:16"/>Kusongela aho Yuda kazahila nzila ya kumwika Yesu mmakono gao.<verse eid="MAT 26:16"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu koja ndiya ya Pasaka na wanahina zake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Maluko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luka 22:7-13</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:21-23">21-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Yohana 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 26:17"/>Mna isiku ya ichanduso ya Nyimwilinyimwili ya Magate hagageligwe Usasu, wanahina wamcholela Yesu wamuuza, “Kolonda tukutandile kwahi indiya ya Pasaka?”<verse eid="MAT 26:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 26:18"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Choleni kunadibuga kwa munhu imoja, na mumulongele, ‘Mfundiza kolonga, saa yangu ivika, niye na wanahina zangu todeng'helela Pasaka mng'anda yako.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 26:19"/>Wanahina watenda kamba Yesu viyawalongele, waitanda ndiya ya Pasaka.<verse eid="MAT 26:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 26:20"/>Viivikile ichungulo, Yesu na wanahina zake longo na wabili wakala hasi waje. <verse eid="MAT 26:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 26:21"/>Viwakalile oja Yesu kawalongela, “Nowalongela ukweli, imoja wenu konihinduka.”<verse eid="MAT 26:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 26:22"/>Wanahina zake wanyawanyawa, wasonga kumuuza, imoja imoja, “Mndewa, kolonga niye?”<verse eid="MAT 26:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 26:23"/>Yesu kawedika, “Ija yozanhika tonge mbakuli hamoja na niye ayo yonda yanihinduke. <verse eid="MAT 26:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 26:24"/>Mwana wa Munhu kofa kamba Maandiko Gang'alile vigolonga, lakini kogaya munhu ija yomuhinduka Mwana wa Munhu! Yahanogile ng'hani kamba munhu ayo sambi yavumbuke.”<verse eid="MAT 26:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 26:25"/>Yuda, ayo yonda yamuhinduke Yesu, kamuuza, “Mfundiza! Vino kolonga niye?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:25">Yesu kamwidika, “Ona, iyo gweye kamba viulongile.”<verse eid="MAT 26:25"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ndiya ya Mndewa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Maluko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-20">Luka 22:14-20</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 Wakolinto 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 26:26"/>Viwakalile oja, Yesu kasola gate, kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu, abaho kadibanzula, kawagwaa wanahina zake, kalonga, “Soleni muje, uno ulo lukuli lwangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:26"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 26:27"/>Abaho kasola kikasi cha divai, kamgwaa nhogolwa Imulungu, kawagwaa wanahina zake, kalonga, “Mose ing'wileni kikasi kino. <verse eid="MAT 26:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 26:28"/>Ino ayo damu yangu ya lagano, ikwitika mbuli ya wengi ili nzambi zao zigeligwe kumgongo. <verse eid="MAT 26:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 26:29"/>Nowalongela, kusongela sambi honda ning'we kabili divai mbaka siku ija vondaning'we divai ya sambi na mweye Muundewa wa Tatangu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:29"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 26:30"/>Abaho wemba lwila, wachola kuna Ulugongo lwa Mizeituni.<verse eid="MAT 26:30"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kolagula Petulo kombela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Maluko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luka 22:31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yohana 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 26:31"/>Abaho Yesu kawalongela, “Kilo cha lelo mweye mose mokimbila na kundeka niiyeka, kwavija yandikigwa, Imulungu kalonga, ‘Nomtowa Msusilaji, na bumbila da ng'hondolo dopwililika.’ <verse eid="MAT 26:31"/><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 26:32"/>Lakini nahazilibuka, nowalongolela kuchola Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:32"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 26:33"/>Petulo kamwidika, “Hata kamba wose wahakuleka, niye sikuleka bule!”<verse eid="MAT 26:33"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 26:34"/>Yesu kamulongela Petulo, “Nokulongela ukweli, kilo cha lelo, nzogolo yang'hali hana kwika konibela miyanza midatu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 26:35"/>Petulo kamwidika, “Silonga avo bule, hata kamba nahafa na gweye!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:35">Na wanahina wayagwe walonga vivo.<verse eid="MAT 26:35"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kompula Imulungu ako Getisemane</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Maluko 14:32-42</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luka 22:39-46</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 26:36"/>Abaho Yesu na wanahina zake kachola hanhu hokemigwa Getisemane, kawalongela, “Kaleni hano, niye nogenda haja kumpula Imulungu.” <verse eid="MAT 26:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 26:37"/>Kawasola Petulo na wana wabili wa Zebedayo. Kasonga kona usungu na kunyunyuwala. <verse eid="MAT 26:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 26:38"/>Ako kawalongela, “Usungu uli muumoyo wangu mkulu ng'hani odaha kung'homa. Kaleni hano meso hamoja na niye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 26:39"/>Abaho kachola hamwande kidogo, kaibwanha hasi, kampula Imulungu, “Tatangu, kamba yahadahika, unisegesele kikasi kino cha madununzo! Lakini siyo kamba vinilonda niye, ila viulonda gweye.”<verse eid="MAT 26:39"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 26:40"/>Abaho kabwela kawavika waja wanahina zake wadatu wawasa, kamulongela Petulo, “Vino hamudahile kukala meso na niye hata saa dimoja? <verse eid="MAT 26:40"/><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 26:41"/>Kaleni meso mumpule Imulungu sikumwingile mna ukugezigwa, moyo wa munhu olonda kutenda ganogile, lakini lukuli lwabule nguvu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:41"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 26:42"/>Kachola lwa kabili kumpula Imulungu, kalonga, “Tatangu, kamba haidahika kukisegesa kikasi kino cha madununzo mbaka niking'wile, viulonda gweye ilawilile.” <verse eid="MAT 26:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 26:43"/>Viyabwelile kabili kawavika wanahina zake wawasa, kwavija meso gao gakala na utulo.<verse eid="MAT 26:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 26:44"/>Abaho Yesu kawaleka kabili, kachola kampula Imulungu mwanza wa kadatu, kalonga mbuli zizija. <verse eid="MAT 26:44"/><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 26:45"/>Kawabwelela wanahina zake kawauza, “Mung'hali muwasa na kubwihila? Loleni, kipindi cha Mwana wa Munhu kwikigwa mmakono ga wanhu wene nzambi kivika. <verse eid="MAT 26:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 26:46"/>Lamukeni, tuchole! Loleni, munhu yonihinduka kavika!”<verse eid="MAT 26:46"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogogigwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Maluko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luka 22:47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yohana 18:3-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 26:47"/>Yesu yang'hali kogendelela kulonga, imoja wa wanahina zake longo na wabili, yakemigwe Yuda Isikaliote kavika. Keza na lunhu lutumigwe na wakulu wa walava nhosa na wavele kuno wapapa mapanga na malungu. <verse eid="MAT 26:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 26:48"/>Ayo yomuhinduka Yesu kawagwaa kilaguso, kawalongela, “Munhu yonda nimnonele ayo yummulonda. Mgogeni!”<verse eid="MAT 26:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 26:49"/>Bahaja Yuda kamcholela Yesu kalonga, “Mfundiza, zihoze.” Abaho kamnonela.<verse eid="MAT 26:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 26:50"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Mbwiga, tenda kikugalile!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:50">Abaho weza wamgoga Yesu, wamgodeka. <verse eid="MAT 26:50"/><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 26:51"/>Imoja wa waja wakalile na Yesu, kasomola panga jake kamkanha digwiti msang'hanaji wa Mkulu wa walava nhosa. <verse eid="MAT 26:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 26:52"/>Yesu kamulongela, “Bweza panga jako muna iyala, kwavija munhu yoyose yoitowa na miyage kwa panga kofa kwa panga. <verse eid="MAT 26:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 26:53"/>Vino hamujuwile bule maza nilondile nahampulile Tatangu yanhaze, nayo bahobaho yahagalile mabumbila makulu kubanza longo na mabili ga wasenga wa kuulanga wanhaze? <verse eid="MAT 26:53"/><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 26:54"/>Lakini golawililaze Maandiko Gang'alile golonga, yolondigwa ilawilile?”<verse eid="MAT 26:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 26:55"/>Abaho Yesu kalulongela ulunhu, “Mwiza kungoga na mapanga na malungu kamba vija nambavi? Kipindi chose ng'hala nifundiza Mng'anda ya Imulungu, lakini hamngogile bule. <verse eid="MAT 26:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 26:56"/>Mbuli zino zitendeka ili Maandiko Gang'alile gawandike watula ndagu wa Imulungu galawilile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:56">Baho wanahina wose wamuleka wakimbila.<verse eid="MAT 26:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kamkitala</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:53-65">Maluko 14:53-65</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luka 22:54-55</ref>, <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yohana 18:13-14</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 26:57"/>Waja wamgogile Yesu wamgala mng'anda ya Kayafa, yakalile Mkulu wa walava nhosa, baho wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na wavele waiting'hana hamoja. <verse eid="MAT 26:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 26:58"/>Petulo kamkweleleza kwa kutali mbaka kuuluwa lwa Mkulu wa walava nhosa, kengila mgati kakala hamoja na wakalizi ili yalole choni cholawilila. <verse eid="MAT 26:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 26:59"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa na wanhu wa mkitala cha Wayahudi wazahila usindila wa uvizi wamkome Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 26:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 26:60"/>Wanhu wayagwe weza kulonga uvizi mbuli yake, lakini hawapatile mbuli yoyose. Abaho wanhu wabili walawilila, <verse eid="MAT 26:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 26:61"/>walonga, “Munhu ino kalonga, ‘Noibomola Ng'anda ya Imulungu na kuizenga kabili kwa siku ndatu.’ ”<verse eid="MAT 26:61"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 26:62"/>Mkulu wa walava nhosa kenuka kamulongela Yesu, “Kuduhu cha kuwedika kwa kitala choolava wanhu wano?” <verse eid="MAT 26:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 26:63"/>Lakini Yesu kanyamala tuluu, Mkulu wa walava nhosa kamulongela, “Kwa twaga da Imulungu yeli mgima nolonda uiduwile, tulongele kamba gweye kwa Kilisito Mkombola, Mwana wa Imulungu.”<verse eid="MAT 26:63"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 26:64"/>Yesu kamwidika, “Ona, vivo viulonga. Lakini nowalongeleni wose, kulawa sambi momona Mwana wa Munhu kakala muukulu mwambu wa mkono wa kudila wa Imulungu yeli na udahi, kokwiza mna gamawingu ga kuulanga!”<verse eid="MAT 26:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 26:65"/>Bahaja Mkulu wa walava nhosa kakidega kiwalo chake, kalonga, “Kaliga! Hatulonda usindila uyagwe? Mumuhulika viyaligile! <verse eid="MAT 26:65"/><verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 26:66"/>Mweye mogesaze?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:66">Awo wamwidika, “Kabananga, kolondigwa yakomigwe.”<verse eid="MAT 26:66"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="MAT 26:67"/>Abaho wamtemela mate mna ikihanga wamtowa, na wayagwe wamtowa ng'hofi. <verse eid="MAT 26:67"/><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MAT 26:68"/>Kuno olonga, “Gweye Kilisito Mkombola lagula. Nani yakutowile?”<verse eid="MAT 26:68"/></para>
  <para style="s">Petulo kombela Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">Maluko 14:66-72</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:56-62">Luka 22:56-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yohana 18:15-18</ref>, <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="MAT 26:69"/>Petulo kakala yakalile mulubuga, msang'hanaji wa kitwanzi kamcholela, kamulongela, “Gweye vivija kukala hamoja na Yesu wa Galilaya.”<verse eid="MAT 26:69"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="MAT 26:70"/>Lakini Petulo kabela haulongozi ha wose, kalonga, “Sikijuwile kiulonga.” <verse eid="MAT 26:70"/><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MAT 26:71"/>Viyakalile kolawa kunze ya umulango, ako kaiting'hana na msang'hanaji iyagwe wa kitwanzi kamona na kawalongela wanhu, “Munhu ino nayo kakala hamoja na Yesu wa Nazaleti.”<verse eid="MAT 26:71"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="MAT 26:72"/>Petulo kabela kabili, kalonga, “Noiduwila simjuwile munhu ino!”<verse eid="MAT 26:72"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="MAT 26:73"/>Hamwande kidogo, wanhu wakalile wemile aho wamcholela Petulo wamulongela, “Kweli gweye vivija kwa imoja wao, kwavija ulonzi wako olagusa kamba gweye kolawa Galilaya!”<verse eid="MAT 26:73"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="MAT 26:74"/>Abaho Petulo kalonga, Imulungu kojuwa nolonga ukweli, niduwiligwe nahalonga uvizi, “Simjuwile munhu ayo!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 26:74">Bahaja nzogolo keka <verse eid="MAT 26:74"/><verse number="75" style="v" sid="MAT 26:75"/>na Petulo kakumbuka mbuli ziyalongeligwe na Yesu, “Nzogolo yang'hali hana kwika konibela miyanza midatu.” Kachola kunze kalila kwa usungu.<verse eid="MAT 26:75"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 26"/>
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="MAT 27"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kogaligwa kwa Pilato</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:1">Maluko 15:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-2">Luka 23:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-32">Yohana 18:28-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 27:1"/>Imitootondo, wakulu wa walava nhosa wose na wavele wakala kiseto cha kumkoma Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 27:2"/>Wamgodeka nzabi, wamulongoza na wamwika mmakono ga Pilato, mkulu wa isi ya Lumi.<verse eid="MAT 27:2"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 1:18-19">Sang'hano 1:18-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 27:3"/>Yuda, ija yamuhinduke Yesu, viyonile Yesu katagusigwa, kona usungu kazibweza zisente malongo madatu kwa wakulu wa walava nhosa na wavele. <verse eid="MAT 27:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 27:4"/>Kawalongela, “Nhenda nzambi kwa kumuhinduka munhu yatendile ganogile yakomigwe!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:4">Lakini wao wamwidika, “Ajo jako wiiyeka, siye twamduhu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 27:5"/>Yuda kazasa zisente Mng'anda ya Imulungu kasegela, abaho kachola kaibota mwenyego kwa luzabi.<verse eid="MAT 27:5"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 27:6"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa wazidondola zisente walonga, “Malagizo getu gogomesa kuzika sente zino mna ikiya cha kwikila sente kili Mng'anda ya Imulungu, kwavija sente zino za damu.” <verse eid="MAT 27:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 27:7"/>Abaho waitogolela, wasola zisente wagula mgunda wa mulumba, uwe hanhu ha kuzikila wageni. <verse eid="MAT 27:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 27:8"/>Lekaavo mbaka lelo mgunda awo okemigwa, “Mgunda wa Damu.”<verse eid="MAT 27:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 27:9"/>Avo kilawilila kija kiyalongile mtula ndagu wa Imulungu Yelemia, “Wasola sente malongo madatu, sente ziwaitogolele wanhu wa Izilaeli kumuliha. <verse eid="MAT 27:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 27:10"/>Wazigulila mgunda wa mulumba, kamba Mndewa viyanilagize.”<verse eid="MAT 27:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Pilato komuuza Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:2-5">Maluko 15:2-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:3-5">Luka 23:3-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:33-38">Yohana 18:33-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 27:11"/>Yesu kema haulongozi wa mkulu wa isi, nayo kamuuza, “Gweye kwa Mndewa wa Wayahudi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:11">Yesu kamwidika, “Ona, vivo viulonga.” <verse eid="MAT 27:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 27:12"/>Lakini wakulu wa walava nhosa na wavele viwamulavile vitala, Yesu hawedike mbuli.<verse eid="MAT 27:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 27:13"/>Avo Pilato kamuuza, “Vino gweye huhulika vitala vose viwolonga kumwako?”<verse eid="MAT 27:13"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 27:14"/>Lakini Yesu hedike mbuli yoyose, na mkulu ayo kakanganya ng'hani.<verse eid="MAT 27:14"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kotagusigwa yafe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Maluko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luka 23:13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Yohana 18:39-19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 27:15"/>Yahavikaga Nyimwilinyimwili ya Pasaka mkulu wa isi komfungulila mfungwa imoja, wamulondile wanhu. <verse eid="MAT 27:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 27:16"/>Mna ikipindi acho kukala na mfungwa imoja yajuwike ng'hani, twaga jake Balaba. <verse eid="MAT 27:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 27:17"/>Avo lunhu lwa wanhu viluiting'hane, Pilato kawauza, “Molonda nimfungulile nani? Balaba hebu Yesu yokemigwa Kilisito Mkombola?” <verse eid="MAT 27:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 27:18"/>Pilato kajuwa goya kamba Wayahudi wamgela Yesu mmakono gake, kwavija wamonela migongo.<verse eid="MAT 27:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 27:19"/>Pilato viyakalile mna ikigoda cha nhaguso, mwehe wake kamtumila usenga, “Sikuumtendele chochose munhu ayo hatendile gehile, kwavija nigaya ng'hani mzinzozi mbuli yake.”<verse eid="MAT 27:19"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 27:20"/>Lakini wakulu wa walava nhosa na wavele, waluding'hula lunhu lwa wanhu lumpule Pilato yamfungulile Balaba na kumkoma Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MAT 27:21"/>Pilato kaluuza kabili lunhu luja, “Mna iwano wabili molonda nimfungulile nani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:21">Wamwidika, “Balaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MAT 27:22"/>Pilato kawauza, “Nhende choni kwa Yesu yokemigwa Kilisito Mkombola?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:22">Wamwidika, “Muwambe mumsalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:22"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MAT 27:23"/>Pilato kawauza, “Vino katenda kinhu gani kihile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MAT 27:23">Lakini wao wagendelela kukemelela, “Muwambe mumsalaba!”<verse eid="MAT 27:23"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MAT 27:24"/>Pilato viyone hadaha kutenda mbuli yoyose, na wanhu wasonga kuding'huka, kasola mazi, kasunha makono gake mgameso ga lunhu luja, kalonga, “Niye namduhu kwa damu ya munhu ino, ajo jenu wenyego!”<verse eid="MAT 27:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MAT 27:25"/>Lunhu lose lwa wanhu lwidika, “Damu yake ikale uchanha yetu na uchanha mwa wanetu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MAT 27:26"/>Pilato kamfungulila Balaba, abaho kalagiza Yesu yatoigwe mbalati na kamgela mmakono gao yawambigwe mumsalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:26"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wakalizi omzeha Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:16-20">Maluko 15:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yohana 19:2-3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MAT 27:27"/>Abaho wakalizi wa Pilato wamgala Yesu mng'anda ya Mndewa, na wakalizi wose wamzunguluka. <verse eid="MAT 27:27"/><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MAT 27:28"/>Wamvula viwalo vake na wamvaza kiwalo cha undewa. <verse eid="MAT 27:28"/><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MAT 27:29"/>Waluka ngata ya miba waika mdipala jake, na mkongoja mumkono wake wa kudila. Abaho wamfugamila kwa kumzeha, walonga, “Mwinyi, Mndewa wa Wayahudi!” <verse eid="MAT 27:29"/><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MAT 27:30"/>Abaho wamtemela mate na wasola umkongoja wamtowa towa nao mdipala. <verse eid="MAT 27:30"/><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MAT 27:31"/>Viwamambukize kumzeha, wamvula ikiwalo cha undewa wamvaza viwalo vake. Abaho wamgala yawambigwe mumsalaba.<verse eid="MAT 27:31"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowambigwa mumsalaba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Maluko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luka 23:26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yohana 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MAT 27:32"/>Viwakalile ochola, wamting'hana munhu imoja mwenekae wa Kilene, twaga jake Simoni, wakalizi wamnanahiza yaupape msalaba wa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:32"/><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MAT 27:33"/>Wavika hanhu hokemigwa Goligota, fambulo jake, “Hanhu ha Fumvu da Pala”. <verse eid="MAT 27:33"/><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MAT 27:34"/>Wamgwaa Yesu divai ihanganyigwe na kinhu kili usungu, lakini viyailanzile, kalema kung'wa.<verse eid="MAT 27:34"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MAT 27:35"/>Wamuwamba Yesu mumsalaba, waigolela viwalo vake kwa kubwanha simbi. <verse eid="MAT 27:35"/><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MAT 27:36"/>Abaho wakala hasi omkaliza. <verse eid="MAT 27:36"/><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MAT 27:37"/>Uchanha ya msalaba wake wakika kibao chandikigwe kilamuso cha kutagusigwa kwake, “Ino ayo Yesu, Mndewa wa Wayahudi.” <verse eid="MAT 27:37"/><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MAT 27:38"/>Abaho wawawamba wabavi wabili hamoja na Yesu, imoja mwambu wa mkono wake wa kudila na iyagwe mwambu wa kumoso.<verse eid="MAT 27:38"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MAT 27:39"/>Wanhu wakalile obita watigisa mapala gao na kumuliga Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:39"/><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MAT 27:40"/>Walonga, “Hambe gweye kulonga koibomola Ng'anda ya Imulungu na kuizenga kabili kwa siku ndatu! Lelo humuluka mumsalaba uikombole mwenyego kamba gweye kwa Mwana wa Imulungu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:40"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MAT 27:41"/>Vivija wakulu wa walava nhosa na wafundiza Malagizo ga Musa na wavele wamzeha Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:41"/><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MAT 27:42"/>Walonga, “Kawakombola wayagwe, lelo hadahile vilihi kuikombola mwenyego! Vino ino siyo Mndewa wa wanhu wa Izilaeli? Lelo yahahumuluka mumsalaba tomtogola! <verse eid="MAT 27:42"/><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MAT 27:43"/>Kamtamanila Imulungu na kalonga kamba heyo Mwana wa Imulungu. Lelo lekeni tulole kamba Imulungu komuhonya!”<verse eid="MAT 27:43"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="MAT 27:44"/>Vivija na waja wabokaji wawambigwe hamoja na Yesu, wamuliga.<verse eid="MAT 27:44"/></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Maluko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luka 23:44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yohana 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MAT 27:45"/>Viivikile saa sita imisi isi yose ikala igubikigwe na ziza totolo, ziza dijo dikala kwa masaa madatu. <verse eid="MAT 27:45"/><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MAT 27:46"/>Viivikile saa tisa imisi Yesu kalila kwa sauti ng'hulu, “Eloi Eloi lama sabakitani?” Fambulo jake, “Imulungu wangu, Imulungu wangu, habali kundeka?”<verse eid="MAT 27:46"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="MAT 27:47"/>Lakini wanhu wayagwe wemile aho viwahulike, walonga, “Komkema Eliya!” <verse eid="MAT 27:47"/><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MAT 27:48"/>Bahaja munhu imoja kakimbila kasola dodoki, kadivabika mwiidivai, kadinanika mulubiki kamgwaa Yesu yadifonze.<verse eid="MAT 27:48"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="MAT 27:49"/>Abaho wanhu wayagwe walonga, “Mulekeni, tulole kamba Eliya kokwiza kumkombola!”<verse eid="MAT 27:49"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MAT 27:50"/>Abaho Yesu kalila kabili kwa sauti ng'hulu, kafa.<verse eid="MAT 27:50"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="MAT 27:51"/>Bahaja panziya da Ng'anda ya Imulungu digola gati da Ng'anda ya Imulungu na hanhu hong'ala ng'hani, didegeka mhande mbili, kulawa uchanha mbaka hasi. Isi itigisika na mibwe itulika. <verse eid="MAT 27:51"/><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MAT 27:52"/>Mapanga gafunhuka na wanhu wengi wa Imulungu wakalile wafile wazilibuka. <verse eid="MAT 27:52"/><verse number="53" style="v" sid="MAT 27:53"/>Walawa mna gamapanga, na Yesu viyazilibuke wachola Yelusalemu kudibuga ding'alile, na wanhu wengi wawona.<verse eid="MAT 27:53"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="MAT 27:54"/>Mkulu wa wakalizi na wakalizi wakalile omkaliza Yesu, viwayone isi yotigisika na mbuli ziyagwe zilawilile, wadumba ng'hani na kulonga, “Kweli ino kakala Mwana wa Imulungu!”<verse eid="MAT 27:54"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MAT 27:55"/>Baho kukala na watwanzi wengi, omulola kwa kutali. Watwanzi awo wakala omkweleleza Yesu kulawa Galilaya na wamtaza. <verse eid="MAT 27:55"/><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MAT 27:56"/>Mna iwao kakala Malia Magidalena, Malia mamao Yakobo na Yusufu na mwehe wa Zebedayo.<verse eid="MAT 27:56"/></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzikigwa kwa Yesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Maluko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luka 23:50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yohana 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="MAT 27:57"/>Viivikile ichungulo, keza munhu imoja tajili mwenekae wa Alimataya, twaga jake Yusufu, nayo vivija kakala mwanahina wa Yesu. <verse eid="MAT 27:57"/><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MAT 27:58"/>Kamcholela Pilato, kampula lukuli lwa Yesu, Pilato kalagiza yagweleligwe. <verse eid="MAT 27:58"/><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MAT 27:59"/>Yusufu kalusola ulukuli, kaluzingiliza sitili ya sambi, <verse eid="MAT 27:59"/><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MAT 27:60"/>na kalwika mdipanga jake mwenyego da sambi yadisongole mdibwe. Abaho kabimbilisa dibwe kulu kadigubika mmulomo wa dipanga kasegela. <verse eid="MAT 27:60"/><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MAT 27:61"/>Malia Magidalena na Malia iyagwe wakala aho odilola dipanga.<verse eid="MAT 27:61"/></para>
  <para style="s">Wakalizi hana dipanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="MAT 27:62"/>Imitondo yake, ikala siku ya Kubwihila, wakulu wa walava nhosa na Mafalisayo wachola kwa Pilato. <verse eid="MAT 27:62"/><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MAT 27:63"/>Wamulongela, “Go mkulu, tomkumbuka, munhu ija cha uvizi viyakalile mgima kalonga, ‘Zahavika siku ndatu nozilibuka.’ <verse eid="MAT 27:63"/><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MAT 27:64"/>Avo lagiza panga jake dikalizigwe mbaka siku ya kadatu, ili wanahina zake sikuwachole kulwiba ulukuli, abaho wawalongele wanhu kamba kazilibuka. Avo uvizi uno wa ikimambukizo okwiha ng'hani kubanza uja wa ichanduso.”<verse eid="MAT 27:64"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="MAT 27:65"/>Pilato kawalongela, “Soleni wakalizi, mkadikalize dipanga kamba vimulonda.”<verse eid="MAT 27:65"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MAT 27:66"/>Avo wasegela wadikaliza dipanga na wakanda kilaguso mna idibwe na wawaleka wakalizi wadikalize.<verse eid="MAT 27:66"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 27"/>
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="MAT 28"/>
  <para style="s">Yesu kozilibuka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:1-10">Maluko 16:1-10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luka 24:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yohana 20:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MAT 28:1"/>Viimalile siku ya Kubwihila, siku ya jumapili, Malia Magidalena na Malia ija iyagwe waidamuka wachola kudilola dipanga. <verse eid="MAT 28:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MAT 28:2"/>Bahaja isi ikala yotigisika ng'hani, na msenga wa kuulanga wa Mndewa kahumuluka kuulanga, kadibimbilisa idibwe hamgwazo, na kadikalila. <verse eid="MAT 28:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MAT 28:3"/>Koneka kamba lumwesa, na viwalo vake vikala vizelu chuwee. <verse eid="MAT 28:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MAT 28:4"/>Wakalizi wamdumba ng'hani avo wakala ogwaya, wakala kamba wanhu wafile.<verse eid="MAT 28:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MAT 28:5"/>Msenga wa kuulanga kawalongela iwatwanzi, “Sikumudumbe, kwavija nojuwa momzahila Yesu yawambigwe mumsalaba. <verse eid="MAT 28:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MAT 28:6"/>Kahaduhu hano, kazilibuka kamba viyalongile. Izoni mulole hanhu hawamwikile. <verse eid="MAT 28:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MAT 28:7"/>Choleni himahima mkawalongele wanahina zake, ‘Yesu kazilibuka kulawa kwa wafile na kowalongolela kuchola Galilaya, kuko momona!’ Uno awo usenga wangu kumwenu.”<verse eid="MAT 28:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MAT 28:8"/>Avo watwanzi waja wasegela himahima kudipanga, kuno odumba na kudeng'helela, wakimbila kuwalongela wanahina zake.<verse eid="MAT 28:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MAT 28:9"/>Bahaja Yesu kawating'hana, kawalamusa, “Zihozeni.” Wamcholela wamgoga magulu gake, wamtambikila. <verse eid="MAT 28:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MAT 28:10"/>Yesu kawalongela, “Sikumudumbe. Choleni mkawalongele ndugu zangu wachole Galilaya, kuko onyona.”<verse eid="MAT 28:10"/></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga wa wakalizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MAT 28:11"/>Watwanzi waja viwakalile mnzila, wakalizi wayagwe wachola kudibuga na kuwalongela wakulu wa walava nhosa kila kinhu kilawilile. <verse eid="MAT 28:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MAT 28:12"/>Wakulu wa walava nhosa viwaiting'hane hamoja na wavele waitogolela mbuli, wawagwaa waja iwakalizi sente nyingi. <verse eid="MAT 28:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MAT 28:13"/>Wawalongela, “Longeni, wanahina zake weza ikilo kulwiba ulukuli vimukalile muwasile. <verse eid="MAT 28:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MAT 28:14"/>Avo mkulu wa isi yahaihulika mbuli ino, siye tolonga nayo, na mweye hamwingila mna dizumozumo.”<verse eid="MAT 28:14"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MAT 28:15"/>Avo wakalizi wazisola zisente na watenda kamba viwalongeligwe. Avo mbuli ino ayo yenele kwa Wayahudi mbaka lelo.<verse eid="MAT 28:15"/></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kowalawilila wanahina zake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Maluko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:36-49">Luka 24:36-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Yohana 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Sang'hano 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MAT 28:16"/>Abaho wanahina longo na imoja wachola kukigongo mwiisi ya Galilaya, ako kuyawalongele Yesu wachole. <verse eid="MAT 28:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MAT 28:17"/>Viwamonile, wamtambikila, kuno wayagwe wanyawanyawa. <verse eid="MAT 28:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MAT 28:18"/>Yesu kawezila, kawalongela, “Nigweleligwa udahi wose wa kuulanga na mwiisi. <verse eid="MAT 28:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MAT 28:19"/>Avo gendeni mkawatende wanhu wa isi zose wawe wanahina zangu, muwabatize kwa twaga da Tata na Mwana na Loho Yang'alile, <verse eid="MAT 28:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MAT 28:20"/>na muwafundize wagoge kila kinhu kiniwalagizeni, na niye nokuwa hamoja na mweye siku zose mbaka kukimambukizo cha isi.”<verse eid="MAT 28:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="MAT 28"/>
</usx>
